Bots mit Rust","Automatische Dokumentation mit rustdoc"],"pt":["Criação de bots de Discord sem infraestrutura","Utilização de técnicas de IA para desenvolvedores","Integração com a plataforma Discord","Desenvolvimento de bots personalizados","Suporte a comandos e eventos personalizados"],"ru":["Создание ботов Discord без инфраструктуры","Использование техник ИИ для разработчиков","Интеграция с платформой Discord","Разработка индивидуальных ботов","Поддержка пользовательских команд и событий"],"ar":["إنشاء بوتات ديسكورد بدون بنية تحتية","استخدام تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","التكامل مع منصة ديسكورد","تنمية بوتات مخصصة","دعم أوامر وأحداث مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rustdoc教程","Discord机器人开发","AI工具比较","Rustdoc安装","Discord机器人设置指南","如何使用Rustdoc","Rustdoc与其他AI工具的区别"],"ja":["Rustdocチュートリアル","Discordボット開発","AIエージェント比較","Rustdocインストール","Discordボット設定ガイド","Rustdocの使い方","Rustdocと他のAIエージェントの違い"],"ko":["Rustdoc 튜토리얼","디스코드 봇 개발","AI 에이전트 비교","Rustdoc 설치","디스코드 봇 설정 가이드","Rustdoc 사용 방법","Rustdoc과 다른 AI 에이전트의 차이점"],"es":["herramientas de AI","rustdoc","bots de Discord","creación de bots","infraestructura de bots","desarrollo de bots con Rust","documentación automática","API de Discord","comandos personalizados","eventos personalizados"],"fr":["outils IA","rustdoc","bots Discord","création de bots","infrastructure de bots","développement de bots avec Rust","documentation automatique","API Discord","commandes personnalisées","événements personnalisés"],"de":["KI-Tools","rustdoc","Discord-Bots","Erstellung von Bots","Infrastruktur von Bots","Entwicklung von Bots mit Rust","automatische Dokumentation","Discord-API","benutzerdefinierte Befehle","benutzerdefinierte Ereignisse"],"pt":["como usar rustdoc","o que é rustdoc","rustdoc vs outras ferramentas","instalar rustdoc","guia de configuração do rustdoc","desenvolvimento de bots de Discord","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","rustdoc para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать rustdoc","что такое rustdoc","rustdoc vs другие инструменты","установить rustdoc","руководство по настройке rustdoc","разработка ботов Discord","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","rustdoc для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام rustdoc","ما هو rustdoc","rustdoc مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت rustdoc","دليل إعداد rustdoc","تنمية بوتات ديسكورد","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","rustdoc للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"uwu","repo":"flora","repoPath":"uwu/flora","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.122Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rustdoc","description":"Rust documentation conventions (RFC 1574). Apply when writing doc comments on public Rust items. Covers summary sentences, section headings, type references, and examples.","bodyPreview":"# Rust Documentation Conventions (RFC 1574)\n\nApply these rules when writing doc comments (`///`) on public Rust items.\n\n## Summary Sentence\n\nEvery doc comment starts with a single-line summary sentence.\n\n```rust\n// DO: third person singular present indicative, ends with period\n/// Returns the length of the string.\n/// Creates a new instance with default settings.\n/// Parses the input and returns the result.\n\n// DON''T: imperative, missing period, or verbose\n/// Return the length of the string\n///","body":"# Rust Documentation Conventions (RFC 1574)\n\nApply these rules when writing doc comments (`///`) on public Rust items.\n\n## Summary Sentence\n\nEvery doc comment starts with a single-line summary sentence.\n\n```rust\n// DO: third person singular present indicative, ends with period\n/// Returns the length of the string.\n/// Creates a new instance with default settings.\n/// Parses the input and returns the result.\n\n// DON''T: imperative, missing period, or verbose\n/// Return the length of the string\n/// This function creates a new instance with default settings.\n/// Use this to parse the input and get the result back.\n```\n\n## Comment Style\n\nUse line comments, not block comments.\n\n```rust\n// DO\n/// Summary sentence here.\n///\n/// More details if needed.\n\n// DON''T\n/**\n * Summary sentence here.\n *\n * More details if needed.\n */\n```\n\nUse `//!` only for crate-level and module-level docs at the top of the file.\n\n## Section Headings\n\nUse these exact headings (always plural):\n\n```rust\n/// Summary sentence.\n///\n/// # Examples\n///\n/// # Panics\n///\n/// # Errors\n///\n/// # Safety\n///\n/// # Aborts\n///\n/// # Undefined Behavior\n```\n\n```rust\n// DO\n/// # Examples\n\n// DON''T\n/// # Example\n/// ## Examples\n/// **Examples:**\n```\n\n## Type References\n\nUse full generic forms and link with reference-style markdown.\n\n```rust\n// DO\n/// Returns [`Option<T>`] if the value exists.\n///\n/// [`Option<T>`]: std::option::Option\n\n// DON''T\n/// Returns `Option` if the value exists.\n/// Returns an optional value.\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nEvery public item should have examples showing usage.\n\n````rust\n/// Adds two numbers together.\n///\n/// # Examples\n///\n/// ```\n/// let result = my_crate::add(2, 3);\n/// assert_eq!(result, 5);\n/// ```\npub fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {\n    a + b\n}\n````\n\nFor multiple patterns:\n\n````rust\n/// Parses a string into a number.\n///\n/// # Examples\n///\n/// Basic usage:\n///\n/// ```\n/// let n: i32 = my_crate::parse(\"42\").unwrap();\n/// assert_eq!(n, 42);\n/// ```\n///\n/// Handling errors:\n///\n/// ```\n/// let result = my_crate::parse::<i32>(\"not a number\");\n/// assert!(result.is_err());\n/// ```\n````\n\n## Errors Section\n\nDocument what errors can be returned and when.\n\n```rust\n/// Reads a file from disk.\n///\n/// # Errors\n///\n/// Returns [`io::Error`] if the file does not exist or cannot be read.\n///\n/// [`io::Error`]: std::io::Error\n```\n\n## Panics Section\n\nDocument conditions that cause panics.\n\n```rust\n/// Divides two numbers.\n///\n/// # Panics\n///\n/// Panics if `divisor` is zero.\npub fn divide(dividend: i32, divisor: i32) -> i32 {\n    assert!(divisor != 0, \"divisor must not be zero\");\n    dividend / divisor\n}\n```\n\n## Safety Section\n\nRequired for `unsafe` functions.\n\n```rust\n/// Dereferences a raw pointer.\n///\n/// # Safety\n///\n/// The pointer must be non-null and properly aligned.\n/// The pointed-to memory must be valid for the lifetime `''a`.\npub unsafe fn deref<''a, T>(ptr: *const T) -> &''a T {\n    &*ptr\n}\n```\n\n## Module vs Type Docs\n\n- Module docs (`//!`): high-level summaries, when to use this module\n- Type docs (`///`): comprehensive, self-contained\n\nSome duplication is acceptable.\n\n## Language\n\nUse American English spelling: \"color\" not \"colour\", \"serialize\" not \"serialise\".\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:41.954Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust Development Agents needing high-quality documentation generation.","zh":"非常适合需要生成高质量文档的 Rust 开发智能体。","ja":"高品質なドキュメント生成を必要とする Rust 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고품질 문서 생성이 필요한 Rust 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Rust que necesitan generar documentación de alta calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement Rust ayant besoin d''une génération de documentation de haute qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-Entwicklungs-Agents, die eine hochwertige Dokumentationsgenerierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Rust que necessitam de geração de documentação de alta qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Разработки на Rust, которым требуется генерация высококачественной документации.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير Rust الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وثائق عالية الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write standardized doc comments using Rust Documentation Conventions, following RFC 1574 guidelines and utilizing triple slash (///) syntax for public Rust items, ensuring clarity and consistency in documentation.","zh":"使智能体能够遵循 RFC 1574 指南，使用 Rust 文档约定编写标准化文档注释，利用三斜杠 (///) 语法处理公共 Rust 项，确保文档的清晰性和一致性。","ja":"RFC 1574 ガイドラインに従い、Rust ドキュメント規約を使用して標準化されたドキュメントコメントを記述し、公開 Rust アイテムにはトリプルスラッシュ (///) 構文を利用することで、ドキュメントの明確さと一貫性を確保するようにエージェントを強化します。","ko":"RFC 1574 가이드라인을 준수하고, 공개 Rust 항목에 대해 삼중 슬래시(///) 구문을 활용하여 표준화된 문서 주석을 작성함으로써 문서의 명확성과 일관성을 보장하도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agents escribir comentarios de documentación estandarizados utilizando las Convenciones de Documentación de Rust, siguiendo las directrices de RFC 1574 y utilizando la sintaxis de triple barra (///) para elementos públicos de Rust, garantizando claridad y consistencia en la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des commentaires de documentation standardisés en utilisant les Conventions de Documentation Rust, en suivant les directives RFC 1574 et en utilisant la syntaxe triple slash (///) pour les éléments publics Rust, assurant ainsi clarté et cohérence dans la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, standardisierte Dokumentationskommentare unter Verwendung der Rust Documentation Conventions zu schreiben, indem sie die RFC 1574-Richtlinien befolgen und die Triple-Slash (///)-Syntax für öffentliche Rust-Items verwenden, wodurch Klarheit und Konsistenz in der Dokumentation sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a escrever comentários de documentação padronizados usando as Convenções de Documentação do Rust, seguindo as diretrizes da RFC 1574 e utilizando a sintaxe de barra tripla (///) para itens públicos Rust, garantindo clareza e consistência na documentação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам писать стандартизированные комментарии документации, используя Соглашения по Документированию Rust, следуя рекомендациям RFC 1574 и используя синтаксис тройного слэша (///) для публичных элементов Rust, обеспечивая ясность и последовательность документации.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من كتابة تعليقات وثائق قياسية باستخدام اتفاقيات توثيق Rust، باتباع إرشادات RFC 1574 واستخدام بناء جملة الشرطة المائلة الثلاثية (///) للعناصر العامة في Rust، مما يضمن الوضوح والاتساق في التوثيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating summary sentences for public Rust items","Applying documentation conventions for Rust projects","Creating consistent doc comments for Rust codebases"],"zh":["为公共 Rust 项生成摘要句子","为 Rust 项目应用文档约定","为 Rust 代码库创建一致的文档注释"],"ja":["公開 Rust アイテムの要約文の生成","Rust プロジェクトへのドキュメント規約の適用","Rust コードベースの一貫性のあるドキュメントコメントの作成"],"ko":["공개 Rust 항목에 대한 요약 문장 생성","Rust 프로젝트에 문서 규약 적용","Rust 코드베이스의 일관된 문서 주석 생성"],"es":["Generar frases de resumen para elementos públicos de Rust","Aplicar convenciones de documentación para proyectos Rust","Crear comentarios de documentación consistentes para bases de código Rust"],"fr":["Générer des phrases de résumé pour les éléments publics Rust","Appliquer les conventions de documentation pour les projets Rust","Créer des commentaires de documentation cohérents pour les bases de code Rust"],"de":["Generieren von Zusammenfassungssätzen für öffentliche Rust-Items","Anwenden von Dokumentationskonventionen für Rust-Projekte","Erstellen konsistenter Dokumentationskommentare für Rust-Codebasen"],"pt":["Geração de frases de resumo para itens públicos Rust","Aplicação de convenções de documentação para projetos Rust","Criação de comentários de documentação consistentes para bases de código Rust"],"ru":["Генерация кратких описаний для публичных элементов Rust","Применение соглашений по документированию для проектов на Rust","Создание последовательных комментариев документации для кодовых баз на Rust"],"ar":["إنشاء جمل ملخصة للعناصر العامة في Rust","تطبيق اتفاقيات التوثيق لمشاريع Rust","إنشاء تعليقات وثائق متسقة لقواعد كود Rust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Rust Documentation Conventions","Specific to Rust programming language","Limited to doc comment generation"],"zh":["需要遵守 Rust 文档约定","特定于 Rust 编程语言","仅限于文档注释生成"],"ja":["Rust ドキュメント規約の遵守が必要","Rust プログラミング言語に特化","ドキュメントコメント生成に限定"],"ko":["Rust 문서 규약 준수 필요","Rust 프로그래밍 언어에 특화됨","문서 주석 생성으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a las Convenciones de Documentación de Rust","Específico para el lenguaje de programación Rust","Limitado a la generación de comentarios de documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect des Conventions de Documentation Rust","Spécifique au langage de programation Rust","Limité à la génération de commentaires de documentation"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Rust Documentation Conventions","Spezifisch für die Programmiersprache Rust","Beschränkt sich auf die Generierung von Dokumentationskommentaren"],"pt":["Requer adesão às Convenções de Documentação do Rust","Específico para a linguagem de programação Rust","Limitado à geração de comentários de documentação"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Соглашений по Документированию Rust","Специфично для языка программирования Rust","Ограничено генерацией комментариев документации"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام باتفاقيات توثيق Rust","مخصصة بلغة البرمجة Rust","مقتصرة على إنشاء تعليقات التوثيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e98bcd1db4a98ae378833ddda62fb160c017479feae64aa138d2e04baa2f2836","qualityScore":48}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kryptobaseddev/openclaw-cleo/sherpa-onnx-tts', 'community', 'kryptobaseddev', 'openclaw-cleo', 'kryptobaseddev/openclaw-cleo', 'sherpa-onnx-tts', 0, 0, 48, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.143Z', '2026-03-02T03:44:28.573Z', '4ed0e7d7b7711ccfece96fd8a13faade7ba97339c56df963490b7afe2418eb1b', '{"id":"kryptobaseddev/openclaw-cleo/sherpa-onnx-tts","name":"sherpa-onnx-tts","description":{"zh":"Sherpa Onnx TTS是一个超级OpenClaw安装工具，支持Proxmox，集成CLEO任务管理、Doppler秘密和NGINX Proxy Manager","ja":"Sherpa Onnx TTSは、Proxmoxをサポートする超パフォーマンスOpenClawインストーラーで、CLEOタスク管理、Dopplerシークレット、NGINX Proxy Managerを統合","ko":"Sherpa Onnx TTS는 Proxmox를 지원하는 초고성능 OpenClaw 설치 프로그램으로 CLEO 작업 관리, Doppler 비밀 및 NGINX 프록시 관리자를 통합","es":"Sherpa ONNX TTS es una herramienta de instalación para Proxmox que utiliza CLEO y Doppler para una gestión de tareas eficiente","fr":"Sherpa ONNX TTS est un outil d''installation pour Proxmox qui utilise CLEO et Doppler pour une gestion de tâches efficace","de":"Sherpa ONNX TTS ist ein Installations-Tool für Proxmox, das CLEO und Doppler für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung verwendet","pt":"O sherpa-onnx-tts é uma ferramenta de IA para Proxmox que inclui Doppler secrets, NGINX Proxy Manager e provisionamento automático de LXC.","ru":"sherpa-onnx-tts - это ИИ Агент для Proxmox, включающий Doppler secrets, NGINX Proxy Manager и автоматическое обеспечение LXC.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي sherpa-onnx-tts لبروكسيموكس تتضمن Doppler secrets و NGINX Proxy Manager و توفير LXC آلي.","en":"Super-powered OpenClaw installer for Proxmox, powered by CLEO task management. Includes Doppler secrets, NGINX Proxy Manager integration, and automated LXC provisioning."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：Sherpa Onnx TTS","ja":"AIエージェント：Sherpa Onnx TTS","ko":"AI 에이전트: Sherpa Onnx TTS","es":"Herramientas de AI: Sherpa ONNX TTS para Proxmox","fr":"Outils IA: She