profunda para resultados personalizados"],"fr":["Recherche approfondie avec Pokee AI","Résultats précis et détaillés","Idéal pour les développeurs et les projets de recherche","Intégration avec OpenClaw","API de recherche approfondie pour résultats personnalisés"],"de":["Tiefe Recherche mit Pokee AI","Präzise und detaillierte Ergebnisse","Ideal für Entwickler und Forschungsprojekte","Integration mit OpenClaw","Deep-Research-API für personalisierte Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Pesquisa profunda com Pokee AI","Desenvolvido com OpenClaw","Auxílio em pesquisas complexas","Resultados precisos e rápidos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Глубокое исследование с Pokee AI","Разработан с OpenClaw","Помощь в сложных исследованиях","Точные и быстрые результаты","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["بحث متقدم باستخدام Pokee AI","تم تطويره باستخدام OpenClaw","مساعدة في البحث المتقدم","نتائج دقيقة وسريعة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tinman AI智能代理","Pokee AI深度研究API","OpenClaw技能","深入研究","AI工具","如何使用Tinman","Tinman替代品","Tinman安装","Tinman设置指南"],"ja":["Tinman AIエージェント","Pokee AI深度研究API","OpenClawスキル","深い分析","AIエージェント","Tinmanの使い方","Tinmanの代替","Tinmanのインストール","Tinmanの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Tinman AI 에이전트","Pokee AI 심층 연구 API","OpenClaw 스킬","심도 있는 연구","AI 에이전트","Tinman 사용법","Tinman 대안","Tinman 설치","Tinman 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar tinman","qué es tinman","herramientas de AI para investigación","alternativas a tinman","tinman vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de tinman","guía de configuración de tinman"],"fr":["comment utiliser tinman","qu''est-ce que tinman","outils d''IA pour recherche","alternatives à tinman","tinman vs autres outils d''IA","installation de tinman","guide de configuration de tinman"],"de":["wie man tinman verwendet","was ist tinman","KI-Tools für Recherche","Alternativen zu tinman","tinman vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von tinman","Konfigurationsanleitung für tinman"],"pt":["como usar Tinman","o que é Tinman","ferramentas de pesquisa profunda","Tinman vs outras ferramentas","instalar Tinman","guia de configuração do Tinman"],"ru":["как использовать Tinman","что такое Tinman","инструменты глубокого исследования","Tinman vs другие инструменты","установить Tinman","руководство по настройке Tinman"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Tinman","ما هي Tinman","أدوات البحث المتقدم","Tinman مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Tinman","دليل إعداد Tinman"]}},"owner":"Niraven","repo":"pokee-deep-research-skill","repoPath":"Niraven/pokee-deep-research-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.150Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tinman","description":"Security auditing and hardening for OpenClaw and system infrastructure.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Tinman\n\nSecurity auditing and hardening for OpenClaw and system infrastructure.\n\n## Security Levels\n\n| Level | Description | Response |\n|-------|-------------|----------|\n| **S0** | Info | Log only |\n| **S1** | Low | Notify user |\n| **S2** | Medium | Alert + recommend fix |\n| **S3** | High | Immediate action required |\n| **S4** | Critical | Stop + notify immediately |\n\n## Checks\n\n### OpenClaw Security\n\n| Check | Risk | Action |\n|-------|------|--------|\n| Credentials in git | S3 | Add to .giti","body":"# Tinman\n\nSecurity auditing and hardening for OpenClaw and system infrastructure.\n\n## Security Levels\n\n| Level | Description | Response |\n|-------|-------------|----------|\n| **S0** | Info | Log only |\n| **S1** | Low | Notify user |\n| **S2** | Medium | Alert + recommend fix |\n| **S3** | High | Immediate action required |\n| **S4** | Critical | Stop + notify immediately |\n\n## Checks\n\n### OpenClaw Security\n\n| Check | Risk | Action |\n|-------|------|--------|\n| Credentials in git | S3 | Add to .gitignore, rotate |\n| Token expiration | S2 | Refresh tokens |\n| Exposed secrets | S4 | Rotate immediately |\n| Uncommitted changes | S1 | Review + commit |\n\n### System Security\n\n| Check | Risk | Action |\n|-------|------|--------|\n| SSH password auth | S2 | Disable, use keys only |\n| Open ports | S1 | Review with `ss -tlnp` |\n| Unattended upgrades | S2 | Enable automatic updates |\n| Firewall status | S2 | Verify ufw/iptables |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Security Scan\n\n```bash\n# Check for credentials in git\ngit log --all --full-history -- .credentials/\n\n# Check file permissions\nls -la ~/.credentials/\n\n# Check SSH config\ncat /etc/ssh/sshd_config | grep -E \"PasswordAuthentication|PermitRootLogin\"\n```\n\n### 2. Report Generation\n\n```markdown\n## Security Audit Report\n**Date:** 2026-02-20\n**Scope:** OpenClaw + System\n\n### Findings\n| Level | Issue | Recommendation |\n|-------|-------|----------------|\n| S2 | Token expires in 3 days | Refresh Google OAuth |\n\n### Actions Taken\n- [x] Verified .credentials/ permissions (600)\n- [ ] Refresh expiring tokens\n```\n\n### 3. Automated Monitoring\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"daily-security-check\",\n  \"schedule\": {\"kind\": \"cron\", \"expr\": \"0 6 * * *\"},\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n    \"message\": \"Run tinman security scan. Check: credential perms, token expiration, git secrets. Report S2+ issues.\"\n  },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n  \"notify\": true\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Credential hygiene** — 600 permissions, never in git\n2. **Token rotation** — Before expiration\n3. **Regular audits** — Weekly automated scans\n4. **Principle of least privilege** — Minimal permissions\n5. **Audit logging** — Track all changes\n\n## Emergency Response\n\nIf S4 (Critical) detected:\n\n1. **Stop** — Halt related operations\n2. **Assess** — Scope of exposure\n3. **Rotate** — Change all affected credentials\n4. **Review** — How did it happen\n5. **Prevent** — Update processes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:41.024Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-focused AI Agents requiring advanced threat detection and system hardening capabilities, particularly those integrating with OpenClaw and Pokee AI''s Deep Research API.","zh":"适用于需要高级威胁检测和系统加固能力的安全性焦点的AI代理，特别是那些与OpenClaw和Pokee AI的Deep Research API集成的代理。","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、高度な脅威検出とシステムの強化機能を必要とする場合に適しています。特に、OpenClawとPokee AIのDeep Research APIと統合するものに適しています。","ko":"보안에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 고급 위협 탐지 및 시스템 강화 기능을 필요로 하는 경우 적합합니다. 특히 OpenClaw 및 Pokee AI의 Deep Research API와 통합하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA con enfoque en seguridad que requieren capacidades de detección de amenazas avanzadas y endurecimiento del sistema, particularmente aquellos que se integran con OpenClaw y la API de Investigación Profunda de Pokee AI.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur la sécurité nécessitant une détection de menaces avancée et des capacités de durcissement du système, en particulier ceux qui s''intègrent à OpenClaw et à l''API de recherche approfondie de Pokee AI.","de":"Ideal für Sicherheits-orientierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Bedrohungserkennungs- und Systemhärtungsfähigkeiten erfordern, insbesondere solche, die in OpenClaw und Pokee AI''s Deep Research API integriert sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de AI focados em segurança que exigem detecção avançada de ameaças e capacidades de endurecimento de sistema, particularmente aqueles que integram com OpenClaw e Pokee AI''s Deep Research API.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на безопасность, требующих продвинутой детекции угроз и возможностей системы защиты, особенно тех, которые интегрируют с OpenClaw и Pokee AI''s Deep Research API.","ar":"مثالي لويبوتات AI التي تركز على الأمن وتطلب كشف متقدم للتهديدات وقدرات نظام الحماية، خاصة تلك التي تدمج مع OpenClaw وPokee AI''s Deep Research API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive security audits and harden OpenClaw infrastructure against potential threats, utilizing a tiered security level system (S0-S4) and implementing checks such as detecting credentials in git, thereby enhancing overall system security and resilience through immediate action and notification protocols.","zh":"赋予代理执行全面安全审计和加固OpenClaw基础设施以防御潜在威胁的能力，利用分层安全级别系统（S0-S4）并实施检测git中的凭据等检查，从而通过立即采取行动和通知协议提高整个系统的安全性和弹性。","ja":"エージェントに、OpenClawインフラストラクチャを潜在的な脅威から保護するための、包括的なセキュリティ監査の実行と、階層化されたセキュリティレベルシステム（S0-S4）を利用して、git内の資格情報の検出などのチェックを実施する機能を提供します。さらに、即時の措置と通知プロトコルを通じて、全体的なシステムのセキュリティと耐久性を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 보안 감사를 수행하고 OpenClaw 인프라를 잠재적인 위협으로부터 강화할 수 있도록 하며, 계층화된 보안 수준 시스템(S0-S4)을 사용하고 git 내 자격 증명 감지 등의 확인을 구현하여 즉각적인 조치 및 알림 프로토콜을 통해 전체 시스템의 보안 및 내구성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar auditorías de seguridad integrales y endurecer la infraestructura de OpenClaw contra amenazas potenciales, utilizando un sistema de nivel de seguridad en varios niveles (S0-S4) e implementando controles como la detección de credenciales en git, mejorando así la seguridad y la resistencia del sistema en general a través de protocolos de acción y notificación inmediatos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité complets et de renforcer l''infrastructure OpenClaw contre les menaces potentielles, en utilisant un système de niveau de sécurité en plusieurs niveaux (S0-S4) et en mettant en œuvre des contrôles tels que la détection des informations d''identification dans git, améliorant ainsi la sécurité et la résilience globales du système grâce à des protocoles d''action et de notification immédiate.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits durchzuführen und die OpenClaw-Infrastruktur gegen potenzielle Bedrohungen zu härten, indem ein gestuftes Sicherheitsniveausystem (S0-S4) verwendet und Kontrollen wie die Erkennung von Anmeldeinformationen in git implementiert werden, wodurch die Gesamtsicherheit und Widerstandsfähigkeit des Systems durch unmittelbare Handlungs- und Benachrichtigungsprotokolle verbessert werden.","pt":"Empodera agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes e endurecer infraestrutura de OpenClaw contra possíveis ameaças, utilizando um sistema de nível de segurança em tier (S0-S4) e implementando verificações como detectar credenciais em git, assim melhorando a segurança e resiliência do sistema como um todo.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность проводить комплексные аудиты безопасности и укреплять инфраструктуру OpenClaw против потенциальных угроз, используя систему уровня безопасности в несколько ступений (S0-S4) и реализуя проверки, такие как обнаружение учетных данных в git, тем самым повышая общую безопасность и резилиентность системы.","ar":"يمنح وحدات الإدارة possibilité réaliser des audits de sécurité abrangentes et renforcer l''infrastructure de OpenClaw contre des menaces potentielles, en utilisant un système de niveau de sécurité en plusieurs niveaux (S0-S4) et en implémentant des vérifications comme détecter des informations d''identification en git, ce qui améliore la sécurité et la résilience du système dans son ensemble."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits for OpenClaw systems","Hardening infrastructure against high-risk threats (S3-S4)","Implementing notification protocols for security breaches"],"zh":["为OpenClaw系统自动化安全审计","加固基础设施以对抗高风险威胁（S3-S4）","实施安全漏洞通知协议"],"ja":["OpenClawシステムのセキュリティ監査の自動化","高リスクの脅威（S3-S4）に対するインフラストラクチャの強化","セキュリティ違反の通知プロトコルの実施"],"ko":["OpenClaw 시스템의 보안 감사를 자동화하는 것","고위험 위협(S3-S4)에 대한 인프라의 강화","보안 침해에 대한 알림 프로토콜의 구현"],"es":["Automatización de auditorías de seguridad para sistemas OpenClaw","Endurecimiento de la infraestructura contra amenazas de alto riesgo (S3-S4)","Implementación de protocolos de notificación para violaciones de seguridad"],"fr":["Automatisation des audits de sécurité pour les systèmes OpenClaw","Renforcement de l''infrastructure contre les menaces à haut risque (S3-S4)","Mise en œuvre de protocoles de notification pour les violations de sécurité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für OpenClaw-Systeme","Härtung der Infrastruktur gegen Bedrohungen mit hohem Risiko (S3-S4)","Implementierung von Benachrichtigungsprotokollen für Sicherheitsverletzungen"],"pt":["Automando auditorias de segurança para sistemas de OpenClaw","Endurecendo infraestrutura contra ameaças de alto risco (S3-S4)","Implementando protocolos de notificação para violações de segurança"],"ru":["Автоматизируя аудиты безопасности для систем OpenClaw","Укрепляя инфраструктуру против угроз высокого риска (S3-S4)","Реализуя протоколы уведомления для нарушений безопасности"],"ar":["تأمل منwijة أمنية لويبوتات OpenClaw","تأمل منwijة أمنية لويبوتات OpenClaw","تأمل منwijة أمنية لويبوتات OpenClaw"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with OpenClaw and Pokee AI''s Deep Research API","Dependent on accurate security level classification (S0-S4)"],"zh":["需要与OpenClaw和Pokee AI的Deep Research API集成","依赖于准确的安全级别分类（S0-S4）"],"ja":["OpenClawとPokee AIのDeep Research APIとの統合が必要","正確なセキュリティレベル分類（S0-S4）に依存"],"ko":["OpenClaw 및 Pokee AI의 Deep Research API와의 통합이 필요","정확한 보안 수준 분류(S0-S4)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con OpenClaw y la API de Investigación Profunda de Pokee AI","Dependiente de una clasificación de nivel de seguridad precisa (S0-S4)"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration à OpenClaw et à l''API de recherche approfondie de Pokee AI","Dépend d''une classification de niveau de sécurité précise (S0-S4)"],"de":["Erfordert Integration in OpenClaw und Pokee AI''s Deep Research API","Hängt von einer genauen Sicherheitsniveaubestimmung (S0-S4) ab"],"pt":["Requer integração com OpenClaw e Pokee AI''s Deep Research API","Depende de classificação de nível de segurança precisa (S0-S4)"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с OpenClaw и Pokee AI''s Deep Research API","Зависит от точной классификации уровня безопасности (S0-S4)"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع OpenClaw وPokee AI''s Deep Research API","يعتمد على تصنيف دقيق لمستوى الأمن (S0-S4)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f58f6ce2cb3d5ff8d7ca5a88c1e68c85a37e59125190de5945533750fdec000b","qualityScore":48}');
