ения","Отчеты о крахах и журналы ошибок","Интеграция с Django и Python","Поддержка devops и мониторинга производственной среды"],"ar":["تتبع الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي","تتبع أداء التطبيق","تقارير الأخطاء وتسجيلات الخطأ","التكامل مع Django و Python","دعم دووبس وتتبع الإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用setup-dev","什么是错误跟踪","setup-dev替代品","setup-dev vs Sentry","setup-dev安装指南","setup-dev设置教程","开发者工具","错误监控","性能优化"],"ja":["setup-devの使い方","エラートラッキングとは","setup-devの代替","setup-dev vs Sentry","setup-devのインストールガイド","setup-devの設定チュートリアル","開発者ツール","エラーモニタリング","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["setup-dev 사용법","오류 추적이란","setup-dev 대안","setup-dev vs Sentry","setup-dev 설치 가이드","setup-dev 설정 튜토리얼","개발자 도구","오류 모니터링","성능 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de seguimiento de errores","monitoreo de rendimiento","setup-dev","alternativas a sentry","guía de instalación de setup-dev","cómo usar setup-dev","monitoreo de seguridad","seguridad de aplicaciones","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["outils de suivi d''erreurs","monitoreo des performances","setup-dev","alternatives à sentry","guide d''installation de setup-dev","comment utiliser setup-dev","monitoreo de sécurité","sécurité des applications","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Fehlerverfolgungstools","Leistungsüberwachung","setup-dev","Alternativen zu sentry","Installationsanleitung für setup-dev","wie man setup-dev verwendet","Sicherheitsüberwachung","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["como usar setup-dev","o que é setup-dev","setup-dev vs sentry","instalar setup-dev","guia de configuração do setup-dev","alternativas ao setup-dev","monitoramento de erros em python","desempenho da aplicação em django"],"ru":["как использовать setup-dev","что такое setup-dev","setup-dev vs sentry","установить setup-dev","руководство по настройке setup-dev","альтернативы setup-dev","отслеживание ошибок в python","производительность приложения в django"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إعداد التطوير","ما هو إعداد التطوير","إعداد التطوير مقابل سينتري","تثبيت إعداد التطوير","دليل إعداد إعداد التطوير","بديل لإعداد التطوير","تتبع الأخطاء في بايثون","أداء التطبيق في ديجانغو"]}},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"sentry","repoPath":"getsentry/sentry","stars":43241,"forks":4615,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T00:30:12Z","topics":["apm","crash-reporting","crash-reports","csp-report","devops","django","error-logging","error-monitoring","fair-source","hacktoberfest","monitor","monitoring","python","sentry","tag-production"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup-dev","description":"Set up and manage the Sentry development environment using devenv. Handles fresh setup, updating existing environments, starting dev services, and troubleshooting. Use when asked to set up sentry, setup dev environment, get sentry running, start dev server, devenv setup, devservices not working, sentry wont start, or any development environment issue.","bodyPreview":"# Set Up Sentry Development Environment\n\nWalk the user through getting Sentry running locally. The full process from a bare machine takes **30-45 minutes** — most of that is downloading dependencies and Docker images. Set expectations clearly at each step.\n\n**AL MCP**: If the `al` MCP server is available, use `al_search_docs` and `al_read_doc` for detailed troubleshooting. The AL docs cover devenv, devservices, and common issues in depth. The AL server is part of the [devinfra-mcp](https://githu","body":"# Set Up Sentry Development Environment\n\nWalk the user through getting Sentry running locally. The full process from a bare machine takes **30-45 minutes** — most of that is downloading dependencies and Docker images. Set expectations clearly at each step.\n\n**AL MCP**: If the `al` MCP server is available, use `al_search_docs` and `al_read_doc` for detailed troubleshooting. The AL docs cover devenv, devservices, and common issues in depth. The AL server is part of the [devinfra-mcp](https://github.com/getsentry/devinfra-mcp) project — see that repo for setup instructions if the server isn''t configured yet. The SSE endpoint is configured in `.pi/mcp.json` (pi) or `.mcp.json` / `.cursor/mcp.json` (Claude Code / Cursor).\n\n## Step 1: Detect Current State\n\nBefore doing anything, assess what''s already installed. Run all of these:\n\n```bash\n# Check OS\nuname -s && uname -m\n\n# Check shell\necho $SHELL\n\n# Check if devenv exists\nwhich devenv 2>/dev/null || ls ~/.local/share/sentry-devenv/bin/devenv 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check devenv version (outdated versions cause failures)\ndevenv --version 2>/dev/null || ~/.local/share/sentry-devenv/bin/devenv --version 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check Docker runtime\ndocker context ls 2>/dev/null\ndocker info --format ''{{.Name}}'' 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check OrbStack\nwhich orbctl 2>/dev/null && orbctl status 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check Colima\nwhich colima 2>/dev/null && colima status 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check direnv\nwhich direnv 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check if repo is already set up\nls .venv/bin/sentry 2>/dev/null && ls node_modules/.bin 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nBased on results, skip to the appropriate step. If everything is installed, jump to Step 6.\n\n## Step 2: Install Prerequisites (macOS)\n\n### Xcode Command Line Tools\n\n```bash\nxcode-select -p 2>/dev/null || xcode-select --install\n```\n\nIf not installed, the user must complete the interactive install dialog (~10 min). Wait for it.\n\n### Homebrew\n\n```bash\nwhich brew || /bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)\"\n```\n\n### Docker Runtime — OrbStack or Colima\n\nAsk the user which they prefer. Explain the tradeoffs:\n\n| Runtime      | Pros                                                   | Cons                                                     |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Colima**   | Official Sentry recommendation, all scripts support it | Can have DNS issues on WiFi changes                      |\n| **OrbStack** | Faster, lower resource usage, better UI                | Some Sentry scripts assume Colima — may need workarounds |\n\n**If choosing OrbStack:**\n\n```bash\nbrew install --cask orbstack\n```\n\nThen start OrbStack from Applications. Verify: `docker info`\n\n**If choosing Colima:**\nColima gets installed by `devenv bootstrap` — no separate step needed.\n\n**Important**: Do NOT run Docker Desktop alongside either runtime — it causes conflicts.\n\n## Step 3: Install devenv\n\n```bash\n# For external (non-Sentry-employee) contributors:\n# export SENTRY_EXTERNAL_CONTRIBUTOR=1\n\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/getsentry/devenv/main/install-devenv.sh | bash\n```\n\nThis installs to `~/.local/share/sentry-devenv/bin/devenv`.\n\n### Shell Configuration\n\nThe user''s shell MUST have devenv on PATH and direnv hooked in. Check and fix:\n\n```bash\n# Check if already configured\ngrep -q \"sentry-devenv\" ~/.zshrc 2>/dev/null || grep -q \"sentry-devenv\" ~/.bashrc 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nIf not configured, add to the appropriate shell config (`~/.zshrc` for zsh, `~/.bashrc` for bash):\n\n```bash\n# devenv\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/share/sentry-devenv/bin:$PATH\"\n\n# direnv\neval \"$(direnv hook zsh)\"   # or: eval \"$(direnv hook bash)\"\n```\n\n**Tell the user to restart their terminal** (or `source ~/.zshrc`) after this change.\n\n### Verify devenv Version\n\nMinimum version changes frequently. If devenv is already installed, check it''s not outdated:\n\n```bash\ndevenv --version\n```\n\nIf the version is old (e.g., < 1.22), upgrade:\n\n```bash\ndevenv update\n```\n\nIf `devenv update` itself fails because the version is too old, reinstall:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/getsentry/devenv/main/install-devenv.sh | bash\n```\n\n## Step 4: Bootstrap (First Time Only)\n\nFor a completely fresh setup, run bootstrap first:\n\n```bash\ndevenv bootstrap\n```\n\nThis is interactive (~5 min) — it prompts for SSH keys, coderoot directory, etc. It installs Homebrew, Colima, Docker CLI, and direnv.\n\n**After bootstrap completes, close and reopen the terminal.**\n\n## Step 5: Sync the Environment\n\nThis is the longest step. Tell the user:\n\n> **This will take 10-20 minutes** on first run. It installs Python, Node, all pip/npm dependencies, and runs database migrations. Subsequent syncs are much faster (2-5 min).\n\n### If direnv hangs\n\nThe `.envrc` runs Docker checks. If the Docker runtime isn''t running, direnv will hang. Symptoms:\n\n```\ndirenv: ([...]/direnv export zsh) is taking a while to execute. Use CTRL-C to give up.\n```\n\n**Fix**: Start the Docker runtime first:\n\n- OrbStack: Open OrbStack.app or `open -a OrbStack`\n- Colima: `devenv colima start`\n\nThen `direnv allow` again.\n\n### Chicken-and-Egg Problem\n\ndirenv checks node version and sentry installation. On a fresh setup, these don''t exist yet, so direnv will fail. This is normal. **Bypass direnv and run devenv sync directly:**\n\n```bash\n~/.local/share/sentry-devenv/bin/devenv sync\n```\n\nOr if devenv is on PATH:\n\n```bash\ndevenv sync\n```\n\nAfter sync completes, `direnv allow` should succeed.\n\n### If devenv sync fails\n\nCommon causes:\n\n1. **Outdated devenv** — `devenv update` or reinstall\n2. **Docker not running** — start OrbStack/Colima first\n3. **Network issues** — retry; some downloads are large\n\nRun `devenv doctor` for automated diagnosis.\n\n## Step 6: Start Services\n\n### First: Start Docker Images\n\n```bash\ndevservices up\n```\n\n**⏱️ First run: 5-10 minutes.** It pulls many Docker images (PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka, ClickHouse, Snuba, Relay, etc.). This is a one-time cost. Tell the user:\n\n> This is downloading all the Docker images Sentry needs. It looks like a lot — that''s normal. Subsequent starts take ~30 seconds.\n\n**Subsequent runs: ~30 seconds.**\n\n### OrbStack Socket Issue\n\nIf `devservices up` or `devservices serve` fails with:\n\n```\nMake sure colima is running. Run `devenv colima start`.\n```\n\n...but the user is using OrbStack, the `devservices.py` command is checking for the Colima socket only. Check `src/sentry/runner/commands/devservices.py`:\n\n```bash\ngrep -n \"colima\\|docker.sock\\|orbstack\" src/sentry/runner/commands/devservices.py\n```\n\nThe `_find_docker_socket()` function needs to check multiple socket paths. On macOS it should try, in order:\n\n1. `~/.colima/default/docker.sock` (Colima)\n2. `~/.orbstack/run/docker.sock` (OrbStack)\n3. `/var/run/docker.sock` (Docker Desktop / default)\n\nIf only Colima is checked, patch it to support all runtimes. Read `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/references/orbstack-fix.md` for the exact pattern.\n\n### Then: Seed the Database\n\nIf this is a first-time setup, the database needs seeding:\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/sentry upgrade --noinput\n```\n\nThis runs all Django migrations AND creates default data (organizations, roles, projects). Without this, the dev server will 500 on every page.\n\n**Do NOT just run `sentry django migrate`** — that only runs migrations without seeding the required default data.\n\n### Create Superuser\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/sentry createuser --superuser --email admin@sentry.io --password admin --no-input\n```\n\n## Step 7: Start the Dev Server\n\n```bash\ndevservices serve\n```\n\nOr directly:\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/sentry devserver\n```\n\n### What to Expect on Startup\n\n**Kafka topic warnings are normal.** On first start, you''ll see many lines like:\n\n```\n[WARNING] sentry.batching-kafka-consumer: Topic ''taskworker'' or its partitions are not ready, retrying...\n```\n\nThese settle down after 30-60 seconds as Kafka auto-creates topics. Don''t panic.\n\n### Access the Dev Server\n\n- **URL**: http://dev.sentry.localhost:8000\n- **Login**: admin@sentry.io / admin\n\n### Required: Sentry Cookie Sync Extension\n\n**Without this extension, the UI shows a blank white screen.** Install it:\n\nhttps://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/sentry-cookie-sync/kchlmkcdfohlmobgojmipoppgpedhijh\n\nThis syncs auth cookies between sentry.io and dev.sentry.localhost. It''s not optional.\n\n## Day-to-Day Commands\n\nAfter initial setup, the daily workflow is:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Projects/sentry    # (or wherever the repo lives)\ndevservices up           # start background services (~30s)\ndevservices serve        # start dev server\n# → http://dev.sentry.localhost:8000\n```\n\nAfter pulling new code:\n\n```bash\ndevenv sync              # update dependencies + migrations (2-5 min)\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting Decision Tree\n\n| Symptom                                         | Likely Cause                              | Fix                                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| direnv hangs                                    | Docker runtime not running                | Start OrbStack / Colima                              |\n| `devenv sync` fails with version error          | Outdated devenv                           | `devenv update` or reinstall                         |\n| `devservices up` says \"colima not running\"      | Using OrbStack, script only checks Colima | Patch `devservices.py` — see Step 6                  |\n| Server 500s on every page                       | DB not seeded                             | `.venv/bin/sentry upgrade --noinput`                 |\n| `relation \"sentry_organization\" does not exist` | Migrations not run                        | `.venv/bin/sentry upgrade --noinput`                 |\n| White/blank screen in browser                   | Cookie Sync extension missing             | Install the Chrome extension                         |\n| Kafka topic warnings on startup                 | Normal first-boot behavior                | Wait 30-60 seconds                                   |\n| Port already in use                             | Stale containers                          | `docker rm -f $(docker ps -aq)` then retry           |\n| Everything is broken                            | Nuclear option                            | `devservices purge && devenv sync && devservices up` |\n| DNS failures in Docker                          | Colima DNS stale                          | `devenv doctor` or `devenv colima restart`           |\n\nFor deeper troubleshooting, use the AL MCP if available ([devinfra-mcp](https://github.com/getsentry/devinfra-mcp)):\n\n```\nal_search_docs(query=\"<symptom keywords>\")\nal_read_doc(path=\"devenv/troubleshooting.md\", query=\"<specific issue>\")\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:13:29.546Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Automation Agents tasked with local development environment provisioning.","zh":"适用于负责本地开发环境提供的DevOps自动化代理。","ja":"ローカル開発環境の提供を担当するDevOps自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"로컬 개발 환경 제공을 담당하는 DevOps 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de DevOps encargados de la provisión de entornos de desarrollo locales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps chargés de la provision de l''environnement de développement local.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Automatisierungsagenten, die mit der Bereitstellung von lokalen Entwicklungsumgebungen betraut sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de DevOps encarregados de provisionar ambientes de desenvolvimento local.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации DevOps, отвечающих за обеспечение локальной среды разработки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق آلي DevOps المكلف بتهيئة بيئة التطوير المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to automate the complete setup of a local Sentry development environment, including dependency installation and Docker container orchestration. This provides immediate access to error tracking and performance monitoring capabilities for development workflows.","zh":"使代理能够自动完成本地Sentry开发环境的设置，包括依赖安装和Docker容器编排。这为开发工作流提供了立即访问错误跟踪和性能监控功能。","ja":"エージェントがローカルのSentry開発環境の全設定を自動化できるようにし、依存関係のインストールやDockerコンテナのオーケストレーションを含む。これにより、開発ワークフローでエラートラッキングやパフォーマンスモニタリング機能に即座にアクセスできるようになる。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 Sentry 개발 환경의 전체 설정을 자동화할 수 있도록 하며, 이는 종속성 설치 및 Docker 컨테이너 오케스트레이션을 포함한다. 이는 개발 워크플로에서 오류 추적 및 성능 모니터링 기능에 즉시 액세스할 수 있도록 한다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la configuración completa de un entorno de desarrollo local de Sentry, incluida la instalación de dependencias y la orquestación de contenedores de Docker. Esto proporciona acceso inmediato a las capacidades de seguimiento de errores y monitoreo de rendimiento para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la configuration complète d''un environnement de développement local Sentry, y compris l''installation de dépendances et l''orchestration de conteneurs Docker. Cela fournit un accès immédiat aux capacités de suivi d''erreurs et de surveillance des performances pour les flux de travail de développement.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die vollständige Einrichtung einer lokalen Sentry-Entwicklungsumgebung zu automatisieren, einschließlich der Installation von Abhängigkeiten und der Orchestrierung von Docker-Containern. Dies bietet sofortigen Zugriff auf die Fähigkeiten zur Fehlerverfolgung und Leistungsüberwachung für Entwicklungswerkflüsse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem a configuração completa de um ambiente de desenvolvimento Sentry local, incluindo a instalação de dependências e a orquestração de contêineres Docker. Isso fornece acesso imediato às capacidades de acompanhamento de erros e monitoramento de desempenho para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать полную настройку локальной среды разработки Sentry, включая установку зависимостей и оркестровку контейнеров Docker. Это обеспечивает мгновенный доступ к возможностям отслеживания ошибок и мониторинга производительности для рабочих процессов разработки.","ar":"يمكن للعملاء توفير إمكانية وصول فورية إلى إمكانيات تتبع الأخطاء ومراقبة الأداء للتدفقات العملية التطويرية من خلال تمكين الوكلاء من تلقين تشغيل إعداد كامل للبيئة التطويرية المحلية Sentry، بما في ذلك تثبيت الإعتماديات وتنسيق حاويات Docker."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating local Sentry instance deployment","Troubleshooting development environment issues using AL MCP integration","Streamlining dependency and Docker image management"],"zh":["自动化本地Sentry实例部署","使用AL MCP集成进行开发环境问题排查","简化依赖和Docker镜像管理"],"ja":["ローカルのSentryインスタンスのデプロイの自動化","AL MCP統合を使用した開発環境の問題解決","依存関係とDockerイメージの管理の合理化"],"ko":["로컬 Sentry 인스턴스 배포 자동화","AL MCP 통합을 사용한 개발 환경 문제 해결","의존성 및 Docker 이미지 관리의 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de instancias locales de Sentry","Solución de problemas del entorno de desarrollo mediante la integración de AL MCP","Optimización de la gestión de dependencias y imágenes de Docker"],"fr":["Automatisation du déploiement d''instances locales de Sentry","Dépannage des problèmes d''environnement de développement à l''aide de l''intégration AL MCP","Optimisation de la gestion des dépendances et des images Docker"],"de":["Automatisierung der Bereitstellung lokaler Sentry-Instanzen","Behebung von Entwicklungsumgebungsproblemen mithilfe der AL-MCP-Integration","Optimierung der Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Docker-Images"],"pt":["Automatizar implantação de instâncias Sentry locais","Solucionar problemas de ambiente de desenvolvimento usando integração AL MCP","Otimizar gerenciamento de dependências e imagens Docker"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание локальных экземпляров Sentry","Устранять неполадки в среде разработки с помощью интеграции AL MCP","Оптимизировать управление зависимостями и образами Docker"],"ar":["توفير تلقين تشغيل الإنشاء الكامل للبيئة التطويرية المحلية Sentry","توفير إمكانية الوصول الفوري إلى إمكانيات تتبع الأخطاء ومراقبة الأداء للتدفقات العملية التطويرية","تطوير آلية تلقائية لتشغيل تطبيق العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker availability","Depends on AL MCP server for advanced troubleshooting","30-45 minute setup time for bare machines"],"zh":["需要Docker可用性","依赖AL MCP服务器进行高级故障排除","裸机的设置时间为30-45分钟"],"ja":["Dockerの利用可能性が必要","高度なトラブルシューティングにはAL MCPサーバーに依存","ベアメタルマシンのセットアップ時間は30〜45分"],"ko":["Docker 가용성이 필요함","고급 문제 해결을 위해 AL MCP 서버에 의존함","베어 메탈 머신의 설정 시간은 30-45분"],"es":["Requiere la disponibilidad de Docker","Depende del servidor AL MCP para la solución de problemas avanzada","Tiempo de configuración de 30-45 minutos para máquinas vacías"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité de Docker","Dépend du serveur AL MCP pour un dépannage avancé","Temps de configuration de 30 à 45 minutes pour les machines nues"],"de":["Erfordert die Verfügbarkeit von Docker","Hängt vom AL-MCP-Server für erweitertes Troubleshooting ab","Einrichtungszeit von 30-45 Minuten für Bare-Maschinen"],"pt":["Exige disponibilidade do Docker","Depende do servidor AL MCP para solução de problemas avançados","Tempo de configuração de 30-45 minutos para máquinas nuas"],"ru":["Требуется доступность Docker","Зависит от сервера AL MCP для расширенной устранения неполадок","Время настройки 30-45 минут для голых машин"],"ar":["يتطلب توفر Docker","يعتمد على خادم AL MCP لحل المشكلات المتقدمة","زمن إعداد 30-45 دقيقة للأجهزة النقية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"16d70bdcb50f227d358a1fbdb503a020844223b1922040c0f1451b1d0cd075b5","qualityScore":47}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mrmps/SMRY/mobile-design', 'community', 'mrmps', 'SMRY', 'mrmps/SMRY', 'mobile-design', 1232, 93, 47, '2026-02-24T04:10:53Z', '2026-02-26T08:27:12.856Z', 'ec74cda5e1954572e4282c3aaa9c1c32ec743cef83c53f8aef622c00dc8f0682', '{"id":"mrmps/SMRY/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"手机设计助手是一种AI智能工具，用于获取内容摘要和突破付费墙，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"モバイルデザインツールは、コンテンツの要約を取得し、ペイウォールを突破するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"모바일 디자인 도구는 콘텐츠 요약을 얻고 유료 장벽을 뚫는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El diseño móvil con Agentes de IA es una herramienta para resumir contenido y evitar paywalls de forma efectiva","fr":"La conception mobile avec Agents IA est un outil pour résumer le contenu et contourner les paywalls de manière efficace","de":"Das Mobile-Design mit KI-Agents ist ein Tool, um Inhalte zusammenzufassen und Paywalls effektiv zu umgehen","pt":"O agente de design móvel é uma ferramenta que ajuda a obter resumos e contornar paywalls","ru":"ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна - это инструмент, который помогает получать сводки и обходить платные стены","ar":"وكيل تصميم الموبايل هو أداة تساعد في الحصول على تلخيصات وتجاوز الجدران المدفوعة","en":"A tool to get summaries and get past paywalls"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 - 手机设计助手","ja":"AIエージェント - モバイルデザインツール","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 모바일 디자인 도구","es":"Herramientas de diseño móvil con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de conception mobile avec Agents IA","de":"Mobile-Design-Tools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de Design Móvel com Agente IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Мобильного Дизайна","ar":"أدوات تصميم موبايل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"手机设计助手是一种AI智能工具，用于获取内容摘要和突破付费墙，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"モバイルデザインツールは、コンテンツの要約を取得し、ペイウォールを突破するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"모바일 디자인 도구는 콘텐츠 요약을 얻고 유료 장벽을 뚫는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El diseño móvil con Agentes de IA es una herramienta para resumir contenido y evitar paywalls de forma efectiva","fr":"La conception mobile avec Agents IA est un outil pour résumer le contenu et contourner les paywalls de manière efficace","de":"Das Mobile-Design mit KI-Agents ist ein Tool, um Inhalte zusammenzufassen und Paywalls effektiv zu umgehen","pt":"O agente de design móvel é uma ferramenta que ajuda a obter resumos e contornar paywalls","ru":"ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна - это инструмент, который помогает получать сводки и обходить платные стены","ar":"وكيل تصميم الموبايل هو أداة تساعد في الحصول على تلخيصات وتجاوز الجدران المدفوعة","en":"A tool to get summaries and get past paywalls"},"definition":{"en":"A tool to get summaries and get past paywalls"},"features":{"zh":["使用AI技术获取内容摘要","突破付费墙，获取更多资源","提高开发效率，节省时间","支持多种开发语言和框架","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["AI技術を使用してコンテンツの要約を取得","ペイウォールを突破して更多のリソースを取得","開発の効率を向上させ、時間を節約","多くの開発言語とフレームワークをサポート","使用と統合が容易"],"ko":["인공 지능 기술을 사용하여 콘텐츠 요약을 얻기","유료 장벽을 뚫고 더 많은 리소스를 얻기","개발 효율을 향상시키고 시간을 절약하기","다수의 개발 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","사용과 통합이 용이"],"es":["Resumen de contenido","Evasión de paywalls","Diseño móvil optimizado","Integración con Agentes de IA","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Résumé de contenu","Contournement de paywalls","Conception mobile optimisée","Intégration avec Agents IA","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Inhaltszusammenfassung","Paywall-Umgehung","Optimiertes Mobile-Design","Integration mit KI-Agents","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Resumo de conteúdos","Contorno de paywalls","Integração com AI","Desenvolvimento de design móvel","Ferramenta de produtividade"],"ru":["Сводка контента","Обход платных стен","Интеграция с ИИ","Разработка мобильного дизайна","Инструмент для повышения производительности"],"ar":["تلخيص المحتوى","تجاوز الجدران المدفوعة","التكامل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصميم الموبايل","أداة لزيادة الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具","什么是AI智能工具","手机设计助手alternative","AI智能工具与其他工具的比较","AI智能工具安装","AI智能工具设置指南","使用AI智能工具进行开发","AI智能工具的优势"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントとは","モバイルデザインツールのalternative","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド","AIエージェントを使用した開発","AIエージェントの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","모바일 디자인 도구 alternative","AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트를 사용한 개발","AI 에이전트의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es el diseño móvil","alternativas a herramientas de diseño móvil","diseño móvil vs diseño web","instalación de herramientas de diseño móvil","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents IA","qu''est-ce que la conception mobile","alternatives aux outils de conception mobile","conception mobile vs conception web","installation d''outils de conception mobile","guide de configuration des Agents IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist das Mobile-Design","Alternativen zu Mobile-Design-Tools","Mobile-Design vs Web-Design","Installation von Mobile-Design-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar agente de design móvel","o que é agente de design móvel","agente de design móvel alternativa","agente de design móvel vs concorrentes","instalar agente de design móvel","guia de configuração do agente de design móvel","desenvolvimento de design móvel com AI","ferramentas de produtividade para designers"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна","что такое ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна","ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна альтернатива","ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна vs конкуренты","установить ИИ Агент для мобильного дизайна","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента для мобильного дизайна","разработка мобильного дизайна с ИИ","инструменты для повышения производительности дизайнеров"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل تصميم الموبايل","ما هو وكيل تصميم الموبايل","وكيل تصميم الموبايل بديل","وكيل تصميم الموبايل مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت وكيل تصميم الموبايل","دليل إعداد وكيل تصميم الموبايل","تصميم الموبايل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات لزيادة إنتاجية المصممين"]}},"owner":"mrmps","repo":"SMRY","repoPath":"mrmps/SMRY","stars":1232,"forks":93,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T04:10:53Z","topics":["ai","next13","openai"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:27:12.856Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful design principles.","zh":"非常适合需要触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重设计原则的UI/UX代理。","ja":"タッチファースト、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重の設計原則を必要とするUI/UXエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리 절약 및 플랫폼을 존중하는 디자인 원칙이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de UI/UX que necesitan principios de diseño de primera interacción táctil, conscientes de la batería y respetuosos con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin de principes de conception tactiles en premier, conscients de la batterie et respectueux de la plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die touch-first-, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende Designprinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes UI/UX que necessitam de princípios de design touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosos com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы принципы дизайна, ориентированные на сенсорный ввод, экономящие батарею и уважающие платформу.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء UI/UX الذين يحتاجون إلى مبادئ التصميم التي تضع اللمس أولاً وتحافظ على البطارية وتحترم المنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create mobile designs that respect platform choices, think within mobile constraints, and operate offline, utilizing Python scripts for mobile UX and touch audits, and adhering to a touch-first philosophy.","zh":"赋予代理创建移动设计的能力，使其尊重平台选择，在移动约束内思考，并离线运行，利用Python脚本进行移动UX和触摸审计，并遵循触摸优先的理念。","ja":"エージェントがプラットフォームの選択を尊重し、モバイルの制約の中で考え、オフラインで動作するモバイル設計を作成する能力を与え、Pythonスクリプトを使用してモバイルUXとタッチの監査を行い、タッチファーストの哲学に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 플랫폼 선택을尊重하고 모바일 제약 안에서 생각하며 오프라인에서 작동하는 모바일 디자인을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Python 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX 및 터치 감사를 수행하고 터치 우선 철학을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños móviles que respeten las opciones de plataforma, piensen dentro de las limitaciones móviles y operen sin conexión, utilizando scripts de Python para la experiencia del usuario móvil y las auditorías táctiles, y adherirse a una filosofía de primera interacción táctil.","fr":"Habilite les agents à créer des conceptions mobiles qui respectent les choix de plateforme, réfléchissent dans les limites mobiles et fonctionnent hors ligne, en utilisant des scripts Python pour l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les audits tactiles, et en adhérant à une philosophie tactile en premier.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Designs zu erstellen, die Plattformauswahlen respektieren, innerhalb der mobilen Einschränkungen denken und offline betrieben werden, wobei Python-Skripte für mobile Benutzeroberflächen und Touch-Audits verwendet werden und einer touch-first-Philosophie folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar designs móveis que respeitam as escolhas de plataforma, pensam dentro das restrições móveis e operam offline, utilizando scripts Python para UX móvel e auditorias de toque, e aderindo a uma filosofia de touch-first.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мобильные дизайны, которые уважают выбор платформы, думают в рамках мобильных ограничений и работают offline, используя скрипты Python для мобильного UX и аудита сенсорных взаимодействий, и придерживаются философии, ориентированной на сенсорный ввод.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تصاميم متنقلة تحترم اختيارات المنصة وتفكر في إطار القيود المتنقلة وتعمل بدون اتصال، باستخدام سكريبتات Python لتحليل UX المتنقل والتدقيق الللمس، والالتزام بفلسفة اللمس أولاً."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing mobile UX and touch interactions","Designing battery-conscious and offline-capable mobile applications","Validating platform-respectful design principles"],"zh":["审计移动UX和触摸交互","设计电池节能和离线能力的移动应用程序","验证平台尊重的设计原则"],"ja":["モバイルUXとタッチの相互作用を監査する","バッテリー意識とオフライン可能なモバイルアプリケーションを設計する","プラットフォーム尊重の設計原則を検証する"],"ko":["모바일 UX 및 터치 상호 작용 감사","배터리 절약 및 오프라인 가능 모바일 애플리케이션 설계","플랫폼을 존중하는 디자인 원칙 검증"],"es":["Auditoría de la experiencia del usuario móvil y las interacciones táctiles","Diseño de aplicaciones móviles conscientes de la batería y capaces de funcionar sin conexión","Validación de los principios de diseño respetuosos con la plataforma"],"fr":["Audit de l''expérience utilisateur mobile et des interactions tactiles","Conception d''applications mobiles conscientes de la batterie et capables de fonctionner hors ligne","Validation des principes de conception respectueux de la plateforme"],"de":["Prüfung der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und der Touch-Interaktionen","Entwurf von batteriebewussten und offline-fähigen mobilen Anwendungen","Validierung der plattformrespektierenden Designprinzipien"],"pt":["Auditoria de UX móvel e interações de toque","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis conscientes da bateria e capazes de funcionar offline","Validação de princípios de design respeitosos com a plataforma"],"ru":["Аудит мобильного UX и сенсорных взаимодействий","Проектирование мобильных приложений, экономящих батарею и способных работать offline","Валидация принципов дизайна, уважающих платформу"],"ar":["تدقيق UX المتنقل وتفاعلات اللمس","تصميم تطبيقات متنقلة تحافظ على البطارية وقادرة على العمل بدون اتصال","التحقق من مبادئ التصميم المحترمة للمنصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Focused on mobile design principles, not desktop"],"zh":["需要Python环境来执行脚本","专注于移动设计原则，而不是桌面"],"ja":["スクリプトの実行にはPython環境が必要","モバイル設計原則に焦点を当てており、デスクトップではない"],"ko":["스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요","모바일 디자인 원칙에 초점을 맞추고 있으며, 데스크톱이 아님"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Se centra en los principios de diseño móvil, no de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Se concentre sur les principes de conception mobile, et non de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Konzentriert sich auf mobile Designprinzipien, nicht auf Desktop"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Focado em princípios de design móvel, não em desktop"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для выполнения скриптов","Фокусируется на принципах мобильного дизайна, а не на настольном"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python لتشغيل السكريبتات","مركز على مبادئ التصميم المتنقل، وليس على سطح المكتب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ec74cda5e1954572e4282c3aaa9c1c32ec743cef83c53f8aef622c00dc8f0682","qualityScore":47}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kcosr/assistant/plugins-guide', 'community', 'kcosr', 'assistant', 'kcosr/assistant', 'plugins-guide', 22, 2, 47, '2026-02-22T06:37:46Z', '2026-02-27T13:10:12.748Z', '693e688f634c6a92ec1e2d867dd752cd2b08fab3c6453e18bef72acf14fecb94', '{"id":"kcosr/assistant/plugins-guide","name":"plugins-guide","description":{"zh":"基于面板的个人助手，具有插件架构，支持Claude Code、Codex和pi CLI代理","ja":"パネルベースのパーソナルアシスタント。プラグインアーキテクチャを備え、Claude Code、Codex、pi CLIエージェントをサポート","ko":"패널 기반 개인 어시스턴트, 플러그인 아키텍처, Claude Code, Codex, pi CLI 에이전트 지원","es":"Nuestra guía de plugins para Agentes de IA ofrece una arquitectura de plugins para mejorar la productividad en flujos de trabajo","fr":"Notre guide des plugins pour les Agents IA propose une architecture de plugins pour améliorer la productivité dans les flux de travail","de":"Unser Leitfaden für Plugins von KI-Agenten bietet eine Plugin-Architektur zur Steigerung der Produktivität in Arbeitsabläufen","pt":"O guia de plugins é uma arquitetura de plugin para fluxos de trabalho de produtividade, permitindo a extensão com plugins personalizados ou uso de plugins incorporados","ru":"Руководство по плагинам - это плагинная архитектура для рабочих процессов производительности, позволяющая расширять с помощью пользовательских плагинов или использовать встроенные плагины","ar":"دليل الملحقات هو هيكل ملحقاتي لتدفقات العمل للإنتاجية، يسمح بالتوسعة مع ملحقات مخصصة أو استخدام الملحقات المدمجة","en":"Panel-based personal assistant with a plugin architecture for productivity workflows. AI agents share a workspace of notes, lists and other panels with the user. Supports Claude Code, Codex, and pi CLI agents with text and voice interfaces. Extend with custom plugins or use built-in plugins expor..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能助手插件指南","ja":"AIエージェントのプラグインガイド","ko":"AI 에이전트 플러그인 가이드","es":"Guía de plugins para Agente