eadme是用于同步、管理和共享AI规则、技能、命令和子代理的工具","ja":"sync-readmeは、AIエージェントのルール、スキル、コマンド、サブエージェントを同期して管理するツールです","ko":"sync-readme는 AI 규칙, 스킬, 명령 및 하위 에이전트를 동기화하고 관리하는 데 사용되는 도구입니다","es":"Sync-Readme es una herramienta de gestión de AI Agents que permite a los desarrolladores sincronizar y compartir reglas y habilidades de AI de manera sencilla","fr":"Sync-Readme est un outil de gestion d''Agents IA qui permet aux développeurs de synchroniser et de partager des règles et des compétences d''IA de manière simple","de":"Sync-Readme ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von AI-Agents, mit dem Entwickler AI-Regeln und -Fähigkeiten einfach synchronisieren und teilen können","pt":"Sincronize e gerencie suas regras de agente de IA com facilidade","ru":"Синхронизируйте и управляйте своими правилами ИИ агентов с легкостью","ar":"مزامنة وادارة قواعد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بسهولة","en":"Synchronize, manage, and share your ai rules, skills, commands, subagents (Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, OpenCode, Trae AI, Codex, Gemini CLI, Warp) with ease."},"definition":{"en":"Synchronize, manage, and share your ai rules, skills, commands, subagents (Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, OpenCode, Trae AI, Codex, Gemini CLI, Warp) with ease."},"features":{"zh":["同步AI规则和技能","管理子代理","共享AI命令","支持多种AI工具","易于使用的界面"],"ja":["AIエージェントのルールとスキルを同期する","サブエージェントを管理する","AIコマンドを共有する","複数のAIツールに対応","使いやすいインターフェース"],"ko":["AI 규칙과 스킬을 동기화","하위 에이전트를 관리","AI 명령을 공유","다양한 AI 도구 지원","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스"],"es":["Sincronización de reglas y habilidades de AI","Gestión de subagentes como Cursor y Claude Code","Compatibilidad con Copilot y OpenCode","Integración con Trae AI y Codex","Acceso a Gemini CLI y Warp"],"fr":["Synchronisation de règles et de compétences d''IA","Gestion de sous-agents tels que Cursor et Claude Code","Compatibilité avec Copilot et OpenCode","Intégration avec Trae AI et Codex","Accès à Gemini CLI et Warp"],"de":["Synchronisierung von AI-Regeln und -Fähigkeiten","Verwaltung von Subagenten wie Cursor und Claude Code","Kompatibilität mit Copilot und OpenCode","Integration mit Trae AI und Codex","Zugriff auf Gemini CLI und Warp"],"pt":["Sincronização de regras de agente de IA","Gerenciamento de habilidades de agente de IA","Compartilhamento de comandos de agente de IA","Suporte a subagentes como Cursor e Claude Code"],"ru":["Синхронизация правил ИИ агентов","Управление навыками ИИ агентов","Обмен командами ИИ агентов","Поддержка субагентов như Cursor и Claude Code"],"ar":["مزامنة قواعد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة مهارات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","مشاركة أوامر وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم وكلاء فرعيين مثل Cursor و Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","sync-readme","AI规则同步","AI技能管理","子代理管理","AI工具比较","如何使用sync-readme","sync-readme安装","AI智能代理开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","sync-readme","AIエージェント同期","AIスキル管理","サブエージェント管理","AIツール比較","sync-readmeの使い方","sync-readmeのインストール","AIエージェント開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","sync-readme","AI 에이전트 동기화","AI 스킬 관리","하위 에이전트 관리","AI 도구 비교","sync-readme 사용법","sync-readme 설치","AI 에이전트 개발"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","gestión de AI Agents","sincronización de reglas de AI","cómo usar Sync-Readme","Sync-Readme vs Copilot","instalación de Sync-Readme","guía de configuración de Sync-Readme"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","gestion d''Agents IA","synchronisation de règles d''IA","comment utiliser Sync-Readme","Sync-Readme vs Copilot","installation de Sync-Readme","guide de configuration de Sync-Readme"],"de":["AI-Tools für Entwickler","Verwaltung von AI-Agents","Synchronisierung von AI-Regeln","wie man Sync-Readme verwendet","Sync-Readme vs Copilot","Installation von Sync-Readme","Konfigurationsanleitung für Sync-Readme"],"pt":["como usar sync-readme","o que é agente de ia","ferramentas de agente de ia","sync-readme alternative","instalar sync-readme","guia de configuração do sync-readme"],"ru":["как использовать sync-readme","что такое ИИ агент","инструменты ИИ агентов","sync-readme альтернатива","установить sync-readme","руководство по настройке sync-readme"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام sync-readme","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل sync-readme","تثبيت sync-readme","دليل إعداد sync-readme"]}},"owner":"lbb00","repo":"ai-rules-sync","repoPath":"lbb00/ai-rules-sync","stars":14,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T10:57:37Z","topics":["agents","claude-code","claude-skills","codex","copilot","copilot-prompts","cursor","gemini","opencode","rules","skills","subagents","trae","warp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sync-readme","description":"Synchronize English README.md with Chinese README_ZH.md, maintaining content parity.","bodyPreview":"# Sync README\n\n## Purpose\n\nKeep the English (README.md) and Chinese (README_ZH.md) documentation in sync. When one is updated, this skill helps translate and synchronize changes to the other.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Compare Both Files**\n   - Read README.md and README_ZH.md\n   - Identify sections that differ\n   - Note new sections in either file\n\n2. **Determine Sync Direction**\n   - If English was updated more recently: translate EN → ZH\n   - If Chinese was updated more recently: translate ZH → EN","body":"# Sync README\n\n## Purpose\n\nKeep the English (README.md) and Chinese (README_ZH.md) documentation in sync. When one is updated, this skill helps translate and synchronize changes to the other.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Compare Both Files**\n   - Read README.md and README_ZH.md\n   - Identify sections that differ\n   - Note new sections in either file\n\n2. **Determine Sync Direction**\n   - If English was updated more recently: translate EN → ZH\n   - If Chinese was updated more recently: translate ZH → EN\n   - If unclear, ask user which is the source of truth\n\n3. **Translate Content**\n   - Preserve all code blocks unchanged\n   - Translate prose sections accurately\n   - Keep technical terms consistent:\n     - \"rules\" → \"规则\"\n     - \"commands\" → \"命令\"\n     - \"skills\" → \"技能\"\n     - \"agents\" → \"代理\"\n     - \"instructions\" → \"指令\"\n     - \"adapter\" → \"适配器\"\n     - \"symbolic link\" → \"软链接\"\n\n4. **Preserve Structure**\n   - Keep same heading hierarchy\n   - Maintain table formats\n   - Preserve all links and badges\n   - Keep code examples identical\n\n5. **Update Language Links**\n   - Ensure language toggle links are present\n   - English: `[English](./README.md) | [中文](./README_ZH.md)`\n   - Chinese: `[English](./README.md) | [中文](./README_ZH.md)`\n\n6. **Verify Completeness**\n   - All sections present in both files\n   - All features documented in both\n   - Examples work in both versions\n\n## Translation Guidelines\n\n### Section Headers\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| Install | 安装 |\n| Commands | 命令 |\n| Architecture | 架构 |\n| Tab Completion | Tab 补全 |\n| Legacy compatibility | Legacy 兼容说明 |\n| Supported Sync Types | 支持的同步类型 |\n\n### Common Phrases\n| English | Chinese |\n|---------|---------|\n| Default mapping | 默认映射 |\n| Source directory | 源目录 |\n| Target directory | 目标目录 |\n| Run this command | 运行此命令 |\n| This command will | 该命令会 |\n\n## Output\n\nAfter running this skill:\n- Both README files contain identical information\n- All features documented in both languages\n- Formatting consistent across both files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:34:22.878Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Management Agents handling multilingual repositories across Cursor, Claude Code, and other modern AI coding tools.","zh":"Perfect for Documentation Management Agents handling multilingual repositories across Cursor, Claude Code, and other modern AI coding tools.","ja":"Perfect for Documentation Management Agents handling multilingual repositories across Cursor, Claude Code, and other modern AI coding tools.","ko":"Perfect for Documentation Management Agents handling multilingual repositories across Cursor, Claude Code, and other modern AI coding tools.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Documentación que manejan repositorios multilingües en Cursor, Claude Code y otras herramientas modernas de codificación con IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Documentation gérant des dépôts multilingues sur Cursor, Claude Code et d''autres outils modernes de codage IA.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsverwaltungs-Agents, die mehrsprachige Repositories über Cursor, Claude Code und andere moderne KI-Codierungstools hinweg handhaben.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gestão de Documentação que lidam com repositórios multilíngues em Cursor, Claude Code e outras ferramentas modernas de codificação com IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов управления документацией, работающих с многоязычными репозиториями в Cursor, Claude Code и других современных инструментах для программирования с ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة الوثائق الذين يتعاملون مع مستودعات متعددة اللغات عبر Cursor وClaude Code وأدوات البرمجة الحديثة الأخرى بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automatic synchronization of README.md and README_ZH.md files through bidirectional translation workflows. This skill provides file comparison, change detection, and language direction determination to maintain consistent documentation across English and Chinese versions.","zh":"Enables automatic synchronization of README.md and README_ZH.md files through bidirectional translation workflows. This skill provides file comparison, change detection, and language direction determination to maintain consistent documentation across English and Chinese versions.","ja":"Enables automatic synchronization of README.md and README_ZH.md files through bidirectional translation workflows. This skill provides file comparison, change detection, and language direction determination to maintain consistent documentation across English and Chinese versions.","ko":"Enables automatic synchronization of README.md and README_ZH.md files through bidirectional translation workflows. This skill provides file comparison, change detection, and language direction determination to maintain consistent documentation across English and Chinese versions.","es":"Permite la sincronización automática de los archivos README.md y README_ZH.md mediante flujos de trabajo de traducción bidireccional. Esta skill proporciona comparación de archivos, detección de cambios y determinación de la dirección del idioma para mantener una documentación consistente entre las versiones en inglés y chino.","fr":"Permet la synchronisation automatique des fichiers README.md et README_ZH.md via des workflows de traduction bidirectionnels. Cette compétence fournit la comparaison de fichiers, la détection des modifications et la détermination de la direction linguistique pour maintenir une documentation cohérente entre les versions anglaise et chinoise.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatische Synchronisierung von README.md- und README_ZH.md-Dateien durch bidirektionale Übersetzungs-Workflows. Diese Skill bietet Dateivergleich, Änderungserkennung und Sprachrichtungsbestimmung, um eine konsistente Dokumentation across englischen und chinesischen Versionen zu erhalten.","pt":"Permite a sincronização automática dos arquivos README.md e README_ZH.md por meio de fluxos de trabalho de tradução bidirecional. Esta habilidade fornece comparação de arquivos, detecção de alterações e determinação da direção do idioma para manter uma documentação consistente nas versões em inglês e chinês.","ru":"Обеспечивает автоматическую синхронизацию файлов README.md и README_ZH.md посредством двунаправленных рабочих процессов перевода. Этот навык предоставляет сравнение файлов, обнаружение изменений и определение направления перевода для поддержания согласованной документации между английской и китайской версиями.","ar":"يمكن المزامنة التلقائية لملفَي README.md وREADME_ZH.md من خلال سير عمل الترجمة ثنائية الاتجاه. توفر هذه المهارة مقارنة الملفات، واكتشاف التغييرات، وتحديد اتجاه اللغة للحفاظ على وثائق متسقة عبر النسخ الإنجليزية والصينية."},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing documentation updates across multilingual repositories","Translating new sections between English and Chinese READMEs","Maintaining version consistency for AI agent ecosystems"],"zh":["Synchronizing documentation updates across multilingual repositories","Translating new sections between English and Chinese READMEs","Maintaining version consistency for AI agent ecosystems"],"ja":["Synchronizing documentation updates across multilingual repositories","Translating new sections between English and Chinese READMEs","Maintaining version consistency for AI agent ecosystems"],"ko":["Synchronizing documentation updates across multilingual repositories","Translating new sections between English and Chinese READMEs","Maintaining version consistency for AI agent ecosystems"],"es":["Sincronizar actualizaciones de documentación en repositorios multilingües","Traducir nuevas secciones entre READMEs en inglés y chino","Mantener la coherencia de versiones para ecosistemas de agentes de IA"],"fr":["Synchroniser les mises à jour de la documentation sur des dépôts multilingues","Traduire de nouvelles sections entre les README anglais et chinois","Maintenir la cohérence des versions pour les écosystèmes d''agents IA"],"de":["Synchronisieren von Dokumentationsaktualisierungen across mehrsprachigen Repositories","Übersetzen neuer Abschnitte zwischen englischen und chinesischen READMEs","Aufrechterhaltung der Versionskonsistenz für KI-Agenten-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Sincronizar atualizações de documentação em repositórios multilíngues","Traduzir novas seções entre os READMEs em inglês e chinês","Manter a consistência de versão para ecossistemas de agente de IA"],"ru":["Синхронизация обновлений документации в многоязычных репозиториях","Перевод новых разделов между английской и китайской версиями README","Поддержание согласованности версий для экосистем AI агентов"],"ar":["مزامنة تحديثات الوثائق عبر المستودعات متعددة اللغات","ترجمة الأقسام الجديدة بين ملفات README الإنجليزية والصينية","الحفاظ على اتساق الإصدارات لأنظمة بيئة عمل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to both README.md and README_ZH.md files","Depends on accurate translation capabilities","Needs file modification timestamp comparison"],"zh":["Requires access to both README.md and README_ZH.md files","Depends on accurate translation capabilities","Needs file modification timestamp comparison"],"ja":["Requires access to both README.md and README_ZH.md files","Depends on accurate translation capabilities","Needs file modification timestamp comparison"],"ko":["Requires access to both README.md and README_ZH.md files","Depends on accurate translation capabilities","Needs file modification timestamp comparison"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos README.md y README_ZH.md","Depende de capacidades de traducción precisas","Necesita comparación de marcas de tiempo de modificación de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers README.md et README_ZH.md","Dépend de capacités de traduction précises","Nécessite une comparaison des horodatages de modification des fichiers"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf beide Dateien README.md und README_ZH.md","Hängt von genauen Übersetzungsfähigkeiten ab","Benötigt einen Vergleich der Dateiänderungszeitstempel"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos arquivos README.md e README_ZH.md","Depende de capacidades de tradução precisas","Necessita de comparação de carimbo de data e hora de modificação do arquivo"],"ru":["Требует доступ к обоим файлам README.md и README_ZH.md","Зависит от точных возможностей перевода","Требует сравнения временных меток изменения файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى كلا ملفَي README.md وREADME_ZH.md","يعتمد على قدرات ترجمة دقيقة","يحتاج إلى مقارنة طابع وقت تعديل الملف"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d31bb94cf8b18fe746a9c1ee4f4da98153bee3968687e45bf4966cadc2854c62","qualityScore":47}');
