ete security skill suite for OpenClaw''s family of agents. Protect your SOUL.md (etc'') with drift detection, live security recommendations, automated audits, and skill integrity verification. All from one installable suite."},"features":{"zh":["实时安全建议","自动审计","技能完整性验证","保护SOUL.md等文件"],"ja":["リアルタイムのセキュリティ推奨","自動監査","スキル完全性の検証","SOUL.mdなどのファイルの保護"],"ko":["실시간 보안 권장","자동 감사","스킬 무결성 확인","SOUL.md 등의 파일 보호"],"es":["Detección de drift para la seguridad de los agentes","Recomendaciones de seguridad en vivo","Auditorías automatizadas","Verificación de la integridad de las habilidades","Protección de archivos como SOUL.md"],"fr":["Détection de drift pour la sécurité des agents","Recommandations de sécurité en temps réel","Audits automatisés","Vérification de l''intégrité des compétences","Protection de fichiers tels que SOUL.md"],"de":["Drift-Erkennung für die Sicherheit von Agenten","Live-Sicherheitsempfehlungen","Automatisierte Audits","Integritätsprüfung der Fähigkeiten","Schutz von Dateien wie SOUL.md"],"pt":["Detecção de drift para arquivos como SOUL.md","Recomendações de segurança ao vivo","Auditorias automatizadas","Verificação de integridade de habilidades","Instalação única para todos os recursos"],"ru":["Обнаружение дрифта для файлов, таких как SOUL.md","Живые рекомендации по безопасности","Автоматические аудиты","Проверка целостности навыков","Однократная установка для всех функций"],"ar":["كشف الانجراف لملفات مثل SOUL.md","توصيات أمنية حية","تدقيق آلي","تحقق من سلامة المهارات","تركيب واحد لجميع الميزات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理安全","OpenClaw安全套件","实时安全建议","自动审计工具","技能完整性验证方法","SOUL.md保护"],"ja":["AIエージェントのセキュリティ","OpenClawセキュリティスイート","リアルタイムのセキュリティ推奨","自動監査ツール","スキル完全性の検証方法","SOUL.mdの保護"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 보안","OpenClaw 보안套件","실시간 보안 권장","자동 감사 도구","스킬 무결성 확인 방법","SOUL.md 보호"],"es":["cómo usar claw-release","qué es la seguridad de AI","herramientas de AI para la seguridad","claw-release vs otras herramientas de seguridad","instalación de claw-release","guía de configuración de claw-release"],"fr":["comment utiliser claw-release","qu''est-ce que la sécurité d''IA","outils d''IA pour la sécurité","claw-release vs d''autres outils de sécurité","installation de claw-release","guide de configuration de claw-release"],"de":["wie man claw-release verwendet","was ist KI-Sicherheit","KI-Tools für die Sicherheit","claw-release vs andere Sicherheitstools","Installation von claw-release","Konfigurationsanleitung für claw-release"],"pt":["como usar claw-release","o que é claw-release","claw-release alternative","claw-release vs OpenClaw","instalar claw-release","guia de configuração do claw-release","segurança de agentes","ferramentas de IA para segurança"],"ru":["как использовать claw-release","что такое claw-release","claw-release альтернатива","claw-release vs OpenClaw","установить claw-release","руководство по настройке claw-release","безопасность агентов","инструменты ИИ для безопасности"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام claw-release","ما هي claw-release","بديل claw-release","claw-release مقابل OpenClaw","تثبيت claw-release","دليل إعداد claw-release","أمان الوكلاء","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للأمان"]}},"owner":"prompt-security","repo":"clawsec","repoPath":"prompt-security/clawsec","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.884Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"claw-release","description":"Release automation for Claw skills and website. Guides through version bumping, tagging, and release verification.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Claw Release\n\nInternal tool for releasing skills and managing the ClawSec catalog.\n\n**An internal tool by [Prompt Security](https://prompt.security)**\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Release Type | Command | Tag Format |\n|-------------|---------|------------|\n| Skill release | `./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>` | `<name>-v<version>` |\n| Pre-release | `./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> 1.0.0-beta1` | `<name>-v1.0.0-beta1` |\n\n---\n\n## Release Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Version Type\n\nA","body":"# Claw Release\n\nInternal tool for releasing skills and managing the ClawSec catalog.\n\n**An internal tool by [Prompt Security](https://prompt.security)**\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Release Type | Command | Tag Format |\n|-------------|---------|------------|\n| Skill release | `./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>` | `<name>-v<version>` |\n| Pre-release | `./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> 1.0.0-beta1` | `<name>-v1.0.0-beta1` |\n\n---\n\n## Release Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Determine Version Type\n\nAsk what changed:\n- **Bug fixes only** → Patch (1.0.0 → 1.0.1)\n- **New features, backward compatible** → Minor (1.0.0 → 1.1.0)\n- **Breaking changes** → Major (1.0.0 → 2.0.0)\n- **Testing/unstable** → Pre-release (1.0.0-beta1, 1.0.0-rc1)\n\n### Step 2: Pre-flight Checks\n\n```bash\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status\n\n# Verify skill directory exists\nls skills/<skill-name>/skill.json\n\n# Get current version\njq -r ''.version'' skills/<skill-name>/skill.json\n```\n\n### Step 3: Run Release Script\n\n```bash\n./scripts/release-skill.sh <skill-name> <new-version>\n```\n\nThe script will:\n1. Validate version format (semver)\n2. Check tag doesn''t already exist\n3. Update skill.json version\n4. Update SKILL.md frontmatter version (if file exists)\n5. Update hardcoded version URLs (feed_url)\n6. Commit changes\n7. Create annotated git tag\n\n### Step 4: Push Release\n\n```bash\ngit push && git push origin <skill-name>-v<version>\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify Release\n\nAfter pushing, the CI/CD pipeline will:\n1. Validate skill exists\n2. Verify version matches skill.json\n3. Verify version matches SKILL.md frontmatter (if exists)\n4. Generate checksums from SBOM\n5. Create .skill package (ZIP)\n6. Create GitHub Release\n7. Trigger website rebuild (for non-internal skills)\n\nVerify at:\n- **GitHub Releases:** `https://github.com/prompt-security/clawsec/releases/tag/<skill-name>-v<version>`\n- **GitHub Actions:** Check workflow run status\n\n---\n\n## Undo a Release (Before Push)\n\nIf you need to undo before pushing:\n\n```bash\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1 && git tag -d <skill-name>-v<version>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pre-release Versions\n\nFor beta, alpha, or release candidates:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/release-skill.sh <skill-name> 1.2.0-beta1\n./scripts/release-skill.sh <skill-name> 1.2.0-alpha1\n./scripts/release-skill.sh <skill-name> 1.2.0-rc1\n```\n\nPre-releases are automatically marked in GitHub Releases.\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Error | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| `Tag already exists` | Choose a different version number |\n| `Version mismatch in CI` | Ensure you used the release script (not manual tagging) |\n| `SKILL.md version mismatch` | Ensure you used the release script which updates both skill.json and SKILL.md |\n| `Uncommitted changes` | Commit or stash first: `git stash` or `git add . && git commit` |\n| `skill.json not found` | Verify skill directory path is correct |\n\n---\n\n## Internal Skills\n\nSkills with `\"internal\": true` in their `openclaw` section:\n- Are released normally via GitHub Releases\n- Are NOT shown in the public skills catalog website\n- Can still be downloaded directly from release URLs\n\nThis skill (`claw-release`) is an internal skill.\n\n---\n\n## Existing Skills\n\n| Skill | Category | Internal |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| clawsec-feed | security | No |\n| clawtributor | security | No |\n| openclaw-audit-watchdog | security | No |\n| soul-guardian | security | No |\n| claw-release | utility | Yes |\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter release, confirm:\n- [ ] GitHub Release exists with correct tag\n- [ ] Release has: skill.json, SKILL.md, checksums.json, .skill package\n- [ ] Release is marked as pre-release if applicable\n- [ ] GitHub Actions workflow completed successfully\n- [ ] Website updated (for non-internal skills only)\n\n---\n\n## License\n\nGNU AGPL v3.0 or later - See repository for details.\n\nBuilt by the [Prompt Security](https://prompt.security) team.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:41.523Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-Conscious Agents needing comprehensive security skill suites with drift detection and automated audits.","zh":"非常适合需要全面安全技能套件、漂移检测和自动审计的安全意识强的代理。","ja":"セキュリティに주의を払うエージェントが、包括的なセキュリティスキルスイート、ドリフト検出、自動監査を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"보안 관련 에이전트에게 완전한 보안 기능 세트와漂移 감지 및 자동 감사를 제공하여 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes conscientes de la seguridad que necesitan suites de habilidades de seguridad completas con detección de deriva y auditorías automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents conscients de la sécurité ayant besoin de suites d''habiletés de sécurité complètes avec détection de dérive et audits automatisés.","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die umfassende Sicherheitsfunktionen mit Drift-Erkennung und automatisierten Audits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que precisam de conjuntos de habilidades de segurança abrangentes com detecção de deriva e auditorias automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для Безопасно-Ориентированных Агентов, которым необходимы комплексные наборы навыков безопасности с обнаружением дрейфа и автоматизированными аудитами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الواعين للأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى مجموعات شاملة من مهارات الأمن مع الكشف عن الانحراف والتدقيقات الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to protect their SOUL.md files with live security recommendations, skill integrity verification, and automated audits, all managed through a single installable suite using scripts like ./scripts/release-skill.sh and tag formats like <name>-v<version>.","zh":"赋予代理保护其SOUL.md文件的能力，提供实时安全推荐、技能完整性验证和自动审计，所有这些都通过一个可安装的套件管理，使用诸如 ./scripts/release-skill.sh 的脚本和 <name>-v<version> 的标签格式。","ja":"エージェントがSOUL.mdファイルを保護する能力を与え、リアルタイムのセキュリティ推奨事項、スキル完全性の検証、自動監査を提供し、すべてを単一のインストール可能なスイートを使用して管理します。 ./scripts/release-skill.shなどのスクリプトや<name>-v<version>などのタグ形式を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 SOUL.md 파일을 보호할 수 있도록 해주며, 실시간 보안 추천, 기능 무결성 검증 및 자동 감사를 제공하고, 하나의 설치 가능한 제품군을 사용하여 모든 것을 관리합니다. ./scripts/release-skill.sh와 같은 스크립트 및 <name>-v<version>과 같은 태그 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proteger sus archivos SOUL.md con recomendaciones de seguridad en vivo, verificación de integridad de habilidades y auditorías automatizadas, todo gestionado a través de una suite instalable única utilizando scripts como ./scripts/release-skill.sh y formatos de etiquetas como <name>-v<version>.","fr":"Habilite les agents à protéger leurs fichiers SOUL.md avec des recommandations de sécurité en temps réel, une vérification de l''intégrité des compétences et des audits automatisés, le tout géré via une suite installable unique utilisant des scripts comme ./scripts/release-skill.sh et des formats de balises comme <name>-v<version>.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ihre SOUL.md-Dateien mit Live-Sicherheitsempfehlungen, Integritätsprüfung von Fähigkeiten und automatisierten Audits zu schützen, alles verwaltet durch eine einzige installierbare Suite mit Skripten wie ./scripts/release-skill.sh und Tag-Formaten wie <name>-v<version>.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a proteger seus arquivos SOUL.md com recomendações de segurança ao vivo, verificação de integridade de habilidades e auditorias automatizadas, tudo gerenciado por meio de uma única suíte instalável usando scripts como ./scripts/release-skill.sh e formatos de marcação como <name>-v<version>.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью защитить свои файлы SOUL.md с помощью живых рекомендаций по безопасности, проверки целостности навыков и автоматизированных аудитов, все управляемое через одну установочную сборку с использованием скриптов seperti ./scripts/release-skill.sh и форматов тегов как <name>-v<version>.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء حماية ملفاتهم SOUL.md باستخدام توصيات أمنية حية وتنفيذ التحقق من سلامة المهارات والتدقيقات الآلية، وجميعها يتم إدارتها من خلال مجموعة قابلة للتثبيت واحدة باستخدام سكريبتات مثل ./scripts/release-skill.sh وتنسيقات وسوم مثل <name>-v<version>."},"useCases":{"en":["Releasing skills with version control using ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","Managing pre-release versions with tags like <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","Automating security audits for skill integrity verification"],"zh":["使用 ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version> 实现带版本控制的技能发布","使用 <name>-v1.0.0-beta1 等标签管理预发布版本","自动化安全审计以进行技能完整性验证"],"ja":["バージョン管理を使用したスキルのリリース ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version> を使用","<name>-v1.0.0-beta1 などのタグを使用してプレリリースバージョンを管理","スキル完全性の検証のための自動セキュリティ監査"],"ko":[" ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>를 사용하여 버전 관리가 포함된 기능 릴리스","<name>-v1.0.0-beta1과 같은 태그를 사용하여 사전 릴리스 버전 관리","기능 무결성 검증을 위한 자동 보안 감사"],"es":["Publicar habilidades con control de versiones utilizando ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","Administrar versiones previas a la publicación con etiquetas como <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","Automatizar auditorías de seguridad para la verificación de integridad de habilidades"],"fr":["Publier des compétences avec un contrôle de version en utilisant ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","Gérer les versions préalables à la publication avec des balises comme <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","Automatiser les audits de sécurité pour la vérification de l''intégrité des compétences"],"de":["Fähigkeiten mit Versionskontrolle veröffentlichen, indem Sie ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version> verwenden","Vorabversionen mit Tags wie <name>-v1.0.0-beta1 verwalten","Sicherheitsaudits für die Integritätsprüfung von Fähigkeiten automatisieren"],"pt":["Lançar habilidades com controle de versão usando ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","Gerenciar versões pré-lançamento com tags como <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","Automatizar auditorias de segurança para verificação de integridade de habilidades"],"ru":["Выпуск навыков с управлением версиями с помощью ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","Управление предварительными версиями с помощью тегов как <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","Автоматизация аудитов безопасности для проверки целостности навыков"],"ar":["إصدار مهارات مع التحكم في الإصدار باستخدام ./scripts/release-skill.sh <name> <version>","إدارة الإصدارات ما قبل الإصدار مع وسوم مثل <name>-v1.0.0-beta1","تأتميم التدقيقات الأمنية للتحقق من سلامة المهارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internal tool access by Prompt Security","Specific to OpenClaw''s family of agents","Needs execution of release scripts like ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"zh":["需要 Prompt Security 的内部工具访问","仅适用于 OpenClaw 的代理家族","需要执行诸如 ./scripts/release-skill.sh 的发布脚本"],"ja":["Prompt Security の内部ツールへのアクセスが必要","OpenClaw のエージェントファミリーにのみ適用"," ./scripts/release-skill.sh などのリリーススクリプトを実行する必要がある"],"ko":["Prompt Security의 내부 도구 액세스가 필요합니다.","OpenClaw의 에이전트 제품군에만 적용됩니다."," ./scripts/release-skill.sh와 같은 릴리스 스크립트를 실행해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramientas internas por parte de Prompt Security","Específico para la familia de agentes de OpenClaw","Necesita la ejecución de scripts de lanzamiento como ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des outils internes par Prompt Security","Spécifique à la famille d''agents OpenClaw","Nécessite l''exécution de scripts de lancement comme ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf interne Tools durch Prompt Security","Spezifisch für die Familie von OpenClaw-Agenten","Benötigt die Ausführung von Release-Skripten wie ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"pt":["Exige acesso à ferramenta interna por Prompt Security","Específico para a família de agentes OpenClaw","Necessita execução de scripts de lançamento como ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"ru":["Требует доступа к внутреннему инструменту от Prompt Security","Специфичен для семейства агентов OpenClaw","Требует выполнения скриптов выпуска как ./scripts/release-skill.sh"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة داخلية من Prompt Security","محدد لعائلة الوكلاء OpenClaw","يحتاج إلى تنفيذ سكريبتات الإصدار مثل ./scripts/release-skill.sh"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cda9f58b3be67876ba4a543d6192af60ea155c2102202340fdfc8770a848f07e","qualityScore":47}');
