ente de produtividade com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для автоматизации продуктивности","ar":"أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتنظيم البريد الوارد","en":"scan-inbox"},"description":{"zh":"scan-inbox 是一个支持Claude Code和Gemini CLI的个人AI助手，用于提高生产力和自动化工作流程","ja":"scan-inboxは、Claude CodeとGemini CLIをサポートする個人用AIエージェントで、生産性を高め、ワークフローを自動化します","ko":"scan-inbox는 Claude Code와 Gemini CLI를 지원하는 개인용 AI 에이전트로 생산성을 높이고 워크플ロー 자동화를 도와줍니다","es":"El asistente de productividad AI scan-inbox ofrece automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo personalizados para macOS","fr":"L''agent de productivité IA scan-inbox propose une automatisation de tâches et des flux de travail personnalisés pour macOS","de":"Der Produktivitäts-Assistent AI scan-inbox bietet eine Automatisierung von Aufgaben und benutzerdefinierte Workflows für macOS","pt":"O scan-inbox é um assistente de produtividade que suporta Claude Code e Gemini CLI para automação de tarefas e fluxos de trabalho personalizados em macOS","ru":"ИИ Агент scan-inbox поддерживает Claude Code и Gemini CLI для автоматизации задач и создания индивидуальных рабочих процессов на macOS","ar":"أداة scan-inbox هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتنظيم البريد الوارد و تحسين الإنتاجية باستخدام Claude Code و Gemini CLI على نظام macOS","en":"Personal AI assistant supporting Claude Code and Gemini CLI - productivity automation, AppleScript skills, and custom workflows for macOS"},"definition":{"en":"Personal AI assistant supporting Claude Code and Gemini CLI - productivity automation, AppleScript skills, and custom workflows for macOS"},"features":{"zh":["支持Claude Code和Gemini CLI","自动化工作流程","提高生产力","自定义工作流程","支持macOS"],"ja":["Claude CodeとGemini CLIをサポート","ワークフローを自動化","生産性を高める","カスタムワークフロー","macOSをサポート"],"ko":["Claude Code와 Gemini CLI 지원","워크플ロー 자동화","생산성 향상","사용자 정의 워크플ロー","macOS 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Gemini CLI","Automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo personalizados","Soporte para AppleScript","Integración con macOS"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Gemini CLI","Automatisation de tâches et de flux de travail personnalisés","Prise en charge d''AppleScript","Intégration avec macOS"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Gemini CLI","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und benutzerdefinierten Workflows","Unterstützung für AppleScript","Integration mit macOS"],"pt":["Automação de tarefas com Claude Code","Criação de fluxos de trabalho personalizados com Gemini CLI","Suporte a AppleScript para tarefas complexas","Integração com macOS para melhor experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач с помощью Claude Code","Создание индивидуальных рабочих процессов с Gemini CLI","Поддержка AppleScript для сложных задач","Интеграция с macOS для лучшего опыта пользователя"],"ar":["أتمتة المهام باستخدام Claude Code","إنشاء سير عمل مخصصة مع Gemini CLI","دعم AppleScript لمهام معقدة","التكامل مع نظام macOS لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能助手","scan-inbox","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","自动化工作流程","提高生产力","macOS","AI工具","如何使用scan-inbox","scan-inbox安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","scan-inbox","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","ワークフロー自動化","生産性を高める","macOS","AIツール","scan-inboxの使い方","scan-inboxのセットアップ"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","scan-inbox","Claude Code","Gemini CLI","워크플ロー 자동화","생산성 향상","macOS","AI 툴","scan-inbox 사용법","scan-inbox 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar scan-inbox","qué es un agente de productividad AI","alternativas a scan-inbox","scan-inbox vs otros agentes de productividad","instalación de scan-inbox","guía de configuración de scan-inbox"],"fr":["comment utiliser scan-inbox","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de productivité IA","alternatives à scan-inbox","scan-inbox vs autres agents de productivité","installation de scan-inbox","guide de configuration de scan-inbox"],"de":["wie man scan-inbox verwendet","was ist ein Produktivitäts-Assistent AI","Alternativen zu scan-inbox","scan-inbox vs andere Produktivitäts-Assistenten","Installation von scan-inbox","Konfigurationsanleitung für scan-inbox"],"pt":["como usar scan-inbox","o que é assistente de produtividade","ferramentas de ia para produtividade","alternativas para scan-inbox","instalação do scan-inbox","guia de configuração do scan-inbox"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ для продуктивности","альтернативы ИИ Агентам","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة scan-inbox","ما هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية","بديل أداة scan-inbox","تثبيت أداة scan-inbox","دليل إعداد أداة scan-inbox"]}},"owner":"ronnycoding","repo":"my-personal-assistant","repoPath":"ronnycoding/my-personal-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.139Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scan-inbox","description":"Scan Apple Mail inbox for unread, actionable, and priority messages. Use this when the user asks to check their email, see unread messages, find urgent emails, or triage their inbox. Returns categorized email counts and details from the last 24-48 hours.","bodyPreview":"# Scan Inbox\n\nAnalyzes your Apple Mail inbox to identify unread, actionable, and priority messages within a specified time range.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks questions like:\n- \"Check my email\"\n- \"What unread emails do I have?\"\n- \"Any urgent emails?\"\n- \"Show me actionable items from my inbox\"\n- \"Triage my email from today\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Scans all inbox accounts in Apple Mail\n2. Filters messages by time range (default: last 24 hours)\n3. Identif","body":"# Scan Inbox\n\nAnalyzes your Apple Mail inbox to identify unread, actionable, and priority messages within a specified time range.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks questions like:\n- \"Check my email\"\n- \"What unread emails do I have?\"\n- \"Any urgent emails?\"\n- \"Show me actionable items from my inbox\"\n- \"Triage my email from today\"\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. Scans all inbox accounts in Apple Mail\n2. Filters messages by time range (default: last 24 hours)\n3. Identifies unread messages\n4. Detects actionable keywords (deadline, urgent, action required, meeting, request, etc.)\n5. Identifies priority/flagged messages\n6. Returns structured data with counts and message details\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Determine Time Range\nAsk the user if they want a specific time range, or use these defaults:\n- \"Today\" or \"recent\" → 24 hours\n- \"This week\" or \"recent days\" → 48-72 hours\n- Specific request → Honor their time range\n\n### Step 2: Execute the Scan\nRun the AppleScript skill using the Bash tool:\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nosascript .claude/skills/scan-inbox/scripts/scan_inbox.scpt <hours> false\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nParameters:\n- `<hours>`: Number of hours to look back (e.g., 24, 48, 72)\n- `false`: Set to `true` for priority-only mode\n\n### Step 3: Parse Results\nThe script returns:\n- `success`: boolean (true/false)\n- `unreadCount`: Total unread messages\n- `actionableCount`: Messages with actionable keywords\n- `priorityCount`: Flagged/priority messages\n- `unreadList`: Array of unread message details (sender, subject, date, flagged status)\n- `actionableList`: Array of actionable messages\n- `priorityList`: Array of priority messages\n\n### Step 4: Present Results to User\nFormat the output in a clear, actionable way:\n\n**Example Response:**\n\\`\\`\\`\n📬 Inbox Summary (Last 24 Hours)\n\n📊 Overview:\n- 38 unread messages\n- 0 actionable items\n- 0 priority/flagged\n\n📧 Recent Unread:\n1. Google - Security alert\n2. C# Digest - Newsletter\n3. BAC Credomatic - Transaction notification\n... (showing top 5-10)\n\n💡 Next Steps:\n- No urgent items requiring immediate attention\n- Review newsletters when you have time\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Step 5: Offer Follow-up Actions\nAsk if the user wants to:\n- See more details about specific emails\n- Flag or organize certain messages\n- Extract tasks from actionable emails\n- Check a different time range\n\n## Actionable Keywords Detected\n\nThe skill identifies these keywords in email subjects:\n- deadline\n- urgent\n- action required\n- meeting\n- request\n- please review\n- asap\n- todo\n- action item\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf the script fails:\n1. Check Mail automation permissions: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Automation → Terminal/Claude\n2. Verify Apple Mail is running\n3. Try with a smaller time range if timeout occurs\n\n## Example Usage\n\n**User**: \"Check my email from today\"\n\n**Claude Response**:\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nosascript .claude/skills/scan-inbox/scripts/scan_inbox.scpt 24 false\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nThen format and present the results to the user.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nFor advanced usage and detailed documentation, see [reference.md](reference.md).\n\nFor examples of common use cases, see [examples.md](examples.md).\n\n## Performance\n\n- Typical execution: ~2 seconds\n- Max timeout: 30 seconds\n- Works with multiple Mail accounts\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill only reads mail metadata (sender, subject, date, flags). It does not access email body content to protect privacy.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:43:17.452Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Personal AI Assistants like Claude Code and Gemini CLI needing email automation and Apple Mail integration.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 Gemini CLI 等个人 AI 助手，需要电子邮件自动化和 Apple Mail 集成。","ja":"Claude Code や Gemini CLI などのパーソナル AI アシスタントに適しています。電子メールの自動化と Apple Mail の統合が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code와 Gemini CLI 같은 개인 AI 보조를 위한 것으로, 이메일 자동화 및 Apple Mail 통합이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de IA personales como Claude Code y Gemini CLI que necesitan automatización de correo electrónico e integración con Apple Mail.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants d''IA personnels comme Claude Code et Gemini CLI nécessitant une automatisation de courriel et une intégration avec Apple Mail.","de":"Ideal für persönliche KI-Assistenten wie Claude Code und Gemini CLI, die eine E-Mail-Automatisierung und eine Apple-Mail-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de IA Pessoal como Claude Code e Gemini CLI que precisam de automação de e-mail e integração com o Apple Mail.","ru":"Идеально подходит для личных помощников ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Gemini CLI, требующих автоматизации электронной почты и интеграции с Apple Mail.","ar":"مثالي لمساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي الشخصي مثل Claude Code و Gemini CLI الذي يحتاج إلى أتمتة البريد الإلكتروني وتكامل البريد الخاص بالشركة Apple."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Apple Mail inboxes, filtering messages by time range and identifying unread, actionable, and priority emails using custom workflows and AppleScript skills.","zh":"赋予代理分析 Apple Mail 收件箱的能力，通过自定义工作流和 AppleScript 技能按时间范围筛选消息并识别未读、可执行和优先电子邮件。","ja":"Apple Mail の受信トレイを分析するエージェントを可能にし、カスタムワークフローと AppleScript スキルを使用して、時間範囲でメッセージをフィルタリングし、未読、実行可能、優先度の高い電子メールを識別します。","ko":"에이전트가 Apple Mail 받은 편지함을 분석할 수 있게 해주며, 사용자 정의 워크플로 및 AppleScript 기술을 사용하여 시간 범위로 메시지를 필터링하고, 안 읽은 메시지, 실행 가능한 메시지, 우선 순위가 높은 메시지를 식별합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar buzones de Apple Mail, filtrando mensajes por rango de tiempo e identificando correos electrónicos no leídos, accionables y de prioridad utilizando flujos de trabajo personalizados y habilidades de AppleScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les boîtes de réception Apple Mail, en filtrant les messages par plage de temps et en identifiant les courriels non lus, actionnables et de priorité en utilisant des workflows personnalisés et des compétences AppleScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Apple-Mail-Postfächer zu analysieren, Nachrichten nach Zeitraum zu filtern und ungelesene, ausführbare und priorisierte E-Mails mithilfe benutzerdefinierter Workflows und AppleScript-Fähigkeiten zu identifizieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem as caixas de entrada do Apple Mail, filtrando mensagens por intervalo de tempo e identificando e-mails não lidos, ações e prioridades usando fluxos de trabalho personalizados e habilidades do AppleScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать почтовые ящики Apple Mail, фильтруя сообщения по диапазону времени и определяя непрочитанные, действенные и приоритетные электронные письма с помощью пользовательских рабочих процессов и навыков AppleScript.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحليل صناديق البريد في Apple Mail، وفرز الرسائل حسب نطاق الوقت وتحديد رسائل البريد الإلكتروني غير المقروءة والقابلة للتنفيذ وأولويتها باستخدام سير عمل مخصصة ومهارات AppleScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Triageing urgent emails from the last 24 hours","Identifying unread messages across multiple inbox accounts","Automating email checks with custom time ranges"],"zh":["过去 24 小时内的紧急电子邮件分类","跨多个收件箱账户识别未读消息","使用自定义时间范围自动执行电子邮件检查"],"ja":["過去 24 時間以内の緊急電子メールのトリアージ","複数の受信トレイ アカウントを跨いで未読メッセージを識別","カスタム時間範囲を使用した電子メール チェックの自動化"],"ko":["과거 24시간 내의 긴급 이메일 분류","여러 받은 편지함 계정에서 안 읽은 메시지 식별","사용자 정의 시간 범위를 사용한 이메일 확인 자동화"],"es":["Triar correos electrónicos urgentes de las últimas 24 horas","Identificar mensajes no leídos en varias cuentas de buzón","Automatizar comprobaciones de correo electrónico con rangos de tiempo personalizados"],"fr":["Triager des courriels urgents des dernières 24 heures","Identifier les messages non lus sur plusieurs comptes de boîte de réception","Automatiser les vérifications de courriel avec des plages de temps personnalisées"],"de":["Dringende E-Mails der letzten 24 Stunden trieren","Ungelesene Nachrichten in mehreren Postfachkonten identifizieren","E-Mail-Überprüfungen mit benutzerdefinierten Zeitbereichen automatisieren"],"pt":["Triagem de e-mails urgentes dos últimos 24 horas","Identificação de mensagens não lidas em várias contas de caixa de entrada","Automatização de verificações de e-mail com intervalos de tempo personalizados"],"ru":["Триажирование срочных электронных писем за последние 24 часа","Определение непрочитанных сообщений на нескольких почтовых ящиках","Автоматизация проверки электронной почты с пользовательскими диапазонами времени"],"ar":["فحص الرسائل الإلكترونية العاجلة من آخر 24 ساعة","تحديد الرسائل غير المقروءة عبر حسابات صندوق الوارد المتعددة","أتمتة فحص البريد الإلكتروني مع حدود زمنية مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Apple Mail and macOS environment","Limited to scanning inbox accounts within Apple Mail"],"zh":["需要 Apple Mail 和 macOS 环境","仅限于 Apple Mail 内的收件箱账户扫描"],"ja":["Apple Mail と macOS 環境が必要","Apple Mail 内の受信トレイ アカウントのスキャンに限定"],"ko":["Apple Mail 및 macOS 환경이 필요","Apple Mail 내의 받은 편지함 계정 스캔에 제한"],"es":["Requiere Apple Mail y entorno macOS","Limitado a la exploración de cuentas de buzón dentro de Apple Mail"],"fr":["Nécessite Apple Mail et environnement macOS","Limité à la numérisation des comptes de boîte de réception dans Apple Mail"],"de":["Benötigt Apple Mail und macOS-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf das Scannen von Postfachkonten innerhalb von Apple Mail"],"pt":["Requer o Apple Mail e o ambiente macOS","Limitado à verificação de contas de caixa de entrada dentro do Apple Mail"],"ru":["Требует Apple Mail и среды macOS","Ограничен сканированием учетных записей почтового ящика внутри Apple Mail"],"ar":["يتطلب البريد الخاص بالشركة Apple وبيئة macOS","محدود بفحص حسابات صندوق الوارد داخل بريد الشركة Apple"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8e8fd8774abcb67765faf3309c0a8839dc25867b41fe74125e816f8152729f36","qualityScore":47}');
