nce artificielle","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Support pour plusieurs plates-formes","Sécurité et évolutivité"],"de":["Bereitstellung von benutzerdefinierten Anwendungen","Integration mit KI-Tools","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Desenvolvido com React","Integração com Node.js","Soluções de tecnologia de ponta","Otimizado para experiência do usuário","Suporte ao Clube Alpino de Krakow"],"ru":["Разработан с использованием React","Интеграция с Node.js","Передовые технологические решения","Оптимизировано для пользовательского опыта","Поддержка Альпийского Клуба Кракова"],"ar":["تم تطويره باستخدام React","التكامل مع Node.js","حلول تكنولوجيا متقدمة","متوافق مع تجربة المستخدم","دعم لنادي كراكوف الجبلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["kamal-deployment","AI工具","Krakow Alpine Club","应用开发","如何使用kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment安装","kamal-deployment替代品"],"ja":["kamal-deployment","AIエージェント","クラコフアルパインクラブ","アプリ開発","kamal-deploymentの使い方","kamal-deploymentのインストール","kamal-deploymentの代替"],"ko":["kamal-deployment","AI 에이전트","크라쿠프 알파인 클럽","애플리케이션 개발","kamal-deployment 사용 방법","kamal-deployment 설치","kamal-deployment 대안"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","despliegue de aplicaciones","club alpino de Cracovia","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","seguridad y escalabilidad","cómo utilizar herramientas de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a kamal-deployment"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","déploiement d''applications","club alpin de Cracovie","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","sécurité et évolutivité","comment utiliser des outils d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à kamal-deployment"],"de":["KI-Tools","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Krakauer Alpenverein","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit","wie man KI-Tools nutzt","Alternativen zu kamal-deployment"],"pt":["como usar kamal-deployment","o que é kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment alternative","kamal-deployment vs outros","instalar kamal-deployment","guia de configuração do kamal-deployment","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment para clube alpino"],"ru":["как использовать kamal-deployment","что такое kamal-deployment","альтернатива kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment vs другие","установить kamal-deployment","руководство по настройке kamal-deployment","разработка приложений с помощью kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment для альпийского клуба"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام kamal-deployment","ما هو kamal-deployment","بديل kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment مقابل غيره","تثبيت kamal-deployment","دليل إعداد kamal-deployment","تطوير التطبيقات مع kamal-deployment","kamal-deployment لنادي الجبل"]}},"owner":"rockcodelabs","repo":"kw-app","repoPath":"rockcodelabs/kw-app","stars":6,"forks":3,"updatedAt":"2026-01-28T13:58:03Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kamal-deployment","description":"Zero-downtime deployment with Kamal for kw-app (staging on Raspberry Pi ARM64, production on VPS x86_64). Covers deployment workflows, console access, and troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# Kamal Deployment (kw-app)\n\n## Overview\n\nkw-app uses Kamal for zero-downtime deployments to:\n- **Staging**: Raspberry Pi 4 (ARM64, ~4GB RAM)\n- **Production**: VPS (x86_64)\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Rolling restarts (zero downtime)\n- Automated migrations before deploy\n- Docker-based deployment\n- SSH-based remote execution\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Local Machine Requirements:**\n- Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) - **NOT Docker!**\n- Kamal gem installed globally or in bundle\n- SSH keys configured for deployment serve","body":"# Kamal Deployment (kw-app)\n\n## Overview\n\nkw-app uses Kamal for zero-downtime deployments to:\n- **Staging**: Raspberry Pi 4 (ARM64, ~4GB RAM)\n- **Production**: VPS (x86_64)\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Rolling restarts (zero downtime)\n- Automated migrations before deploy\n- Docker-based deployment\n- SSH-based remote execution\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Local Machine Requirements:**\n- Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) - **NOT Docker!**\n- Kamal gem installed globally or in bundle\n- SSH keys configured for deployment servers\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Deployment Flow\n\n```\nLocal Machine (chruby 3.2.2)\n    ↓\nRun: kamal deploy -d staging/production\n    ↓\n1. Build Docker image (ARM64 or x86_64)\n2. Push to registry\n3. SSH to target server\n4. Run migrations (if needed)\n5. Pull new image\n6. Rolling restart (zero downtime)\n7. Health checks\n```\n\n### Why Native Ruby for Kamal?\n\n- Kamal runs on **host machine**, not in Docker\n- Needs native Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby)\n- Docker is used ONLY for the app container being deployed\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n```\nconfig/\n├── deploy.yml               # Base config (not used directly)\n├── deploy.staging.yml       # Staging (Raspberry Pi)\n└── deploy.production.yml    # Production (VPS)\n```\n\n### Key Settings\n\n**Staging (deploy.staging.yml):**\n- Server: Raspberry Pi 4\n- Architecture: ARM64\n- Memory: ~4GB (use batches for large operations)\n- Branch: `develop`\n\n**Production (deploy.production.yml):**\n- Server: VPS\n- Architecture: x86_64\n- Branch: `main`\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Deployment Commands\n\n**All Kamal commands run with native Ruby (chruby):**\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to staging\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal deploy -d staging''\n\n# Deploy to production\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal deploy -d production''\n\n# Deploy specific branch\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal deploy -d staging --version=feature-branch''\n\n# Check deployment status\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app details -d staging''\n\n# View logs\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app logs -d staging''\n\n# Rollback to previous version\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal rollback -d production''\n```\n\n### Console Access\n\n**Staging Console:**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging -i --reuse \"bin/rails console\"''\n```\n\n**Production Console:**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d production -i --reuse \"bin/rails console\"''\n```\n\n**Flag Meanings:**\n- `-d staging/production` - Destination environment\n- `-i` / `--interactive` - Keep terminal interactive (required for console)\n- `--reuse` - Reuse existing SSH connection (no registry auth needed)\n\n### One-off Commands\n\n**Run rake task:**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging --reuse \"bin/rails db:migrate:status\"''\n```\n\n**Run Rails runner:**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging --reuse \"bin/rails runner \\\"puts User.count\\\"\"''\n```\n\n## Deployment Workflow\n\n### 1. Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n```\nBefore deploying:\n- [ ] All tests passing locally\n- [ ] Migrations reviewed and tested\n- [ ] Environment variables updated in credentials\n- [ ] Staging tested (for production deploys)\n- [ ] Backup taken (for production)\n```\n\n### 2. Standard Deployment\n\n```bash\n# 1. Check current status\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app details -d staging''\n\n# 2. Deploy\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal deploy -d staging''\n\n# 3. Verify deployment\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app logs -d staging''\n\n# 4. Smoke test via console\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging -i --reuse \"bin/rails console\"''\n```\n\n### 3. Migration Deployment\n\n**Kamal runs migrations automatically before deploying new containers.**\n\nIf migration fails, deployment stops (zero-downtime preserved).\n\n**Manual migration (if needed):**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging --reuse \"bin/rails db:migrate\"''\n```\n\n### 4. Emergency Rollback\n\n```bash\n# Rollback to previous version\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal rollback -d production''\n\n# Check status\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app details -d production''\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: Deployment Hangs\n\n**Symptoms:** Kamal stuck on \"Waiting for health check\"\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Check app logs:\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app logs -d staging''\n```\n\n2. Check container status:\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app details -d staging''\n```\n\n3. SSH to server and check Docker:\n```bash\nssh staging-server\ndocker ps\ndocker logs <container-id>\n```\n\n### Issue: \"Registry Authentication Failed\"\n\n**Cause:** Trying to use `--reuse` without an active connection.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Remove `--reuse` for first connection:\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging -i \"bin/rails console\"''\n```\n\n2. Or authenticate first:\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal registry login -d staging''\n```\n\n### Issue: Out of Memory (Staging Pi)\n\n**Symptoms:** Deployment succeeds but app crashes on Raspberry Pi.\n\n**Cause:** Pi has only ~4GB RAM.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Reduce Sidekiq concurrency in staging\n2. Use database batches for large operations\n3. Deploy during low-traffic times\n4. Consider upgrading Pi memory\n\n### Issue: \"Wrong Ruby Version\"\n\n**Symptoms:** \n```\nYour Ruby version is 2.6.10, but your Gemfile specified 3.2.2\n```\n\n**Cause:** Running Kamal without chruby.\n\n**Solution:** Always wrap in `zsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && ...''`\n\n### Issue: Migrations Fail During Deployment\n\n**Symptoms:** Deployment stops with migration error.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Check migration on local:\n```bash\ndocker-compose exec -T app bundle exec rake db:migrate\n```\n\n2. Fix migration and redeploy\n3. OR manually run on server:\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d staging --reuse \"bin/rails db:migrate\"''\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions (Automated)\n\n**Staging deploys automatically on push to `develop`:**\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to Staging\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [develop]\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: self-hosted  # Runs on Pi\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Deploy\n        run: bundle exec kamal deploy -d staging\n```\n\n**Production deploys on push to `main`:**\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to Production\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Deploy\n        run: bundle exec kamal deploy -d production\n```\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n### ✅ Always Do\n\n- Use SSH keys (never passwords)\n- Store secrets in Rails encrypted credentials\n- Use `--reuse` flag to avoid exposing registry credentials\n- Review migrations before production deploy\n- Test on staging first\n- Keep Kamal gem updated\n\n### ⚠️ Ask First\n\n- Modifying `deploy.*.yml` files\n- Changing server SSH configurations\n- Deploying to production outside of CI/CD\n- Running destructive rake tasks on production\n\n### 🚫 Never Do\n\n- Commit `master.key` files\n- Hardcode passwords in deploy configs\n- Deploy directly to production without staging test\n- Skip migrations testing\n- Force deploy without health checks\n\n## Monitoring\n\n### Post-Deployment Verification\n\n```bash\n# 1. Check app is running\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app details -d production''\n\n# 2. Check logs for errors\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app logs -d production --tail 100''\n\n# 3. Test critical paths (console)\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal app exec -d production -i --reuse \"bin/rails console\"''\n> User.count\n> # Test other critical models\n\n# 4. Check Sidekiq\n# Visit: https://your-domain.com/sidekiq\n```\n\n### Monitoring Endpoints\n\n- **Sidekiq Web UI**: `https://domain.com/sidekiq`\n- **Health Check**: `https://domain.com/health` (if configured)\n- **App Logs**: Via Kamal `app logs` command\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Command Pattern\n\n**ALL Kamal commands:**\n```bash\nzsh -c ''source ~/.zshrc && chruby 3.2.2 && bundle exec kamal <command> -d <env> [flags]''\n```\n\n### Common Operations\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Deploy | `kamal deploy -d staging` |\n| Rollback | `kamal rollback -d staging` |\n| Console | `kamal app exec -d staging -i --reuse \"bin/rails console\"` |\n| Run rake task | `kamal app exec -d staging --reuse \"bin/rails <task>\"` |\n| View logs | `kamal app logs -d staging` |\n| Check status | `kamal app details -d staging` |\n\n### Key Flags\n\n- `-d <env>` - Destination (staging/production)\n- `-i` / `--interactive` - Interactive mode (console)\n- `--reuse` - Reuse SSH connection\n- `--version=<branch>` - Deploy specific branch\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **Kamal Docs**: https://kamal-deploy.org/\n- **kw-app Ansible Setup**: `ansible/README.md`\n- **Server Provisioning**: `ansible/playbooks/`\n- **Deploy Configs**: `config/deploy.*.yml`\n\n---\n\n**Version**: 2.0  \n**Last Updated**: 2024-01  \n**Maintained By**: kw-app team"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:36:48.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing zero-downtime deployment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要零停机时间部署能力的 DevOps Agents。","ja":"ゼロダウンタイムのデプロイ機能が必要なDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"제로 다운타임 배포 기능이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan capacidades de implementación sin tiempo de inactividad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin de capacités de déploiement sans temps d''arrêt.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die Zero-Downtime-Deploy-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de capacidades de implantação sem tempo de inatividade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих возможностей развертывания без простоя.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات النشر بدون توقف عن العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy applications with rolling restarts, automated migrations, and Docker-based deployment using Kamal and SSH-based remote execution.","zh":"赋予代理部署应用程序的能力，使用滚动重启、自动迁移和使用Kamal及SSH的基于Docker的部署进行远程执行。","ja":"KamalとSSHを使用したローリング再起動、自動移行、Dockerベースのデプロイによるリモート実行で、アプリケーションのデプロイを可能にします。","ko":"카말과 SSH를 사용하여 롤링 재시작, 자동 마이그레이션 및 도커 기반 배포를 통한 원격 실행으로 애플리케이션을 배포할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar aplicaciones con reinicios en rol, migraciones automatizadas y despliegue basado en Docker utilizando Kamal y ejecución remota basada en SSH.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications avec des redémarrages progressifs, des migrations automatisées et un déploiement basé sur Docker en utilisant Kamal et une exécution à distance basée sur SSH.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Anwendungen mit rollierenden Neustarts, automatisierten Migrationen und Docker-basiertem Deployment unter Verwendung von Kamal und SSH-basierter Remote-Ausführung zu deployen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a implantar aplicações com reinícios rolantes, migrações automatizadas e implantação baseada em Docker usando Kamal e execução remota baseada em SSH.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения с роллинг-рестартами, автоматическими миграциями и развертыванием на основе Docker с использованием Kamal и удаленной SSH-выполнением.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من نشر التطبيقات بإعادة تشغيل متسلسلة، وهجرة آلية، ونشر استنادا إلى Docker باستخدام Kamal والتنفيذ البعدي المبني على SSH."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating staging and production deployments","Generating automated migrations before deploy","Debugging zero-downtime deployment issues"],"zh":["自动化预发布和生产环境部署","在部署前自动生成自动迁移","调试零停机时间部署问题"],"ja":["ステージングとプロダクションのデプロイの自動化","デプロイ前の自動移行の生成","ゼロダウンタイムのデプロイの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["예제 및 프로덕션 환경 배포 자동화","배포 전 자동 마이그레이션 생성","제로 다운타임 배포 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar despliegues de staging y producción","Generar migraciones automatizadas antes de desplegar","Depurar problemas de despliegue sin tiempo de inactividad"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements de staging et de production","Générer des migrations automatisées avant de déployer","Déboguer les problèmes de déploiement sans temps d''arrêt"],"de":["Automatisieren von Staging- und Produktions-Deployments","Automatisierte Migrationen vor dem Deploy generieren","Fehler bei Zero-Downtime-Deployments debuggen"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de staging e produção","Gerar migrações automatizadas antes da implantação","Depurar problemas de implantação sem tempo de inatividade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание в средах staging и production","Генерировать автоматические миграции перед развертыванием","Отлаживать проблемы развертывания без простоя"],"ar":["أتمتة نشر الإنتاج والتجربة","توليد هجرات آلية قبل النشر","تصحيح مشاكل نشر بدون توقف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) installed locally","Limited to ARM64 and x86_64 architectures"],"zh":["需要本地安装Ruby 3.2.2（通过chruby）","仅限ARM64和x86_64架构"],"ja":["ローカルにRuby 3.2.2（chruby経由）をインストールする必要がある","ARM64とx86_64アーキテクチャのみ"],"ko":["루비 3.2.2(chruby를 통해)가 로컬에 설치되어 있어야 함","ARM64 및 x86_64 아키텍처만 지원"],"es":["Requiere Ruby 3.2.2 (a través de chruby) instalado localmente","Limitado a arquitecturas ARM64 y x86_64"],"fr":["Nécessite Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) installé localement","Limité aux architectures ARM64 et x86_64"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) lokal installiert","Begrenzt auf ARM64- und x86_64-Architekturen"],"pt":["Requer Ruby 3.2.2 (via chruby) instalado localmente","Limitado às arquiteturas ARM64 e x86_64"],"ru":["Требует Ruby 3.2.2 (через chruby), установленного локально","Ограничен архитектурами ARM64 и x86_64"],"ar":["يتطلب Ruby 3.2.2 (من خلال chruby) مثبتا محليا","محدود بالهيكليات ARM64 و x86_64"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e16f5f46b321a80cf9a8c321b21b9cb1502319711abcb32ad5fb7f314b83cf8d","qualityScore":46}');
