t","Integração de testes com OpenGL","SDK compilado para C/C#","Recursos avançados de depuração","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas"],"ru":["Разработка игр на Rust","Интеграционное тестирование с OpenGL","SDK, скомпилированный для C/C#","Расширенные возможности отладки","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب بالرست","إدماج اختبار مع OpenGL","SDK مجمّع ل C/C#","ميزات متقدمة لتصحيح الأخطاء","دعم منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Rust构建OpenGL游戏引擎","什么是集成测试","AI智能代理的集成测试","Rust游戏引擎","C/C# SDK","OpenGL游戏引擎","AI智能代理工具"],"ja":["RustでOpenGLゲームエンジンを構築する方法","統合テストとは","AIエージェントの統合テスト","Rustゲームエンジン","C/C# SDK","OpenGLゲームエンジン","AIエージェントツール"],"ko":["러스트로 구축된 OpenGL 게임 엔진 사용법","통합 테스트란","AI 에이전트의 통합 테스트","러스트 게임 엔진","C/C# SDK","OpenGL 게임 엔진","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de integración","qué es la integración de pruebas","alternativas a la integración de juegos","integración de juegos vs pruebas unitarias","instalación de herramientas de integración","guía de configuración de la integración de juegos","desarrollo de juegos con OpenGL y Rust","mejora de habilidades de desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''intégration","qu''est-ce que l''outillage d''intégration","alternatives à l''intégration de jeux","intégration de jeux vs tests unitaires","installation des outils d''intégration","guide de configuration de l''intégration de jeux","développement de jeux avec OpenGL et Rust","amélioration des compétences de développement de jeux"],"de":["wie man Integrationstools verwendet","was sind Integrationstests","Alternativen zur Integration von Spielen","Integration von Spielen vs Einheitstests","Installation von Integrationstools","Anleitung zur Konfiguration der Spielintegration","Spielentwicklung mit OpenGL und Rust","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsfähigkeiten von Spielen"],"pt":["como usar integração de testes","o que é integração de testes","ferramentas de integração de testes","integração de testes em Rust","alternativas para integração de testes","guia de instalação de integração de testes","configuração de integração de testes","integração de testes vs unit test"],"ru":["как использовать интеграционное тестирование","что такое интеграционное тестирование","инструменты интеграционного тестирования","интеграционное тестирование на Rust","альтернативы интеграционного тестирования","установка интеграционного тестирования","настройка интеграционного тестирования","интеграционное тестирование vs юнит-тест"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إدماج اختبار","ما هو إدماج اختبار","أدوات إدماج اختبار","إدماج اختبار بالرست","بديل إدماج اختبار","دليل تثبيت إدماج اختبار","إعداد إدماج اختبار","إدماج اختبار مقابل اختبار الوحدة"]}},"owner":"aram-devdocs","repo":"GoudEngine","repoPath":"aram-devdocs/GoudEngine","stars":3,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T07:48:02Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"integration-testing","description":"Integration test patterns for Rust game engine with GL context and FFI boundaries","bodyPreview":"# Integration Testing\n\nPatterns and conventions for writing integration tests in GoudEngine, covering cross-module interactions, GL context management, and FFI boundary testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse when writing tests that exercise multiple modules together, test FFI boundaries end-to-end, or validate SDK wrappers against the Rust core.\n\n## Test Organization\n\n```\ngoud_engine/\n├── src/\n│   ├── ecs/\n│   │   └── mod.rs          # Unit tests in #[cfg(test)] module\n│   ├── ffi/\n│   │   └── mod.rs","body":"# Integration Testing\n\nPatterns and conventions for writing integration tests in GoudEngine, covering cross-module interactions, GL context management, and FFI boundary testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse when writing tests that exercise multiple modules together, test FFI boundaries end-to-end, or validate SDK wrappers against the Rust core.\n\n## Test Organization\n\n```\ngoud_engine/\n├── src/\n│   ├── ecs/\n│   │   └── mod.rs          # Unit tests in #[cfg(test)] module\n│   ├── ffi/\n│   │   └── mod.rs          # Unit tests for FFI functions\n│   └── libs/graphics/\n│       └── mod.rs          # Unit tests (may need GL context)\n├── tests/                   # Integration tests\n│   ├── ecs_integration.rs\n│   ├── ffi_integration.rs\n│   └── graphics_integration.rs\n└── benches/                 # Benchmarks (criterion)\n    └── ecs_bench.rs\n\nsdks/\n├── csharp.tests/            # C# SDK tests (xUnit)\n└── python/\n    └── test_bindings.py     # Python SDK tests\n```\n\n## GL Context Management\n\nMany graphics tests require an OpenGL context. Use the helper:\n\n```rust\nuse crate::test_helpers::init_test_context;\n\n#[test]\nfn test_renderer_initialization() {\n    let _ctx = init_test_context();\n    // GL-dependent test code here\n}\n```\n\n**Rules**:\n- Tests that need GL MUST call `init_test_context()` at the start\n- Tests that do NOT need GL (math, ECS logic, data structures) MUST NOT call it\n- GL tests may fail in CI environments without a display — mark test expectations accordingly\n\n## Test Factory Patterns\n\nCreate reusable factories for common test objects:\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod test_helpers {\n    use super::*;\n\n    pub fn create_test_entity(world: &mut World) -> Entity {\n        let entity = world.spawn();\n        world.add_component(entity, Transform2D::default());\n        entity\n    }\n\n    pub fn create_test_sprite(world: &mut World, entity: Entity) {\n        world.add_component(entity, Sprite::new(\"test_texture\"));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## FFI Integration Testing\n\nTest the full path: Rust → FFI → SDK wrapper.\n\n```rust\n#[test]\nfn test_ffi_create_entity_roundtrip() {\n    // 1. Create context via FFI\n    let ctx = unsafe { ffi::create_context() };\n    assert!(!ctx.is_null());\n\n    // 2. Create entity via FFI\n    let entity_id = unsafe { ffi::create_entity(ctx) };\n    assert!(entity_id > 0);\n\n    // 3. Clean up\n    unsafe { ffi::destroy_context(ctx) };\n}\n```\n\n**FFI test rules**:\n- Always test null pointer handling (pass null, expect error code)\n- Test memory lifecycle (create → use → destroy)\n- Verify error codes match expected values\n- Test string marshaling (CStr roundtrips)\n\n## Cross-SDK Parity Tests\n\nVerify the same operation produces the same result in both SDKs:\n\n1. Write the test in Rust (ground truth)\n2. Write equivalent test in Python (`test_bindings.py`)\n3. Write equivalent test in C# (`csharp.tests/`)\n4. Results must match across all three\n\n## Test Categories\n\n| Category | Location | Needs GL | Run Command |\n|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| Unit (Rust) | `#[cfg(test)]` in source | Depends | `cargo test` |\n| Integration (Rust) | `goud_engine/tests/` | Often | `cargo test --test <name>` |\n| FFI boundary | `goud_engine/tests/` | Sometimes | `cargo test --test ffi_*` |\n| Python SDK | `sdks/python/test_bindings.py` | No | `python3 sdks/python/test_bindings.py` |\n| C# SDK | `sdks/csharp.tests/` | No | `dotnet test sdks/csharp.tests/` |\n| Benchmarks | `goud_engine/benches/` | Sometimes | `cargo bench` |\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore submitting integration tests:\n\n- [ ] Tests are in the correct location (unit vs integration)\n- [ ] GL-dependent tests use `init_test_context()`\n- [ ] Non-GL tests verified to run without display\n- [ ] FFI tests check null pointer cases\n- [ ] FFI tests verify memory cleanup\n- [ ] Test names describe the scenario being tested\n- [ ] No `#[ignore]` or `todo!()` in test code\n- [ ] Arrange-Act-Assert pattern followed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T12:54:07.881Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-based AI Agents requiring comprehensive cross-module testing and validation of OpenGL game engines with C/C# SDKs.","zh":"适用于需要对OpenGL游戏引擎进行全面跨模块测试和验证的Rust-based AI Agents，尤其是那些使用C/C# SDK的场景。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが、OpenGLゲームエンジンに対する包括的なクロスモジュールテストと検証を必要とする場合に最適です。C/C# SDKを使用するシナリオにも対応しています。","ko":"OpenGL 게임 엔진에 대한 포괄적인 크로스 모듈 테스트 및 검증이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 C/C# SDK를 사용하는 시나리오에서 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Rust que requieren pruebas y validación de módulos cruzados integrales de motores de juego OpenGL con SDKs de C/C#.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Rust nécessitant des tests et une validation de modules croisés complets des moteurs de jeu OpenGL avec des SDK C/C#.","de":"Ideal für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die umfassende Cross-Modul-Tests und Validierungen von OpenGL-Spiel-Engines mit C/C#-SDKs erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Rust que exigem testes e validação abrangentes entre módulos de motores de jogo OpenGL com SDKs em C/C#.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих всестороннего тестирования и проверки модулей игровых двигов OpenGL с SDK C/C#.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تعتمد على روست وتحتاج إلى اختبار وتحقق متقاطع وشامل بين الوحدات النمطية لمحركات الألعاب التي تعمل بال OPENGL و SDKs C/C#."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to thoroughly test GL context management, FFI boundaries, and SDK wrappers against the Rust core, ensuring seamless interactions between modules using patterns and conventions for integration testing in GoudEngine, leveraging OpenGL and Rust.","zh":"赋予代理全面测试GL上下文管理、FFI边界和SDK包装器与Rust核心之间的交互，确保使用GoudEngine中的模式和约定进行集成测试，从而实现模块之间的无缝交互，利用OpenGL和Rust。","ja":"エージェントに、GLコンテキスト管理、FFIの境界、SDKラッパーをRustコアに対して徹底的にテストする能力を与え、GoudEngineでの統合テストのパターンと規約を使用してモジュール間のシームレスなやり取りを保証します。OpenGLとRustを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 GL 컨텍스트 관리, FFI 경계 및 SDK 래퍼를 Rust 코어에 대해 철저히 테스트할 수 있도록 하여 GoudEngine의 통합 테스트 패턴 및 규칙을 사용하여 모듈 간의 무결점 상호 작용을 보장합니다. OpenGL 및 Rust를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar a fondo la gestión del contexto GL, los límites FFI y los wrappers de SDK frente al núcleo de Rust, garantizando interacciones sin problemas entre módulos utilizando patrones y convenciones para pruebas de integración en GoudEngine, aprovechando OpenGL y Rust.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester en profondeur la gestion du contexte GL, les limites FFI et les wrappers de SDK par rapport au noyau Rust, garantissant des interactions sans problème entre les modules en utilisant des modèles et des conventions pour les tests d''intégration dans GoudEngine, en exploitant OpenGL et Rust.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GL-Kontext-Management, FFI-Grenzen und SDK-Wrapper gegen den Rust-Kern umfassend zu testen, und stellt so nahtlose Interaktionen zwischen Modulen unter Verwendung von Mustern und Konventionen für Integrationstests in GoudEngine sicher, wobei OpenGL und Rust genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a testar completamente a gestão de contexto GL, limites FFI e wrappers de SDK contra o núcleo Rust, garantindo interações sem problemas entre módulos usando padrões e convenções para testes de integração no GoudEngine, aproveitando OpenGL e Rust.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тщательно тестировать управление контекстом GL, границы FFI и обертки SDK относительно ядра Rust, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие между модулями с использованием шаблонов и соглашений для интеграционного тестирования в GoudEngine, используя OpenGL и Rust.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من اختبار إدارة سياق GL وحدود FFI وأغلفة SDK بشكل شامل ضد النواة روست، مما يضمن تفاعلات سلسة بين الوحدات باستخدام الأنماط والاتفاقيات لاختبار التكامل في GoudEngine، مستفيداً من OpenGL وروست."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing cross-module interactions in OpenGL game engines","Validating FFI boundaries end-to-end","Debugging SDK wrappers against the Rust core"],"zh":["在OpenGL游戏引擎中测试跨模块交互","端到端验证FFI边界","调试SDK包装器与Rust核心"],"ja":["OpenGLゲームエンジンでのクロスモジュール間の相互作用のテスト","エンドツーエンドでFFIの境界を検証する","SDKラッパーをRustコアに対してデバッグする"],"ko":["OpenGL 게임 엔진에서 크로스 모듈 상호 작용 테스트","엔드 투 엔드 FFI 경계 검증","SDK 래퍼를 Rust 코어에 대해 디버깅"],"es":["Pruebas de interacciones entre módulos en motores de juego OpenGL","Validación de límites FFI de extremo a extremo","Depuración de wrappers de SDK frente al núcleo de Rust"],"fr":["Tests d''interactions entre modules dans les moteurs de jeu OpenGL","Validation des limites FFI de bout en bout","Débogage des wrappers de SDK par rapport au noyau Rust"],"de":["Testen von Interaktionen zwischen Modulen in OpenGL-Spiel-Engines","Validierung von FFI-Grenzen von Ende zu Ende","Fehlersuche bei SDK-Wrappern gegen den Rust-Kern"],"pt":["Testar interações entre módulos em motores de jogo OpenGL","Validar limites FFI de ponta a ponta","Depurar wrappers de SDK contra o núcleo Rust"],"ru":["Тестировать взаимодействия между модулями в игровых двигах OpenGL","Проверять границы FFI от начала до конца","Отлаживать обертки SDK относительно ядра Rust"],"ar":["اختبار التفاعلات بين الوحدات في محركات الألعاب التي تعمل بال OPENGL","تحقق من حدود FFI من النهاية إلى النهاية","تصحيح أغلفة SDK مقابل النواة روست"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GoudEngine setup","Rust and C/C# compatibility needed","OpenGL context management required"],"zh":["需要GoudEngine设置","需要Rust和C/C#兼容性","需要OpenGL上下文管理"],"ja":["GoudEngineの設定が必要","RustとC/C#の互換性が必要","OpenGLコンテキスト管理が必要"],"ko":["GoudEngine 설정 필요","Rust 및 C/C# 호환성 필요","OpenGL 컨텍스트 관리 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GoudEngine","Se requiere compatibilidad con Rust y C/C#","Se requiere gestión de contexto de OpenGL"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GoudEngine","Compatibilité Rust et C/C# requise","Gestion du contexte OpenGL requise"],"de":["Benötigt GoudEngine-Setup","Rust- und C/C#-Kompatibilität erforderlich","OpenGL-Kontext-Management erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GoudEngine","Compatibilidade Rust e C/C# necessária","Gerenciamento de contexto OpenGL necessário"],"ru":["Требуется настройка GoudEngine","Необходима совместимость Rust и C/C#","Требуется управление контекстом OpenGL"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GoudEngine","مطلوب توافق روست و C/C#","مطلوب إدارة سياق OPENGL"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b08ff6de5a12515443be99b524834d70cba9beb841f78391f814e0fb2221ca4e","qualityScore":46}');
