иков с документацией и сообществом"],"ar":["تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام React","التكامل مع Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم المطورين بالوثائق والمجتمع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Agentic Ai","gogogo","AI工具","智能解决方案","如何使用gogogo","gogogo安装","gogogo设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Agentic Ai","gogogo","AIツール","智能ソリューション","gogogoの使い方","gogogoのインストール","gogogoの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Agentic Ai","gogogo","AI 도구","智能 솔루션","gogogo 사용법","gogogo 설치","gogogo 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar gogogo","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","gogogo alternativa","gogogo vs otros agentes","instalación de gogogo","guía de configuración de gogogo","desarrollo de aplicaciones con gogogo"],"fr":["comment utiliser gogogo","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","gogogo alternative","gogogo vs autres agents","installation de gogogo","guide de configuration de gogogo","développement d''applications avec gogogo"],"de":["wie man gogogo verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","gogogo Alternative","gogogo vs andere Agenten","Installation von gogogo","Konfigurationsanleitung für gogogo","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit gogogo"],"pt":["como usar Agente de IA","o que é Agente de IA","Agente de IA vs outros agentes","instalar Agente de IA","guia de configuração do Agente de IA","alternativas para Agente de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент vs другие агенты","установить ИИ Агент","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента","альтернативы ИИ Агенту"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل وكلاء آخرون","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لوكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ContentsUS","repo":"Agentic-AI-Paji","repoPath":"ContentsUS/Agentic-AI-Paji","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T09:14:35Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gogogo","description":"Execute the most recent plan issue step-by-step. Use when user types gogogo or when ready to implement a planned feature/fix. Follow the plan, make code changes, test, and create PR.","bodyPreview":"# GOGOGO - Execute Planned Implementation\n\n## Purpose\nExecute the implementation plan step-by-step, following the detailed plan from the most recent \"plan:\" issue.\n\n## When to Use\n- User explicitly types `gogogo`\n- After creating a plan with `nnn`\n- Ready to implement a planned feature or fix\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Find Implementation Issue\n\nFind the most recent plan issue:\n```bash\ngh issue list --label \"plan\" --state open --limit 1 --json number,title\n```\n\n**If no plan issue found:**\n- Tell user: \"N","body":"# GOGOGO - Execute Planned Implementation\n\n## Purpose\nExecute the implementation plan step-by-step, following the detailed plan from the most recent \"plan:\" issue.\n\n## When to Use\n- User explicitly types `gogogo`\n- After creating a plan with `nnn`\n- Ready to implement a planned feature or fix\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Find Implementation Issue\n\nFind the most recent plan issue:\n```bash\ngh issue list --label \"plan\" --state open --limit 1 --json number,title\n```\n\n**If no plan issue found:**\n- Tell user: \"No plan issue found. Create one with `nnn` first.\"\n- Stop execution\n\n**If plan issue found:**\n- Display: \"Found plan: #[number] - [title]\"\n- Load the plan details:\n```bash\ngh issue view [number]\n```\n\n### 2. Prepare Branch\n\n```bash\n# Check current branch\nCURRENT_BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\n\n# If on main, create feature branch\nif [ \"$CURRENT_BRANCH\" = \"main\" ]; then\n  BRANCH_NAME=\"feat/issue-[number]-[description]\"\n  git checkout -b $BRANCH_NAME\nfi\n\n# Ensure working directory is clean\ngit status\n```\n\n### 3. Execute Implementation\n\n**Follow the plan step-by-step:**\n\nFor each phase in the plan:\n1. **Announce Phase**: Tell user \"Starting Phase X: [phase name]\"\n2. **Read Required Files**: Use `Read` tool for files mentioned in the phase\n3. **Make Changes**: Use `Edit` or `Write` tools as needed\n4. **Verify Changes**: Check that changes compile/work\n5. **Update Checklist**: Comment on the issue to mark steps complete\n\n**Important:**\n- Follow the plan exactly - don''t add unplanned features\n- Keep changes focused and minimal\n- Test after each significant change\n- If you discover issues with the plan, ask user before deviating\n\n### 4. Test & Verify\n\nAfter implementation:\n```bash\n# Run build (if applicable)\n[build-command]\n\n# Run tests (if applicable)\n[test-command]\n\n# Manual verification\n# Test key scenarios mentioned in the plan\n```\n\n**If tests fail:**\n- Fix the issues\n- Re-run tests\n- Don''t proceed until tests pass\n\n### 5. Commit & Push\n\n```bash\n# Stage all changes\ngit add -A\n\n# Create descriptive commit\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat: [Brief description from plan]\n\n- What: [Specific changes made]\n- Why: [Reason from plan]\n- Impact: [What this affects]\n\nImplements #[plan-issue-number]\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# Push to remote\ngit push -u origin $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\n### 6. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"feat: [Same as commit title]\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n[Brief overview of what was implemented]\n\n## Implementation Details\n- [Key change 1]\n- [Key change 2]\n- [Key change 3]\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Build successful\n- [x] Tests passing\n- [x] Manual testing completed\n\n## Related Issues\nImplements #[plan-issue-number]\n\n---\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 7. Update Plan Issue\n\nComment on the plan issue:\n```bash\ngh issue comment [plan-number] --body \"✅ Implementation complete!\n\n**PR Created:** #[pr-number]\n\n**What was done:**\n- [Summary of implementation]\n\n**Test Results:**\n- Build: ✅ Passing\n- Tests: ✅ All passing\n- Manual: ✅ Verified\n\nReady for review!\"\n```\n\n### 8. Report to User\n\nProvide a complete summary:\n```\n✅ Implementation Complete!\n\n**Plan Issue:** #[plan-number]\n**PR Created:** #[pr-number]\n**Branch:** [branch-name]\n\n**Changes:**\n- [file1]: [what changed]\n- [file2]: [what changed]\n\n**Tests:** ✅ All passing\n**Build:** ✅ Successful\n\n**Next steps:**\n1. Review the PR: [pr-url]\n2. Request review from team\n3. Merge when approved\n\n⚠️ **IMPORTANT:** Don''t merge until user explicitly approves!\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n- **Follow the Plan**: Don''t deviate without asking\n- **Test Everything**: Never skip testing\n- **Commit Often**: Make logical commits as you progress\n- **Safety First**: Follow all git safety rules (no --force)\n- **Never Merge**: Only create PR, wait for user approval\n- **Ask Questions**: If plan is unclear, ask user before proceeding\n- **Update Issue**: Keep the plan issue updated with progress\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**If build fails:**\n1. Read error messages carefully\n2. Fix the issues\n3. Re-run build\n4. Continue only when passing\n\n**If plan is incomplete:**\n1. Ask user for clarification\n2. Update plan issue with questions\n3. Wait for user response\n\n**If stuck:**\n1. Document what you tried\n2. Comment on plan issue with blockers\n3. Ask user for guidance\n\n## Success Criteria\n- ✅ All plan phases completed\n- ✅ All tests passing\n- ✅ Build successful\n- ✅ PR created (not merged)\n- ✅ Plan issue updated\n- ✅ User provided with clear summary\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T15:24:50.063Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated implementation execution based on detailed plans.","zh":"非常适合需要基于详细计划自动执行实现的开发智能体。","ja":"詳細な計画に基づいて自動化された実装の実行を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"상세한 계획을 기반으로 자동화된 구현 실행이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una implementación automática basada en planes detallados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une exécution d''implémentation automatisée basée sur des plans détaillés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Implementierung auf der Grundlage detaillierter Pläne benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de execução automatizada de implementações com base em planos detalhados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное выполнение реализации на основе детальных планов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ آلي للتنفيذ بناءً على خطط مفصلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute planned implementations step-by-step, utilizing GitHub issues and JSON data for seamless execution, and automates the process of finding the most recent plan issue using gh issue list commands.","zh":"使智能体能够逐步执行计划好的实现，利用 GitHub issues 和 JSON 数据实现无缝执行，并使用 gh issue list 命令自动查找最新计划问题的过程。","ja":"エージェントが計画された実装を段階的に実行できるようにし、GitHub issues と JSON データを利用してシームレスな実行を実現し、gh issue list コマンドを使用して最新の計画 issue を見つけるプロセスを自動化します。","ko":"에이전트가 계획된 구현을 단계별로 실행할 수 있도록 지원하며, GitHub issues와 JSON 데이터를 활용하여 원활한 실행을 가능하게 하고, gh issue list 명령을 사용하여 가장 최근의 계획 issue를 찾는 프로세스를 자동화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar implementaciones planificadas paso a paso, utilizando problemas de GitHub y datos JSON para una ejecución sin problemas, y automatiza el proceso de encontrar el problema de plan más reciente utilizando comandos de lista de problemas de gh.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des implementations planifiées étape par étape, en utilisant des problèmes GitHub et des données JSON pour une exécution sans accroc, et automatise le processus de recherche du problème de plan le plus récent en utilisant des commandes de liste de problèmes gh.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, geplante Implementierungen Schritt für Schritt auszuführen, indem sie GitHub-Probleme und JSON-Daten für eine reibungslose Ausführung verwenden und automatisiert den Prozess der Suche nach dem aktuellen Planproblem mithilfe von gh-Problemlistebefehlen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a executar implementações planejadas passo a passo, utilizando problemas do GitHub e dados JSON para uma execução perfeita, e automatiza o processo de encontrar o problema de plano mais recente usando comandos gh issue list.","ru":"Позволяет агентам пошагово выполнять запланированные реализации, используя проблемы GitHub и данные JSON для беспрепятственного выполнения, и автоматизирует процесс поиска самого последнего плана с помощью команд gh issue list.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ عمليات التنفيذ المخطط لها خطوة بخطوة، باستخدام قضايا GitHub وبيانات JSON لتنفيذ سلس، وأتمتة عملية العثور على أحدث قضية خطة باستخدام أوامر gh issue list."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating feature implementations","Executing planned fixes","Streamlining development workflows"],"zh":["自动化功能实现","执行计划好的修复","简化开发工作流程"],"ja":["機能実装の自動化","計画された修正の実行","開発ワークフローの効率化"],"ko":["기능 구현 자동화","계획된 수정 사항 실행","개발 워크플로우 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de funciones","Ejecución de soluciones planificadas","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation des implementations de fonctions","Exécution de correctifs planifiés","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung von Funktionsimplementierungen","Ausführung geplanter Korrekturen","Optimierung von Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Automatização de implementações de recursos","Execução de correções planejadas","Simplificação de fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация реализации функций","Выполнение запланированных исправлений","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة تنفيذ الميزات","تنفيذ الإصلاحات المخطط لها","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access","Needs gh issue list command functionality","Limited to executing plans labeled as ''plan'' and in open state"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 访问权限","需要 gh issue list 命令功能","仅限于执行标记为 ''plan'' 且处于打开状态的任务"],"ja":["GitHub へのアクセスが必要","gh issue list コマンド機能が必要","''plan'' とラベル付けされオープン状態の計画の実行に限定される"],"ko":["GitHub 액세스 권한 필요","gh issue list 명령 기능 필요","''plan''으로 레이블이 지정되고 열린 상태의 계획 실행으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub","Necesita funcionalidad de comando de lista de problemas de gh","Limitado a la ejecución de planes etiquetados como ''plan'' y en estado abierto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à GitHub","Nécessite la fonctionnalité de commande de liste de problèmes gh","Limité à l''exécution de plans étiquetés comme ''plan'' et dans un état ouvert"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub","Benötigt Funktionalität des gh-Problemlistebefehls","Eingeschränkt auf die Ausführung von Plänen, die als ''Plan'' gekennzeichnet und im offenen Zustand sind"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao GitHub","Necessita da funcionalidade do comando gh issue list","Limitado à execução de planos rotulados como ''plan'' e em estado aberto"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к GitHub","Требуется функциональность команды gh issue list","Ограничено выполнением планов, помеченных как ''plan'' и находящихся в открытом состоянии"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى GitHub","يحتاج إلى وظيفة أمر gh issue list","يقتصر على تنفيذ الخطط المسماة ''plan'' والحالة المفتوحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"266f381481f13f601b74def419bf1acc3549fa1a67bbe713cda15a363450b298","qualityScore":46}');
