ra gestionar git worktree, que permite a los desarrolladores gestionar múltiples ramas de manera eficiente","fr":"gwt est une CLI pour gérer les git worktree, ce qui permet aux développeurs de gérer plusieurs branches de manière efficace","de":"gwt ist eine CLI für die Verwaltung von git worktree, mit der Entwickler mehrere Branches effizient verwalten können","pt":"O gwt é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para gerenciar worktrees git, ajudando a organizar e gerenciar seus projetos","ru":"gwt - это инструмент командной строки для управления git worktree, помогающий организовать и управлять вашими проектами","ar":"gwt هو أداة سطر أوامر لإدارة شجرة العمل جيت، تساعد على تنظيم وإدارة مشاريعك","en":"A git worktree management CLI"},"definition":{"en":"A git worktree management CLI"},"features":{"zh":["简化Git工作树管理","提高开发效率","支持多个Git仓库管理","提供命令行接口","易于使用和安装"],"ja":["Gitワークツリー管理の簡素化","開発効率の向上","複数のGitリポジトリ管理のサポート","コマンドラインインターフェースの提供","簡単な使用とインストール"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리 관리의 간소화","개발 효율의 향상","여러 개의 Git 저장소 관리 지원","명령줄 인터페이스 제공","쉽게 사용하고 설치"],"es":["Gestión de múltiples ramas","Creación de ramas de manera eficiente","Integración con git","Interfaz de línea de comandos","Soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs branches","Création de branches de manière efficace","Intégration avec git","Interface de ligne de commande","Support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Verwaltung von mehreren Branches","Erstellung von Branches auf effiziente Weise","Integration mit git","Befehlszeilen-Interface","Unterstützung für Entwickler mit Hilfe von KI-Agents"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de worktrees git","Interface de linha de comando intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios","Fácil integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Управление git worktree","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс командной строки","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев","Легкая интеграция с инструментами разработки","Повышение производительности разработчика"],"ar":["إدارة شجرة العمل جيت","واجهة سطر أوامر سهلة الاستخدام","دعم متعدد للمخازن","تكامل سهل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين إنتاجية المطور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gwt安装","Git工作树管理","gwt使用教程","Git CLI工具","gwt与git差异","gwt替代工具","如何使用gwt","gwtsetup指南","gwt入门"],"ja":["gwtのインストール","Gitワークツリー管理","gwtの使用方法","Git CLIツール","gwtとgitの違い","gwtの代替ツール","gwtの使い方","gwtのセットアップガイド","gwtの入門"],"ko":["gwt 설치","Git 작업 트리 관리","gwt 사용법","Git CLI 도구","gwt와 git의 차이","gwt 대체 도구","gwt 사용 방법","gwt 설정 가이드","gwt 입문"],"es":["gwt","git worktree","herramientas de desarrollo","cómo usar gwt","qué es git worktree","gwt vs git","instalación de gwt","guía de configuración de gwt"],"fr":["gwt","git worktree","outils de développement","comment utiliser gwt","quoi est git worktree","gwt vs git","installation de gwt","guide de configuration de gwt"],"de":["gwt","git worktree","Entwicklertools","wie man gwt verwendet","was ist git worktree","gwt vs git","Installation von gwt","Konfigurationsanleitung für gwt mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar gwt","o que é gwt","gwt vs git","gwt alternative","gwt install","gwt setup guide","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de worktree git"],"ru":["как использовать gwt","что такое gwt","gwt vs git","gwt альтернатива","gwt установка","gwt руководство по настройке","инструменты разработки","управление git worktree"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام gwt","ما هو gwt","gwt مقابل جيت","بديل gwt","تثبيت gwt","دليل إعداد gwt","أدوات التطوير","إدارة شجرة العمل جيت"]}},"owner":"troydai","repo":"gwt","repoPath":"troydai/gwt","stars":5,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-05T13:53:20Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gwt","description":"Manage git worktrees using gwt for branch-based workflow. Use when switching branches, creating worktrees, listing worktrees, or cleaning up after merging PRs.","bodyPreview":"# GWT Worktree Management Skill\n\nYou have access to `gwt`, a Git worktree management tool that simplifies working with multiple branches simultaneously. Use gwt instead of raw `git worktree` commands for a streamlined workflow.\n\n## Available Commands\n\n### Switch to a Branch Worktree\n```bash\ngwt sw <branch>           # Switch to existing branch (creates worktree if needed)\ngwt sw -b <branch>        # Create new branch and switch to it\ngwt sw -m                 # Switch to main/master branch\ngwt s","body":"# GWT Worktree Management Skill\n\nYou have access to `gwt`, a Git worktree management tool that simplifies working with multiple branches simultaneously. Use gwt instead of raw `git worktree` commands for a streamlined workflow.\n\n## Available Commands\n\n### Switch to a Branch Worktree\n```bash\ngwt sw <branch>           # Switch to existing branch (creates worktree if needed)\ngwt sw -b <branch>        # Create new branch and switch to it\ngwt sw -m                 # Switch to main/master branch\ngwt sw <branch> --remote <remote>  # Switch to branch from specific remote\n```\n\n### List Worktrees\n```bash\ngwt ls                    # List all worktrees (truncated branch names)\ngwt ls --full             # List with full branch names\n```\n\n### Remove Worktrees\n```bash\ngwt rm <branch>           # Remove worktree for branch (prompts for confirmation)\ngwt rm <branch> -y        # Remove without confirmation\ngwt rm <branch> -b        # Remove worktree and delete the branch\ngwt rm <branch> -B        # Remove worktree and force-delete branch\ngwt rm --this             # Remove current worktree (switches to home first)\n```\n\n### Navigation\n```bash\ngwt home                  # Return to the main repository worktree\ngwt current               # Show current branch and worktree path (alias: gwt c)\n```\n\n## Workflow Patterns\n\n### Starting Work on a Feature\n1. Use `gwt sw -b feature/name` to create a new branch and worktree\n2. Work on the feature in the isolated worktree\n3. The original repository remains on its branch\n\n### Switching Between Tasks\n1. Use `gwt sw other-branch` to switch to another worktree\n2. No need to stash changes - each worktree is independent\n3. Use `gwt ls` to see all available worktrees\n\n### Cleaning Up After PR Merge\n1. Use `gwt home` to return to main repository\n2. Use `gwt rm feature/name -b` to remove worktree and delete merged branch\n3. Or use `gwt rm --this -b` if still in the feature worktree\n\n### Checking Current Location\nUse `gwt current` to see which branch and worktree you''re in.\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n- **Automatic directory switching**: gwt changes your shell''s working directory automatically\n- **Centralized storage**: Worktrees are stored in `~/.gwt_store`, keeping repos clean\n- **Just-in-time creation**: Worktrees are created automatically when switching to new branches\n- **Smart remote lookup**: Automatically finds and tracks remote branches\n\n## When to Use gwt\n\n- Switching between branches for code review or testing\n- Working on multiple features in parallel\n- Isolating experimental changes without affecting main work\n- Quick context switching without stashing changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:01:02.355Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Git worktree management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要简化Git工作树管理功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがGitのワークツリーマネージメント機能を簡素化する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 Git 작업 트리 관리 기능을 단순화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de gestión de árbol de trabajo de Git optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de l''arborescence de travail Git simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Git-Arbeitsbereichsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de worktree do Git simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности управления рабочим деревом Git.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متسلسلة لمشجرات Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage multiple branches simultaneously using Git worktree commands, simplifying workflows with features like automatic worktree creation and branch switching via `gwt sw` commands.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理多个分支的能力，使用Git工作树命令同时简化工作流程，具有自动工作树创建和分支切换等功能，例如通过`gwt sw`命令。","ja":"エージェントが複数のブランチを効率的に管理できるようにし、Gitワークツリーコマンドを使用してワークフローを簡素化します。自動ワークツリーコマンドの作成や`gwt sw`コマンドによるブランチの切り替えなどの機能を備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 분기를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며 Git 작업 트리 명령을 사용하여 워크플ロー를 단순화합니다. 자동 작업 트리 생성 및 `gwt sw` 명령을 통해 분기 전환 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de forma eficiente múltiples ramas simultáneamente utilizando comandos de Git worktree, simplificando los flujos de trabajo con características como la creación automática de árboles de trabajo y el cambio de rama a través de comandos `gwt sw`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement plusieurs branches simultanément en utilisant des commandes Git worktree, en simplifiant les flux de travail avec des fonctionnalités telles que la création automatique d''arborescences de travail et le commutateur de branche via des commandes `gwt sw`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, mehrere Zweige gleichzeitig effizient zu verwalten, indem sie Git-Arbeitsbereichsbefehle verwenden, und vereinfacht die Arbeitsabläufe mit Funktionen wie der automatischen Erstellung von Arbeitsbereichen und dem Umschalten von Zweigen über `gwt sw`-Befehle.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem de forma eficiente vários ramos simultaneamente usando comandos do Git worktree, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho com recursos como criação automática de worktree e alternação de ramo via comandos `gwt sw`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно управлять несколькими ветками одновременно, используя команды Git worktree, упрощая рабочие процессы с функциями, такими как автоматическое создание worktree и переключение веток с помощью команд `gwt sw`.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل من إدارة الفروع المتعددة بفعالية في وقت واحد باستخدام أوامر Git worktree، وبتبسيط سير العمل باستخدام ميزات مثل إنشاء worktree تلقائي وتغيير الفرع عبر أوامر `gwt sw`."},"useCases":{"en":["Switching to existing branches with `gwt sw`","Creating new branches and switching to them with `gwt sw -b`","Debugging branch-specific issues with isolated worktrees"],"zh":["使用`gwt sw`切换到现有分支","使用`gwt sw -b`创建新分支并切换到它们","使用隔离的工作树调试特定于分支的问题"],"ja":["`gwt sw`を使用して既存のブランチに切り替える","`gwt sw -b`を使用して新しいブランチを作成し、切り替える","分離されたワークツリーを使用してブランチ固有の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["`gwt sw`를 사용하여 기존 분기에 전환","`gwt sw -b`를 사용하여 새로운 분기를 생성하고 전환","분리된 작업 트리를 사용하여 분기별 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Cambiar a ramas existentes con `gwt sw`","Crear nuevas ramas y cambiar a ellas con `gwt sw -b`","Depurar problemas específicos de la rama con árboles de trabajo aislados"],"fr":["Basculer vers des branches existantes avec `gwt sw`","Créer de nouvelles branches et basculer vers elles avec `gwt sw -b`","Déboguer des problèmes spécifiques à la branche avec des arborescences de travail isolées"],"de":["Zu bestehenden Zweigen mit `gwt sw` wechseln","Neue Zweige erstellen und zu ihnen wechseln mit `gwt sw -b`","Zweig-spezifische Probleme mit isolierten Arbeitsbereichen debuggen"],"pt":["Alternar para ramos existentes com `gwt sw`","Criar novos ramos e alternar para eles com `gwt sw -b`","Depurar problemas específicos de ramo com worktrees isolados"],"ru":["Переключаться на существующие ветки с помощью `gwt sw`","Создавать новые ветки и переключаться на них с помощью `gwt sw -b`","Отлаживать проблемы, специфичные для ветки, с изолированными рабочими деревьями"],"ar":["تبديل إلى الفروع الحالية باستخدام `gwt sw`","إنشاء فروع جديدة والتبديل إليها باستخدام `gwt sw -b`","تصحيح الأعطال الخاصة بفرع معين باستخدام worktrees معزولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Command-line interface only"],"zh":["需要Git安装","仅命令行界面"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","コマンドラインインターフェースのみ"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요","명령줄 인터페이스만"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Solo interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Git","Interface en ligne de commande uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Nur Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Interface de linha de comando apenas"],"ru":["Требуется установка Git","Только командная строка интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"15b976ffdf382f6e894dbf24d25d42034cb1841ae6a39fc27a84915b8edbcf69","qualityScore":46}');
