,"pt":["Instalação de ferramentas Python com um único comando","Suporte a pacotes PyPI","Compatível com macOS, Linux e Windows","Instalação de versões específicas de pacotes","Uso simples e intuitivo"],"ru":["Установка инструментов Python с помощью одной команды","Поддержка пакетов PyPI","Совместимость с macOS, Linux и Windows","Установка конкретных версий пакетов","Простое и интуитивное использование"],"ar":["تثبيت أدوات بايثون باستخدام أمر واحد","دعم حزم باي بي آي","متوافق مع ماك او اس، لينكس وويندوز","تثبيت إصدارات محددة من الحزم","استخدام بسيط وسهل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python","uv","PyPI","macOS","Linux","Windows","ruff","Python","uv-python-tool-installer"],"ja":["Python","uv","PyPI","macOS","Linux","Windows","ruff","Python","uv-python-tool-installer"],"ko":["Python","uv","PyPI","macOS","Linux","Windows","ruff","Python","uv-python-tool-installer"],"es":["instalador de herramientas de Python","UV","PyPI","ruff","instalación de herramientas de Python","herramientas de desarrollo de Python","instalación de paquetes de Python","compatible con macOS","compatible con Linux","compatible con Windows"],"fr":["installeur d''outils Python","UV","PyPI","ruff","installation d''outils Python","outils de développement de Python","installation de paquets Python","compatible avec macOS","compatible avec Linux","compatible avec Windows"],"de":["Python-Tool-Installer","UV","PyPI","ruff","Installation von Python-Tools","Python-Entwicklertools","Installation von PyPI-Paketen","kompatibel mit macOS","kompatibel mit Linux","kompatibel mit Windows"],"pt":["uv-python-tool-installer","instalador de ferramentas python","ferramentas python","pacotes pypi","instalação de pacotes","desenvolvimento python"],"ru":["uv-python-tool-installer","установщик инструментов python","инструменты python","пакеты pypi","установка пакетов","разработка python"],"ar":["مثبت أدوات بايثون يو في","مثبت أدوات بايثون","أدوات بايثون","حزم باي بي آي","تثبيت الحزم","تطوير بايثون"]}},"owner":"aresbit","repo":"MateBot","repoPath":"aresbit/MateBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv-python-tool-installer","description":"Install Python command-line tools with a single command using uvx.sh (Astrals uv-based installer). Use when you need to install Python tools like ruff, black, mypy, or any PyPI package as a command-line tool. This skill provides simple curl commands for installing Python tools on macOS, Linux, and Windows.","bodyPreview":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncur","body":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/0.8.3/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Passing arguments\n\n```bash\n# Force installation\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh -s -- --force\n\n# Install from a specific index\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/cmake/install.sh | sh -s -- --index https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n```\n\n## Scripts\n\n### `install.sh`\n\nSimple bash script to install Python tools:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Install Python tools using uvx.sh\n# Usage: ./install.sh <package> [version] [--force] [--index URL]\n\nPACKAGE=$1\nVERSION=$2\nshift 2\n\nif [ -n \"$VERSION\" ]; then\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/${VERSION}/install.sh\"\nelse\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/install.sh\"\nfi\n\ncurl -LsSf \"$URL\" | sh -s -- \"$@\"\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/install.sh ruff\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3 --force\n```\n\n## Common Python Tools\n\n- `ruff` - Fast Python linter\n- `black` - Python code formatter  \n- `mypy` - Static type checker\n- `httpie` - Modern HTTP client\n- `pipx` - Install and run Python applications in isolated environments\n- `jupyter` - Jupyter notebooks\n- `poetry` - Python dependency management\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tools are installed to `~/.local/bin` by default\n- Ensure `~/.local/bin` is in your PATH\n- Uses `uv` under the hood for fast, reliable installation\n- Works with any PyPI package that provides command-line tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:15.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing streamlined package installation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化包安装功能的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたパッケージのインストール機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"파이썬 개발 에이전트가 스트림 라인화된 패키지 설치 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan capacidades de instalación de paquetes simplificadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Python ayant besoin de capacités d''installation de packages simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die vereinfachte Paketinstallationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de capacidades de instalação de pacotes simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности установки пакетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تثبيت حزمة مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to install Python tools with a single command, utilizing UV and supporting package installation via PyPI, with features like version-specific installations and cross-platform compatibility, including macOS, Linux, and Windows.","zh":"通过单个命令使代理能够安装Python工具，利用UV，并支持通过PyPI安装软件包，具有版本特定安装和跨平台兼容性等功能，包括macOS、Linux和Windows。","ja":"エージェントが単一のコマンドでPythonツールをインストールできるようにし、UVを利用し、PyPI経由でのパッケージのインストールをサポートし、バージョン特定のインストールやmacOS、Linux、Windowsを含むクロスプラットフォームの互換性などの機能を備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 단일 명령으로 파이썬 툴을 설치할 수 있도록 하며, UV를 활용하고 PyPI를 통해 패키지 설치를 지원하며, 버전 특정 설치 및 macOS, Linux, Windows를 포함한 크로스 플랫폼 호환성 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar herramientas de Python con un solo comando, utilizando UV y admitiendo la instalación de paquetes a través de PyPI, con características como instalaciones específicas de versiones y compatibilidad multiplataforma, incluyendo macOS, Linux y Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer des outils Python avec une seule commande, en utilisant UV et en prenant en charge l''installation de packages via PyPI, avec des fonctionnalités telles que des installations spécifiques aux versions et une compatibilité multiplateforme, y compris macOS, Linux et Windows.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Python-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl zu installieren, indem UV verwendet und die Installation von Paketen über PyPI unterstützt wird, mit Funktionen wie versionspezifischen Installationen und Multi-Plattform-Kompatibilität, einschließlich macOS, Linux und Windows.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar ferramentas Python com um único comando, utilizando UV e com suporte à instalação de pacotes via PyPI, com recursos como instalações específicas de versão e compatibilidade entre plataformas, incluindo macOS, Linux e Windows.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать инструменты Python с помощью одной команды, используя UV и поддержку установки пакетов через PyPI, с функциями, такими как установки, специфичные для версии, и кроссплатформенная совместимость, включая macOS, Linux и Windows.","ar":"يمنح العميل تثبيت أدوات بايثون باستخدام أمر واحد، باستخدام UV ودعم تثبيت الحزم عن طريق PyPI، مع ميزات مثل التثبيتات المحددة للإصدار والتوافق بين المنصات، بما في ذلك macOS و Linux و Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Installing ruff for code linting","Automating package installations for data science environments","Deploying specific versions of packages for reproducibility"],"zh":["安装ruff进行代码linting","自动化数据科学环境的包安装","部署特定版本的包以实现可复现性"],"ja":["ruffをインストールしてコードlintingを実行する","データサイエンス環境のパッケージのインストールを自動化する","再現性を実現するために特定のバージョンのパッケージをデプロイする"],"ko":["코드 linting을 위해 ruff 설치","데이터 과학 환경을 위한 패키지 설치 자동화","재현성을 위해 특정 버전의 패키지 배포"],"es":["Instalar ruff para la limpieza de código","Automatizar la instalación de paquetes para entornos de ciencia de datos","Implementar versiones específicas de paquetes para la reproducibilidad"],"fr":["Installer ruff pour la mise en forme de code","Automatiser l''installation de packages pour les environnements de science des données","Déployer des versions spécifiques de packages pour la reproductibilité"],"de":["Ruff für die Code-Linter-Installation installieren","Automatisieren der Paketinstallation für Data-Science-Umgebungen","Bereitstellen spezifischer Paketversionen für die Reproduzierbarkeit"],"pt":["Instalar ruff para linting de código","Automatizar instalações de pacotes para ambientes de ciência de dados","Implantar versões específicas de pacotes para reprodutibilidade"],"ru":["Установка ruff для линтинга кода","Автоматизация установки пакетов для сред数据 науки","Развертывание конкретных версий пакетов для воспроизводимости"],"ar":["تثبيت ruff لlinting الكود","تأتمتة تثبيت الحزم للبيئات علم البيانات","نشر إصدارات محددة من الحزم لإعادة الإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires curl or powershell for installation","Limited to packages available on PyPI","macOS and Linux require bash, Windows requires powershell"],"zh":["需要curl或powershell进行安装","仅限于PyPI上可用的包","macOS和Linux需要bash，Windows需要powershell"],"ja":["インストールにはcurlまたはpowershellが必要","PyPIに利用可能なパッケージのみに限定される","macOSとLinuxはbashが必要、Windowsはpowershellが必要"],"ko":["설치에는 curl 또는 powershell이 필요","PyPI에 사용 가능한 패키지로만 제한","macOS 및 Linux는 bash가 필요하며, Windows는 powershell이 필요"],"es":["Requiere curl o powershell para la instalación","Limitado a paquetes disponibles en PyPI","macOS y Linux requieren bash, Windows requiere powershell"],"fr":["Nécessite curl ou powershell pour l''installation","Limité aux packages disponibles sur PyPI","macOS et Linux nécessitent bash, Windows nécessite powershell"],"de":["Benötigt curl oder powershell für die Installation","Begrenzt auf auf PyPI verfügbare Pakete","macOS und Linux benötigen bash, Windows benötigt powershell"],"pt":["Requer curl ou powershell para instalação","Limitado a pacotes disponíveis no PyPI","macOS e Linux requerem bash, Windows requer powershell"],"ru":["Требует curl или powershell для установки","Ограничен пакетами, доступными в PyPI","macOS и Linux требуют bash, Windows требует powershell"],"ar":["يتطلب curl أو powershell للتثبيت","محدود بالحزم المتاحة في PyPI","macOS و Linux يتطلبان bash، و Windows يتطلب powershell"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d4e9eca89db59d2c63a492211a36d04dd19ec9a60c34a0d093b3f19a37a47a9b","qualityScore":46}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Devdha/wm/wm-git-worktree-manager', 'community', 'Devdha', 'wm', 'Devdha/wm', 'wm-git-worktree-manager', 0, 0, 46, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.878Z', '2026-03-02T02:07:20.272Z', 'dee02150307cabe4ea14ced59b90284e6d5ba09c3e4927b25c8f3d9984de6370', '{"id":"Devdha/wm/wm-git-worktree-manager","name":"wm-git-worktree-manager","description":{"zh":"WM - Git 工作树管理器是一款用于管理 Git 工作树的 CLI 工具，支持初始化项目配置、添加和移除工作树等功能","ja":"WM - Git ワークツリーマネージャーは、Git ワークツリーを管理するための CLI ツールです。プロジェクトの初期化、ワークツリーの追加と削除などをサポートします","ko":"WM - Git 작업 트리 관리자는 Git 작업 트리를 관리하기 위한 CLI 도구입니다. 프로젝트 초기화, 작업 트리 추가 및 제거 등이 지원됩니다","es":"WM es una herramienta de línea de comandos para gestionar fácilmente git worktree. Ofrece una forma sencilla de inicializar y administrar proyectos","fr":"WM est un outil de ligne de commande pour gérer facilement git worktree. Il offre un moyen simple d''initialiser et de gérer des projets","de":"WM ist ein CLI-Tool für die einfache Verwaltung von Git Worktree. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Projekte zu initialisieren und zu verwalten","pt":"O WM - Gerenciador de Worktree do Git é uma ferramenta CLI para gerenciar worktrees do Git de forma fácil e eficiente.","ru":"WM - Менеджер Git Worktree - это инструмент CLI для легкого управления worktree Git.","ar":"WM - مدير شجرة العمل Git هو أداة سطر أوامر للتحكم في شجرة العمل Git بسهولة وفعالية.","en":"git worktree manager"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WM - Git 工作树管理器","ja":"WM - Git ワークツリーマネージャー","ko":"WM - Git 작업 트리 관리자","es":"WM - Administrador de Git Worktree","fr":"WM - Gestionnaire de Git Worktree","de":"WM - Git Worktree Manager","pt":"Gerenciador de Worktree do Git","ru":"Менеджер Git Worktree","ar":"مدير شجرة العمل Git","en":"wm-git-worktree-manager"},"description":{"zh":"WM - Git 工作树管理器是一款用于管理 Git 工作树的 CLI 工具，支持初始化项目配置、添加和移除工作树等功能","ja":"WM - Git ワークツリーマネージャーは、Git ワークツリーを管理するための CLI ツールです。プロジェクトの初期化、ワークツリーの追加と削除などをサポートします","ko":"WM - Git 작업 트리 관리자는 Git 작업 트리를 관리하기 위한 CLI 도구입니다. 프로젝트 초기화, 작업 트리 추가 및 제거 등이 지원됩니다","es":"WM es una herramienta de línea de comandos para gestionar fácilmente git worktree. Ofrece una forma sencilla de inicializar y administrar proyectos","fr":"WM est un outil de ligne de commande pour gérer facilement git worktree. Il offre un moyen simple d''initialiser et de gérer des projets","de":"WM ist ein CLI-Tool für die einfache Verwaltung von Git Worktree. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Projekte zu initialisieren und zu verwalten","pt":"O WM - Gerenciador de Worktree do Git é uma ferramenta CLI para gerenciar worktrees do Git de forma fácil e eficiente.","ru":"WM - Менеджер Git Worktree - это инструмент CLI для легкого управления worktree Git.","ar":"WM - مدير شجرة العمل Git هو أداة سطر أوامر للتحكم في شجرة العمل Git بسهولة وفعالية.","en":"git worktree manager"},"definition":{"en":"git worktree manager"},"features":{"zh":["初始化项目配置","添加和移除工作树","支持非交互模式","易于使用的 CLI 接口"],"ja":["プロジェクトの初期化","ワークツリーの追加と削除","非交互モードをサポート","使いやすい CLI インターフェイス"],"ko":["프로젝트 초기화","작업 트리 추가 및 제거","비대화형 모드 지원","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 CLI 인터페이스"],"es":["Inicialización de proyecto con wm init","Adición y eliminación de worktrees con wm add y wm remove","Uso de argumentos explícitos para evitar el modo interactivo","Compatibilidad con entornos automatizados","Configuración del proyecto a través de .wm.yaml"],"fr":["Initialisation de projet avec wm init","Ajout et suppression de worktrees avec wm add et wm remove","Utilisation d''arguments explicites pour éviter le mode interactif","Compatibilité avec les environnements automatisés","Configuration du projet via .wm.yaml"],"de":["Projektinitialisierung mit wm init","Hinzufügen und Entfernen von Worktrees mit wm add und wm remove","Verwendung von expliziten Argumenten, um den interaktiven Modus zu vermeiden","Kompatibilität mit automatisierten Umgebungen","Projektkonfiguration über .wm.yaml"],"pt":["Inicialização do projeto com configuração (.wm.yaml)","Adição e remoção de worktrees","Modo não interativo para ambientes automatizados","Uso de argumentos explícitos para comandos","Gerenciamento fácil de worktrees do Git"],"ru":["Инициализация проекта с конфигурацией (.wm.yaml)","Добавление и удаление worktree","Нентерактивный режим для автоматизированных сред","Использование явных аргументов для команд","Легкое управление worktree Git"],"ar":["تثبيت المشروع مع إعدادات (.wm.yaml)","إضافة وازالة شجرة العمل","الوضع غير التفاعلي للبيئات التلقائية","استخدام الحجج الصريحة للأوامر","التحكم البسيط في شجرة العمل Git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 工作树管理","CLI 工具","开发效率","版本控制","Git 工作树","WM - Git 工作树管理器"],"ja":["Git ワークツリー管理","CLI ツール","開発効率","バージョン管理","Git ワークツリー","WM - Git ワークツリーマネージャー"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리 관리","CLI 도구","개발 효율성","버전 관리","Git 작업 트리","WM - Git 작업 트리 관리자"],"es":["git worktree","administrador de git worktree","herramienta de línea de comandos","wm git worktree manager","gestión de worktrees","entornos automatizados"],"fr":["git worktree","gestionnaire de git worktree","outil de ligne de commande","wm git worktree manager","gestion de worktrees","environnements automatisés"],"de":["git worktree","git worktree manager","CLI-Tool","wm git worktree manager","worktree-verwaltung","automatisierte Umgebungen"],"pt":["Gerenciador de Worktree do Git","Git Worktree","CLI","Desenvolvimento de Software","Gerenciamento de Versões","Worktree","Git","Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Менеджер Git Worktree","Git Worktree","CLI","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Управление Версиями","Worktree","Git","Инструменты Разработки"],"ar":["مدير شجرة العمل Git","شجرة العمل Git","سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة الإصدارات","شجرة العمل","Git","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Devdha","repo":"wm","repoPath":"Devdha/wm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.878Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wm-git-worktree-manager","description":"Use when working with git worktrees - creating isolated workspaces for branches, managing multiple features in parallel, or cleaning up worktrees","bodyPreview":"# WM - Git Worktree Manager\n\nCLI tool for easy git worktree management.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Non-Interactive Mode Required\n\n**Always use explicit arguments. Interactive mode does not work in automated environments.**\n\n```bash\n# CORRECT - explicit arguments\nwm add feature-auth\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# WRONG - interactive mode (will hang)\nwm add      # NO!\nwm remove   # NO!\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `wm init` | Initialize project config (.wm.yaml) |","body":"# WM - Git Worktree Manager\n\nCLI tool for easy git worktree management.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Non-Interactive Mode Required\n\n**Always use explicit arguments. Interactive mode does not work in automated environments.**\n\n```bash\n# CORRECT - explicit arguments\nwm add feature-auth\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# WRONG - interactive mode (will hang)\nwm add      # NO!\nwm remove   # NO!\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `wm init` | Initialize project config (.wm.yaml) |\n| `wm add <branch>` | Create worktree for branch |\n| `wm add <branch> -p <path>` | Create worktree at custom path |\n| `wm list` | List all worktrees |\n| `wm remove <branch>` | Remove worktree by branch name |\n| `wm remove <path>` | Remove worktree by path |\n| `wm remove -b <branch>` | Remove worktree AND delete branch |\n| `wm remove -f <branch>` | Force remove (skip confirmation) |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create Worktree\n\n```bash\n# Basic usage\nwm add feature-login\n\n# With custom path\nwm add feature-login -p ./workspaces/login\n\n# Branch with slash becomes hyphenated folder\nwm add feature/auth\n# Creates: ../wm_repo/feature-auth/\n```\n\n### Remove Worktree\n\n```bash\n# By branch name\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# By path\nwm remove ../wm_repo/feature-auth\n\n# Also delete the git branch\nwm remove -b feature-auth\n\n# Force (skip confirmation)\nwm remove -f feature-auth\n```\n\n### List Worktrees\n\n```bash\nwm list\n# or\nwm ls\n```\n\n## Configuration (.wm.yaml)\n\n```yaml\nversion: 1\n\nworktree:\n  base_dir: \"../wm_{repo}\"  # {repo} replaced with repo name\n\nsync:\n  - \".env\"                  # Copy to worktree\n  - \"apps/*/.env\"           # Glob supported\n  - src: \".env.example\"\n    dst: \".env\"\n    mode: copy              # or \"symlink\"\n    when: missing           # or \"always\"\n\ntasks:\n  post_install:\n    mode: background        # Async execution\n    commands:\n      - \"npm install\"\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Working on multiple features in parallel\n- Reviewing PRs while continuing other work\n- Running long builds/tests on separate branch\n- Quick branch switching without stash\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| Using interactive mode | Always provide branch/path argument |\n| Expecting nested folders for `feature/auth` | Creates `feature-auth` (flat) since v0.1.1 |\n| Trying to remove main worktree | Not allowed - main worktree is protected |\n| Branch used by another worktree | Warning shown, requires confirmation |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:20.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing efficient Git worktree management and automation.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的Git工作树管理和自动化的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが効率的なGitワークツリーマネージメントと自動化を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 Git 작업 트리 관리 및 자동화가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión y automatización eficientes del trabajo de Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une automatisation efficaces de l''arborescence de travail Git.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine effiziente Git-Arbeitsbereichsverwaltung und -automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente de worktree do Git e automação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется эффективное управление рабочим деревом Git и автоматизация.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤ اوپس الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة كفؤة لشجرة عمل جيت وأتمتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Git worktrees using explicit arguments, supporting automated environments with non-interactive mode, and utilizing .wm.yaml project config for initialization with ''wm init'' command.","zh":"赋予代理管理多个Git工作树的能力，使用显式参数，支持非交互模式的自动化环境，并利用.wm.yaml项目配置文件通过''wm init''命令进行初始化。","ja":"エージェントに複数のGitワークツリーを管理する能力を付与し、明示的な引数を使用して非対話モードの自動化環境をサポートし、''.wm.yaml''プロジェクト構成ファイルを使用して''wm init''コマンドで初期化します。","ko":"에이전트가 명시적인 인수를 사용하여 여러 Git 작업 트리를 관리하고, 비대화식 모드의 자동화 환경을 지원하며, ''.wm.yaml'' 프로젝트 구성 파일을 사용하여 ''wm init'' 명령으로 초기화 할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples arborescencias de trabajo de Git utilizando argumentos explícitos, admitiendo entornos automatizados con modo no interactivo y utilizando la configuración del proyecto .wm.yaml para la inicialización con el comando ''wm init''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs arborescences de travail Git à l''aide d''arguments explicites, en prenant en charge des environnements automatisés avec un mode non interactif et en utilisant la configuration de projet .wm.yaml pour l''initialisation avec la commande ''wm init''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, mehrere Git-Arbeitsbereiche mithilfe expliziter Argumente zu verwalten, unterstützt automatisierte Umgebungen mit nicht-interaktivem Modus und verwendet die .wm.yaml-Projektkonfiguration für die Initialisierung mit dem ''wm init''-Befehl.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar vários worktrees do Git usando argumentos explícitos, suportando ambientes automatizados com modo não interativo e utilizando a configuração do projeto .wm.yaml para inicialização com o comando ''wm init''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими рабочими деревьями Git с помощью явных аргументов, поддерживая автоматизированные среды с неинтерактивным режимом и использует конфигурацию проекта .wm.yaml для инициализации с помощью команды ''wm init''.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية إدارة几个 أشجار عمل جيت باستخدام حجج صريحة، يدعم بيئات أوتوماتيكية مع وضع غير تفاعلي ويتضمن تكوين المشروع .wm.yaml للتأسيس مع أمر ''wm init''."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing project config with ''wm init''","Automating worktree additions with ''wm add''","Removing worktrees with ''wm remove''"],"zh":["使用''wm init''初始化项目配置","使用''wm add''自动执行工作树添加","使用''wm remove''删除工作树"],"ja":["''wm init''でプロジェクト構成を初期化する","''wm add''でワークツリーの追加を自動化する","''wm remove''でワークツリーを削除する"],"ko":["''wm init''로 프로젝트 구성 초기화하기","''wm add''로 작업 트리 추가 자동화하기","''wm remove''로 작업 트리 삭제하기"],"es":["Inicializar la configuración del proyecto con ''wm init''","Automatizar las adiciones de arborescencia de trabajo con ''wm add''","Eliminar arborescencias de trabajo con ''wm remove''"],"fr":["Initialiser la configuration du projet avec ''wm init''","Automatiser les ajouts d''arborescence de travail avec ''wm add''","Supprimer les arborescences de travail avec ''wm remove''"],"de":["Projektkonfiguration mit ''wm init'' initialisieren","Arbeitsbereichshinzufügungen mit ''wm add'' automatisieren","Arbeitsbereiche mit ''wm remove'' entfernen"],"pt":["Inicializar configuração do projeto com ''wm init''","Automatizar adições de worktree com ''wm add''","Remover worktrees com ''wm remove''"],"ru":["Инициализировать конфигурацию проекта с ''wm init''","Автоматизировать добавление рабочих деревьев с ''wm add''","Удалить рабочие деревья с ''wm remove''"],"ar":["تأسيس تكوين المشروع مع ''wm init''","أتمتة إضافات شجرة العمل مع ''wm add''","إزالة أشجار العمل مع ''wm remove''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires non-interactive mode","Explicit arguments mandatory"],"zh":["需要非交互模式","显式参数是必需的"],"ja":["非対話モードが必要","明示的な引数は必須"],"ko":["비대화식 모드가 필요함","명시적인 인수가 필수"],"es":["Requiere modo no interactivo","Argumentos explícitos obligatorios"],"fr":["Nécessite un mode non interactif","Arguments explicites obligatoires"],"de":["Benötigt nicht-interaktiven Modus","Explizite Argumente sind obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer modo não interativo","Argumentos explícitos são obrigatórios"],"ru":["Требует неинтерактивного режима","Явные аргументы обязательны"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع غير تفاعلي","الحجج الصريحة إجبارية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dee02150307cabe4ea14ced59b90284e6d5ba09c3e4927b25c8f3d9984de6370","qualityScore":46}');
