ologías como React y Node.js","Acceso a datos y recursos de investigación","Soporte para proyectos de datos y ciencia"],"fr":["Recherche et analyse de données avec IPA","Outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","Accès à des données et ressources de recherche","Support pour les projets de données et de science"],"de":["Forschung und Datenanalyse mit IPA","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Zugriff auf Daten und Forschungsressourcen","Unterstützung für Daten- und Wissenschaftsprojekte"],"pt":["Recursos de pesquisa IPA","Ferramentas de ciência de dados","Integração com linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","Suporte a CLI","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Ресурсы исследований IPA","Инструменты науки о данных","Интеграция с языками программирования как Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI","Детальная документация"],"ar":["موارد بحث IPA","أدوات علوم البيانات","التكامل مع لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","دعم CLI","وثائق مفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["uv AI 代理","如何安装 uv","uv 使用指南","IPA 研究工具","数据科学 AI 工具","uv 替代方案","uv vs 其他工具","Python 数据代理","CLI 数据工具"],"ja":["uv AIエージェント","uv インストール方法","uv 使い方","IPA 研究ツール","データサイエンス AIツール","uv 代替ツール","uv vs 他のツール","Python データエージェント","CLI データツール"],"ko":["uv AI 에이전트","uv 설치 방법","uv 사용 가이드","IPA 연구 도구","데이터 과학 AI 도구","uv 대체 도구","uv vs 다른 도구","Python 데이터 에이전트","CLI 데이터 도구"],"es":["cómo usar uv","qué es IPA","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","alternativas a uv","uv vs otras herramientas de investigación","instalación de uv","guía de configuración de uv"],"fr":["comment utiliser uv","qu''est-ce que IPA","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","alternatives à uv","uv vs autres outils de recherche","installation de uv","guide de configuration de uv"],"de":["wie man uv verwendet","was ist IPA","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu uv","uv vs andere Forschungstools","Installation von uv","Konfigurationsanleitung für uv"],"pt":["como usar uv","o que é uv","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","uv vs outras ferramentas de ia","instalar uv","guia de configuração do uv"],"ru":["как использовать uv","что такое uv","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","uv vs другие инструменты ИИ","установить uv","гид по настройке uv"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام uv","ما هو uv","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","uv مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت uv","دليل إعداد uv"]}},"owner":"PovertyAction","repo":"ipa-research-data-science-hub","repoPath":"PovertyAction/ipa-research-data-science-hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv","description":"This skill should be used when working with Python projects that use uv for package and project management. Use this skill for running Python scripts and CLI tools with `uv run`, managing dependencies, creating projects, handling virtual environments, and executing commands within isolated project environments. Essential for projects with pyproject.toml files.","bodyPreview":"# uv - Fast Python Package and Project Manager\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using **uv**, an extremely fast Python package and project manager written in Rust. uv replaces pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv, and more while being 10-100x faster. The skill focuses particularly on `uv run` for executing code within isolated project environments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Working in a Python project with a `pyproject.toml` file\n- Running Pytho","body":"# uv - Fast Python Package and Project Manager\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using **uv**, an extremely fast Python package and project manager written in Rust. uv replaces pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv, and more while being 10-100x faster. The skill focuses particularly on `uv run` for executing code within isolated project environments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Working in a Python project with a `pyproject.toml` file\n- Running Python scripts or CLI tools that require dependencies\n- Managing project dependencies and virtual environments\n- Executing commands within an isolated project environment\n- Creating new Python projects or initializing scripts\n- Converting from pip, poetry, or other Python tooling to uv\n\n## Core Concept: `uv run`\n\nThe most important command in uv is `uv run`, which executes commands within an isolated project environment.\n\n### Why Use `uv run`\n\n**ALWAYS use `uv run` instead of bare `python` or direct script execution when:**\n\n1. Running Python scripts that depend on project dependencies\n2. Executing Python CLI tools installed in the project\n3. Working within a uv-managed project (has `pyproject.toml`)\n4. Running commands that need access to the project''s virtual environment\n\n**Key behavior:** `uv run` automatically ensures the project environment is current before executing the command. It installs the project into `.venv` and keeps it isolated from the system Python.\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Run a Python script\nuv run example.py\n\n# Run a Python module\nuv run python -m mymodule\n\n# Run a CLI tool from project dependencies\nuv run pytest\nuv run ruff check\nuv run black .\n\n# Run external commands that need project access\nuv run bash scripts/deploy.sh\n```\n\n### Adding Dependencies Per-Invocation\n\nUse `--with` to include or override dependencies for a single execution without modifying `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```bash\n# Add a dependency temporarily\nuv run --with httpx python -c \"import httpx; print(httpx.__version__)\"\n\n# Specify version constraints\nuv run --with ''httpx==0.26.0'' python script.py\n\n# Multiple dependencies\nuv run --with httpx --with rich python script.py\n```\n\nThis is useful for:\n\n- Testing code with different dependency versions\n- One-off operations requiring special packages\n- Running scripts without permanently adding dependencies\n\n### Running Scripts with Inline Dependencies\n\nPython scripts can declare their own dependencies using inline metadata. This creates isolated environments separate from the project:\n\n```python\n# /// script\n# dependencies = [\n#   \"requests<3\",\n#   \"rich\",\n# ]\n# requires-python = \">=3.12\"\n# ///\n\nimport requests\nimport rich\n\n# Script code here...\n```\n\n**Important:** When a script has inline metadata, `uv run` uses ONLY those dependencies and ignores the project''s dependencies, even when run inside a project directory.\n\nInitialize a script with metadata:\n\n```bash\n# Create script with inline metadata\nuv init --script example.py --python 3.12\n\n# Add dependencies to script\nuv add --script example.py ''requests<3'' ''rich''\n\n# Run the script (uses its own dependencies)\nuv run example.py\n```\n\n## Common Tasks and Workflows\n\n### Creating a New Project\n\n```bash\n# Create a new application project\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Create a library project\nuv init --lib my-library\n\n# Create project in current directory\nuv init\n\n# Specify Python version\nuv init --python 3.12\n```\n\nThis creates:\n\n- `pyproject.toml` - Project configuration and dependencies\n- `.python-version` - Python version specification\n- `README.md` - Basic documentation\n- `src/my_project/` - Source code directory (for apps)\n\n### Managing Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Add a dependency\nuv add requests\n\n# Add with version constraint\nuv add ''httpx>=0.25,<0.27''\n\n# Add development dependency\nuv add --dev pytest\n\n# Add optional dependency group\nuv add --optional docs sphinx\n\n# Remove a dependency\nuv remove requests\n\n# Update all dependencies\nuv lock --upgrade\n\n# Sync environment to match lockfile\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Virtual Environment Management\n\n```bash\n# uv automatically creates and manages .venv/\n# Most operations don''t require manual venv activation\n\n# To manually create a venv (rarely needed)\nuv venv\n\n# To activate manually (usually unnecessary)\nsource .venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate     # Windows\n```\n\n**Best practice:** Use `uv run` instead of manually activating virtual environments. This ensures environment consistency and automatic updates.\n\n### Python Version Management\n\n```bash\n# Install a specific Python version\nuv python install 3.12\n\n# List available Python versions\nuv python list\n\n# Find Python installations\nuv python find\n\n# Pin project to specific Python version\nuv python pin 3.12\n```\n\n### Running Tools Without Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run a tool ephemerally (like pipx)\nuvx ruff check .\nuvx black --check .\n\n# Equivalent to:\nuv tool run ruff check .\n\n# Install tool globally\nuv tool install ruff\n```\n\n### pip-Compatible Commands\n\nuv provides drop-in pip replacements:\n\n```bash\n# Install packages (like pip install)\nuv pip install requests\n\n# Generate requirements.txt (like pip freeze)\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Compile dependencies (like pip-compile)\nuv pip compile pyproject.toml -o requirements.txt\n\n# Show dependency tree\nuv pip tree\n```\n\n## Decision Tree: Which Command to Use\n\n**Need to run code in this project?**\n→ Use `uv run <command>`\n\n**Need to add a package to this project?**\n→ Use `uv add <package>`\n\n**Need to run a tool once without installing?**\n→ Use `uvx <tool>` or `uv tool run <tool>`\n\n**Need to create a new project?**\n→ Use `uv init [project-name]`\n\n**Need to update dependencies to latest versions?**\n→ Use `uv lock --upgrade`\n\n**Need to sync environment after pulling changes?**\n→ Use `uv sync`\n\n**Need to install a specific Python version?**\n→ Use `uv python install <version>`\n\n**Working with legacy pip workflows?**\n→ Use `uv pip` commands as drop-in replacements\n\n## Key Differences from Other Tools\n\n### vs pip\n\n- **10-100x faster** due to Rust implementation\n- Automatic virtual environment management\n- Built-in lockfile support\n- No need for pip-tools or virtualenv\n\n### vs poetry\n\n- Faster dependency resolution\n- Compatible with standard `pyproject.toml`\n- Simpler command structure\n- No separate `poetry.lock` format (uses `uv.lock`)\n\n### vs pipx\n\n- `uvx` provides same functionality\n- Faster execution\n- Better caching and deduplication\n\n### vs pyenv\n\n- `uv python` manages Python versions\n- Integrated with project management\n- Faster installation and switching\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use `uv run` in projects** - Don''t manually activate virtual environments; let uv handle environment management automatically.\n\n2. **Commit lockfiles** - Include `uv.lock` in version control for reproducible builds.\n\n3. **Pin Python versions** - Use `uv python pin` to specify project Python requirements.\n\n4. **Use `--with` for experiments** - Test dependencies temporarily without modifying `pyproject.toml`.\n\n5. **Leverage inline metadata for scripts** - Single-file scripts should declare dependencies inline for portability.\n\n6. **Use `uvx` for one-off tools** - Don''t pollute project dependencies with tools you run occasionally.\n\n7. **Let uv manage environments** - Trust `uv sync` to keep environments in sync; avoid manual pip installs in uv projects.\n\n8. **Check `.python-version` files** - Respect project Python version specifications.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Add pytest as dev dependency\nuv add --dev pytest pytest-cov\n\n# Run tests\nuv run pytest\n\n# Run with coverage\nuv run pytest --cov\n```\n\n### Linting and Formatting\n\n```bash\n# Add dev tools\nuv add --dev ruff black mypy\n\n# Run tools\nuv run ruff check .\nuv run black .\nuv run mypy src/\n```\n\n### Building and Publishing\n\n```bash\n# Build distributions\nuv build\n\n# Publish to PyPI\nuv publish\n\n# Publish to test PyPI\nuv publish --index-url https://test.pypi.org/legacy/\n```\n\n### Working with Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Create standalone script with dependencies\nuv init --script analyze.py\nuv add --script analyze.py pandas numpy\n\n# Run script (uses its inline dependencies)\nuv run analyze.py\n\n# Lock script dependencies for reproducibility\nuv lock --script analyze.py\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Command not found after `uv add`\n\n**Problem:** Added a package with a CLI tool, but command doesn''t work.\n\n**Solution:** Use `uv run <command>` to execute within project environment:\n\n```bash\nuv add ruff\nuv run ruff check .  # Not just \"ruff check .\"\n```\n\n### Environment out of sync\n\n**Problem:** Dependencies changed but environment hasn''t updated.\n\n**Solution:** Run `uv sync` to synchronize:\n\n```bash\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Wrong Python version\n\n**Problem:** Project requires different Python version.\n\n**Solution:** Install and pin correct version:\n\n```bash\nuv python install 3.12\nuv python pin 3.12\n```\n\n### Script ignores project dependencies\n\n**Problem:** Script with inline metadata doesn''t use project packages.\n\n**Solution:** This is intentional. Scripts with inline metadata are isolated. Either:\n\n- Remove inline metadata to use project dependencies\n- Add needed dependencies to script''s inline metadata\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed command options and advanced usage, see [references/cli_reference.md](references/cli_reference.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:33.269Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Python Development Agents seeking rapid package and project management with uv, replacing traditional tools like pip and poetry.","zh":"适合于寻求快速包和项目管理的Python开发代理，使用uv取代传统工具如pip和poetry。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが急速なパッケージおよびプロジェクト管理を求める場合に最適で、uvを使用してpipやpoetryなどの伝統的なツールを置き換えます。","ko":"파이썬 개발 에이전트가 빠른 패키지 및 프로젝트 관리를 찾을 때 적합하며 uv를 사용하여 pip 및 poetry와 같은 전통적인 도구를 대체합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Python que buscan un manejo rápido de paquetes y proyectos con uv, reemplazando herramientas tradicionales como pip y poetry.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Python qui recherchent une gestion rapide de packages et de projets avec uv, remplaçant les outils traditionnels comme pip et poetry.","de":"Ideal für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die ein schnelles Paket- und Projektmanagement mit uv suchen, um traditionelle Tools wie pip und poetry zu ersetzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que buscam gerenciamento rápido de pacotes e projetos com uv, substituindo ferramentas tradicionais como pip e poetry.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которые ищут быстрое управление пакетами и проектами с помощью uv, заменяя традиционные инструменты, такие как pip и poetry.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير بايثون التي تسعى إلى إدارة الحزم والمشاريع بسرعة باستخدام uv، واستبدال الأدوات التقليدية مثل pip وpoetry."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Python projects up to 100x faster, utilizing uv''s Rust-based architecture to streamline package installation and environment setup with pyproject.toml, while executing code in isolated environments via uv run.","zh":"赋予代理管理Python项目的能力，速度可达传统工具的100倍，利用uv的Rust-based架构来简化包安装和环境设置，使用pyproject.toml，并通过uv run在隔离环境中执行代码。","ja":"エージェントにPythonプロジェクトを最大100倍の速さで管理させることができます。uvのRustベースのアーキテクチャを利用して、パッケージのインストールや環境設定を簡素化し、pyproject.tomlを使用して、uv runで隔離された環境でコードを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 파이썬 프로젝트를 최대 100배 빠른 속도로 관리할 수 있도록 해줍니다. uv의 Rust 기반 아키텍처를 활용하여 패키지 설치 및 환경 설정을 간소화하고 pyproject.toml을 사용하여 uv run을 통해 격리된 환경에서 코드를 실행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar proyectos de Python hasta 100 veces más rápido, utilizando la arquitectura basada en Rust de uv para simplificar la instalación de paquetes y la configuración del entorno con pyproject.toml, mientras se ejecuta el código en entornos aislados a través de uv run.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des projets Python jusqu''à 100 fois plus rapidement, en utilisant l''architecture basée sur Rust de uv pour simplifier l''installation de packages et la configuration de l''environnement avec pyproject.toml, tout en exécutant le code dans des environnements isolés via uv run.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Python-Projekte bis zu 100-mal schneller zu verwalten, indem sie die Rust-basierte Architektur von uv nutzen, um die Paketinstallation und die Umgebungssetup mit pyproject.toml zu vereinfachen, während der Code in isolierten Umgebungen über uv run ausgeführt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem projetos Python até 100x mais rápido, utilizando a arquitetura baseada em Rust do uv para simplificar a instalação de pacotes e a configuração do ambiente com pyproject.toml, enquanto executa código em ambientes isolados via uv run.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять проектами Python до 100 раз быстрее, используя архитектуру uv на основе Rust для оптимизации установки пакетов и настройки среды с помощью pyproject.toml, а также выполнять код в изолированных средах с помощью uv run.","ar":"تمكن العميل من إدارة مشاريع بايثون حتى 100 مرة أسرع، باستخدام هندسة uv القائمة على روست لتسهيل تثبيت الحزم وإعداد البيئة مع pyproject.toml، بينما يقوم بتنفيذ الشفرة في بيئات معزولة عبر uv run."},"useCases":{"en":["Accelerating Python package installation and updates","Streamlining project environment setup with uv run","Replacing pip, pip-tools, and poetry for faster dependency management"],"zh":["加速Python包安装和更新","使用uv run简化项目环境设置","替代pip、pip-tools和poetry以实现更快的依赖管理"],"ja":["Pythonパッケージのインストールと更新の加速","uv runを使用したプロジェクト環境設定の簡素化","pip、pip-tools、poetryの置き換えによる依存関係管理の高速化"],"ko":["파이썬 패키지 설치 및 업데이트의 가속화","uv run을 사용한 프로젝트 환경 설정의 간소화","pip, pip-tools, poetry의 대체를 통한 의존성 관리의 가속화"],"es":["Acelerar la instalación y actualización de paquetes de Python","Simplificar la configuración del entorno del proyecto con uv run","Reemplazar pip, pip-tools y poetry para un manejo de dependencias más rápido"],"fr":["Accélérer l''installation et la mise à jour de packages Python","Simplifier la configuration de l''environnement de projet avec uv run","Remplacer pip, pip-tools et poetry pour une gestion de dépendances plus rapide"],"de":["Beschleunigen der Installation und Aktualisierung von Python-Paketen","Vereinfachen der Projektkonfiguration mit uv run","Ersetzen von pip, pip-tools und poetry für ein schnelleres Abhängigkeitsmanagement"],"pt":["Acelerar a instalação e atualização de pacotes Python","Simplificar a configuração do ambiente do projeto com uv run","Substituir pip, pip-tools e poetry para um gerenciamento de dependências mais rápido"],"ru":["Ускорить установку и обновление пакетов Python","Упростить настройку среды проекта с помощью uv run","Заменить pip, pip-tools и poetry для более быстрого управления зависимостями"],"ar":["تعجيل عملية تثبيت وتحديث حزم بايثون","تبسيط إعداد بيئة المشروع مع uv run","استبدال pip وpip-tools وpoetry لإدارة التبعيات بشكل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a pyproject.toml file for project configuration","Written in Rust, which may require additional setup for some users","Specifically designed for Python projects, limiting its use to other programming languages"],"zh":["需要pyproject.toml文件进行项目配置","使用Rust编写，可能需要一些用户进行额外的设置","专门为Python项目设计，限制了其对其他编程语言的使用"],"ja":["プロジェクトの設定にpyproject.tomlファイルが必要","Rustで書かれており、一部のユーザーには追加の設定が必要になる可能性がある","Pythonプロジェクト専用に設計されており、他のプログラミング言語の使用が制限される"],"ko":["프로젝트 구성을 위해 pyproject.toml 파일이 필요함","러스트로 작성되어 일부 사용자에게 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음","파이썬 프로젝트에 특화되어 설계되어 있기 때문에 다른 프로그래밍 언어의 사용에 제한이 있음"],"es":["Requiere un archivo pyproject.toml para la configuración del proyecto","Escrito en Rust, lo que puede requerir una configuración adicional para algunos usuarios","Diseñado específicamente para proyectos de Python, lo que limita su uso a otros lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier pyproject.toml pour la configuration du projet","Écrit en Rust, ce qui peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour certains utilisateurs","Conçu spécifiquement pour les projets Python, ce qui limite son utilisation à d''autres langages de programmation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Datei pyproject.toml für die Projektkonfiguration","In Rust geschrieben, was möglicherweise eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für einige Benutzer erfordert","Speziell für Python-Projekte konzipiert, was die Verwendung für andere Programmiersprachen einschränkt"],"pt":["Requer um arquivo pyproject.toml para configuração do projeto","Escrito em Rust, o que pode exigir configuração adicional para alguns usuários","Projetado especificamente para projetos Python, limitando seu uso para outras linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Требует файла pyproject.toml для конфигурации проекта","Написан на Rust, что может потребовать дополнительной настройки для некоторых пользователей","Разработан специально для проектов Python, ограничивая его использование для других языков программирования"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف pyproject.toml لإعداد المشروع","مكتوب بلغة روست، والتي قد تتطلب إعدادات إضافية لبعض المستخدمين","صمم خصيصًا لمشاريع بايثون، مما يحد من استخدامه للغات البرمجة الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6908ac2baf84b73df019e9d0cceeeb124b2bffd0855286fdcb221bae3e30beda","qualityScore":46}');
