:"信号状态管理是一种使用Turso、Next.js和Supabase Auth的Retro板构建方法","ja":"シグナルステート管理は、Turso、Next.js、Supabase Authを使用したレトロボードの構築方法です","ko":"신호 상태 관리는 Turso, Next.js 및 Supabase Auth를 사용하여 레트로 보드를 구축하는 방법입니다","es":"Construye una tabla de retroceso con Turso, Next.js y Supabase Auth para gestionar estados de señal de manera efectiva","fr":"Créez un tableau de rétrocession avec Turso, Next.js et Supabase Auth pour gérer les états de signal de manière efficace","de":"Erstellen Sie eine Retro-Board mit Turso, Next.js und Supabase Auth für eine effiziente Signal-Zustandsverwaltung","pt":"Construa um quadro de retrocesso com Turso, Next.js e Supabase Auth para gerenciar estados de sinal de forma eficaz","ru":"Постройте ретро-доску с помощью Turso, Next.js и Supabase Auth для управления состоянием сигнала","ar":"ابني لوحة إعادة التشغيل باستخدام Turso و Next.js و Supabase Auth لإدارة حالة الإشارة بفعالية","en":"Retro board build using Turso, Next.js and Supabase Auth"},"definition":{"en":"Retro board build using Turso, Next.js and Supabase Auth"},"features":{"zh":["使用Turso构建Retro板","集成Next.js进行前端开发","使用Supabase Auth进行身份验证","实现信号状态管理","支持多种开发框架"],"ja":["Tursoを使用してレトロボードをビルド","Next.jsを使用してフロントエンド開発","Supabase Authを使用して認証","シグナルステート管理を実現","多くの開発フレームワークをサポート"],"ko":["Turso를 사용하여 레트로 보드를 구축","Next.js를 사용하여 프론트엔드 개발","Supabase Auth를 사용하여 인증","신호 상태 관리를 구현","다양한 개발 프레임워크를 지원"],"es":["Integración con Turso","Uso de Next.js para la creación de la interfaz","Autenticación con Supabase Auth","Gestión de estados de señal en tiempo real","Creación de tablas de retroceso personalizadas"],"fr":["Intégration avec Turso","Utilisation de Next.js pour la création de l''interface","Authentification avec Supabase Auth","Gestion des états de signal en temps réel","Création de tableaux de rétrocession personnalisés"],"de":["Integration mit Turso","Verwendung von Next.js für die Erstellung der Oberfläche","Authentifizierung mit Supabase Auth","Verwaltung von Signalzuständen in Echtzeit","Erstellung von Retro-Boards mit individuellen Anpassungen"],"pt":["Construção de quadro de retrocesso com Turso","Integração com Next.js para gerenciamento de estado de sinal","Autenticação com Supabase Auth","Gerenciamento de estado de sinal eficaz","Desenvolvimento de software com Turso e Next.js"],"ru":["Построение ретро-доски с помощью Turso","Интеграция с Next.js для управления состоянием сигнала","Аутентификация с помощью Supabase Auth","Эффективное управление состоянием сигнала","Разработка программного обеспечения с помощью Turso и Next.js"],"ar":["بناء لوحة إعادة التشغيل باستخدام Turso","التكامل مع Next.js لإدارة حالة الإشارة","التحقق من الصحة باستخدام Supabase Auth","إدارة حالة الإشارة بفعالية","تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام Turso و Next.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["信号状态管理","AI智能工具","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth","Retro板构建","如何使用Turso","什么是信号状态管理","Turso安装","Next.js教程"],"ja":["シグナルステート管理","AIエージェント","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth","レトロボードの構築","Tursoの使い方","シグナルステート管理とは","Tursoのインストール","Next.jsのチュートリアル"],"ko":["신호 상태 관리","AI 에이전트","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth","레트로 보드 구축","Turso 사용법","신호 상태 관리란","Turso 설치","Next.js 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de estado de señal","gestión de estado de señal con Turso","creación de tablas de retroceso con Next.js","autenticación con Supabase Auth"," Signal-Zustandsverwaltung","alternativas a Turso","guía de instalación de Turso"],"fr":["outils de gestion d''état de signal","gestion d''état de signal avec Turso","création de tableaux de rétrocession avec Next.js","authentification avec Supabase Auth","gestion d''état de signal en temps réel","alternatives à Turso","guide d''installation de Turso"],"de":["Signal-Zustandsverwaltung Tools","Signal-Zustandsverwaltung mit Turso","Erstellung von Retro-Boards mit Next.js","Authentifizierung mit Supabase Auth","Signal-Zustandsverwaltung in Echtzeit","Alternativen zu Turso","Installationsanleitung für Turso"],"pt":["como usar Turso","o que é gerenciamento de estado de sinal","Turso vs Next.js","instalar Turso","guia de configuração do Next.js","desenvolvimento de software com Turso e Next.js"],"ru":["как использовать Turso","что такое управление состоянием сигнала","Turso vs Next.js","установить Turso","руководство по настройке Next.js","разработка программного обеспечения с помощью Turso и Next.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Turso","ما هو إدارة حالة الإشارة","Turso مقابل Next.js","تثبيت Turso","دليل إعداد Next.js","تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام Turso و Next.js"]}},"owner":"DW225","repo":"ree-board","repoPath":"DW225/ree-board","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.905Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"signal-state-management","description":"Preact Signals for reactive state management, signal vs computed signal usage, batch updates for performance, action creator patterns, signal integration with React components, state management by domain (boards posts members), reactive patterns, and signal best practices for ree-board project","bodyPreview":"# Signal State Management\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working on:\n\n- Managing client-side application state\n- Creating reactive UI updates\n- Implementing computed values\n- Batching state updates for performance\n- Organizing state by domain (boards, posts, members)\n- Integrating signals with React components\n- Optimizing re-renders\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Signal vs Computed Signal\n\n**Simple Signal:** Holds mutable state\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signal","body":"# Signal State Management\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working on:\n\n- Managing client-side application state\n- Creating reactive UI updates\n- Implementing computed values\n- Batching state updates for performance\n- Organizing state by domain (boards, posts, members)\n- Integrating signals with React components\n- Optimizing re-renders\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Signal vs Computed Signal\n\n**Simple Signal:** Holds mutable state\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// ✅ Simple signal for primitive values\nexport const currentBoardId = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// ✅ Simple signal for complex state\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\n```\n\n**Computed Signal:** Derives value from other signals\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, computed } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const filterSignal = signal<PostFilter>(\"all\");\n\n// ✅ Computed signal automatically updates\nexport const filteredPosts = computed(() => {\n  const posts = postsSignal.value;\n  const filter = filterSignal.value;\n\n  if (filter === \"all\") return posts;\n  return posts.filter((p) => p.type === filter);\n});\n```\n\n### State Organization by Domain\n\n**Separate Files for Each Domain:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/postSignals.ts\nimport { signal, computed } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// State\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const selectedPostId = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// Computed values\nexport const selectedPost = computed(() => {\n  const id = selectedPostId.value;\n  if (!id) return null;\n  return postsSignal.value.find((p) => p.id === id);\n});\n\nexport const postsByType = computed(() => {\n  const posts = postsSignal.value;\n  return {\n    wentWell: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"went_well\"),\n    toImprove: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"to_improve\"),\n    actionItems: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"action_items\"),\n  };\n});\n\n// Actions\nexport const addPost = (post: Post) => {\n  postsSignal.value = [...postsSignal.value, post];\n};\n\nexport const updatePost = (id: string, updates: Partial<Post>) => {\n  postsSignal.value = postsSignal.value.map((p) =>\n    p.id === id ? { ...p, ...updates } : p\n  );\n};\n\nexport const deletePost = (id: string) => {\n  postsSignal.value = postsSignal.value.filter((p) => p.id !== id);\n};\n```\n\n### Action Creator Pattern\n\n**Encapsulate State Updates:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/boardSignals.ts\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nexport const boardsSignal = signal<Board[]>([]);\nexport const loadingSignal = signal<boolean>(false);\nexport const errorSignal = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// ✅ Action creators for complex operations\nexport const loadBoards = async () => {\n  loadingSignal.value = true;\n  errorSignal.value = null;\n\n  try {\n    const boards = await fetchBoards();\n    boardsSignal.value = boards;\n  } catch (error) {\n    errorSignal.value = \"Failed to load boards\";\n    console.error(error);\n  } finally {\n    loadingSignal.value = false;\n  }\n};\n\nexport const createBoard = async (name: string) => {\n  try {\n    const newBoard = await createBoardAction(name);\n    // Optimistic update\n    boardsSignal.value = [...boardsSignal.value, newBoard];\n    return newBoard;\n  } catch (error) {\n    errorSignal.value = \"Failed to create board\";\n    throw error;\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Batch Updates for Performance\n\n**Update Multiple Signals Together:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { batch } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// ❌ Bad: Triggers 3 re-renders\nconst updateBoard = (id: string, data: BoardUpdate) => {\n  boardsSignal.value = updateBoardList(id, data);\n  selectedBoardId.value = id;\n  lastUpdatedSignal.value = Date.now();\n};\n\n// ✅ Good: Triggers 1 re-render\nconst updateBoard = (id: string, data: BoardUpdate) => {\n  batch(() => {\n    boardsSignal.value = updateBoardList(id, data);\n    selectedBoardId.value = id;\n    lastUpdatedSignal.value = Date.now();\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### Integration with React Components\n\n**Reading Signals:**\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { postsSignal, filteredPosts } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nexport function PostList() {\n  // ✅ Component re-renders when signal changes\n  const posts = filteredPosts.value;\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {posts.map((post) => (\n        <PostCard key={post.id} post={post} />\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Updating Signals:**\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { updatePost } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nexport function EditPostForm({ postId }: { postId: string }) {\n  const handleSubmit = (content: string) => {\n    // ✅ Update signal\n    updatePost(postId, { content });\n\n    // Persist to database\n    updatePostAction(postId, content);\n  };\n\n  return <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>...</form>;\n}\n```\n\n### Combining Signals with Server Actions\n\n**Pattern:** Update signal first (optimistic), then persist\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { addPost, deletePost } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\nimport { createPost as createPostAction } from \"@/lib/actions/post/createPost\";\n\nexport function CreatePostButton({ boardId }: { boardId: string }) {\n  const handleCreate = async () => {\n    // Create temporary post for optimistic UI\n    const tempPost: Post = {\n      id: `temp-${Date.now()}`,\n      boardId,\n      content: \"\",\n      type: \"went_well\",\n      createdAt: new Date(),\n    };\n\n    // ✅ Optimistic update\n    addPost(tempPost);\n\n    try {\n      // Persist to database\n      const savedPost = await createPostAction(boardId, \"\", \"went_well\");\n\n      // Replace temp with real post\n      deletePost(tempPost.id);\n      addPost(savedPost);\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Rollback on error\n      deletePost(tempPost.id);\n      showError(\"Failed to create post\");\n    }\n  };\n\n  return <button onClick={handleCreate}>Create Post</button>;\n}\n```\n\n### Signal Performance Patterns\n\n**Avoid Unnecessary Signal Subscriptions:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Bad: Creates new computed signal on every render\nfunction PostCount() {\n  const count = computed(() => postsSignal.value.length);\n  return <div>{count.value}</div>;\n}\n\n// ✅ Good: Computed signal defined once outside component\nconst postCount = computed(() => postsSignal.value.length);\n\nfunction PostCount() {\n  return <div>{postCount.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n**Use Signal Peeking for Non-Reactive Reads:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { postsSignal } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nfunction logCurrentPosts() {\n  // ✅ Read without subscribing (doesn''t trigger re-render)\n  console.log(\"Current posts:\", postsSignal.peek());\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Mutating Signal Values Directly\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Never mutate signal values directly\npostsSignal.value.push(newPost);\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Create new array\npostsSignal.value = [...postsSignal.value, newPost];\n```\n\n### ❌ Creating Signals Inside Components\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  // ❌ Creates new signal on every render\n  const localSignal = signal(0);\n  return <div>{localSignal.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Define signals outside components\nconst counterSignal = signal(0);\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  return <div>{counterSignal.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Not Using Batch for Multiple Updates\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Triggers 3 re-renders\nconst resetFilters = () => {\n  filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n  sortSignal.value = \"date\";\n  searchSignal.value = \"\";\n};\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Triggers 1 re-render\nimport { batch } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nconst resetFilters = () => {\n  batch(() => {\n    filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n    sortSignal.value = \"date\";\n    searchSignal.value = \"\";\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### ❌ Forgetting .value Accessor\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Comparing signal object, not value\nif (currentBoardId === \"board-123\") {\n  // This will never be true\n}\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Access signal value\nif (currentBoardId.value === \"board-123\") {\n  // Correct comparison\n}\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **[nextjs-app-router](../nextjs-app-router/SKILL.md):** Signals used in client components\n- **[ably-realtime](../ably-realtime/SKILL.md):** Update signals from real-time messages\n- **[drizzle-patterns](../drizzle-patterns/SKILL.md):** Sync signals with database state\n- **[testing-patterns](../testing-patterns/SKILL.md):** Reset signals in test setup\n\n## Project-Specific Context\n\n### Key Files\n\n- `lib/signal/boardSignals.ts` - Board listing and management\n- `lib/signal/postSignals.ts` - Post state within boards\n- `lib/signal/memberSignals.ts` - Board member management\n- `components/board/PostProvider.tsx` - Signal updates from real-time\n\n### Domain-Specific Signals\n\n**Board Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/boardSignals.ts\nexport const boardsSignal = signal<Board[]>([]);\nexport const currentBoardId = signal<string | null>(null);\nexport const currentBoard = computed(() =>\n  boardsSignal.value.find((b) => b.id === currentBoardId.value)\n);\n```\n\n**Post Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/postSignals.ts\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const postFilter = signal<PostType | \"all\">(\"all\");\nexport const filteredPosts = computed(() => {\n  const filter = postFilter.value;\n  if (filter === \"all\") return postsSignal.value;\n  return postsSignal.value.filter((p) => p.type === filter);\n});\n```\n\n**Member Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/memberSignals.ts\nexport const membersSignal = signal<Member[]>([]);\nexport const currentUserRole = computed(() => {\n  const members = membersSignal.value;\n  const userId = currentUserId.value;\n  return members.find((m) => m.userId === userId)?.role || \"guest\";\n});\n```\n\n### Real-Time Integration\n\n**Update Signals from Ably Messages:**\n\n```typescript\n// components/board/PostProvider.tsx\nuseChannel(`board:${boardId}`, (message) => {\n  switch (message.name) {\n    case \"post:create\":\n      addPost(message.data);\n      break;\n\n    case \"post:update\":\n      updatePost(message.data.id, message.data);\n      break;\n\n    case \"post:delete\":\n      deletePost(message.data.id);\n      break;\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Signals\n\n**Reset Signals in beforeEach:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { postsSignal, filterSignal } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nbeforeEach(() => {\n  postsSignal.value = [];\n  filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n});\n\ntest(\"filters posts by type\", () => {\n  postsSignal.value = [\n    { id: \"1\", type: \"went_well\", content: \"Test\" },\n    { id: \"2\", type: \"to_improve\", content: \"Test\" },\n  ];\n\n  filterSignal.value = \"went_well\";\n  expect(filteredPosts.value).toHaveLength(1);\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-10\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:18:02.791Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring efficient client-side state management and reactive UI updates.","zh":"适用于需要高效客户端状态管理和响应式UI更新的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なクライアント側の状態管理とリアクティブなUI更新を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 클라이언트 측 상태 관리 및 리액티브 UI 업데이트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que requieren un manejo eficiente del estado del lado del cliente y actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario reactivas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une gestion efficace de l''état côté client et des mises à jour d''interface utilisateur réactives.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Client-Seitige Zustandsverwaltung und reaktive Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Frontend Agents que requerem gestão de estado eficiente e atualizações de UI reativas.","ru":"Идеальный для Frontend Agents, требующих эффективного управления состоянием и реактивных обновлений UI.","ar":"مثالي لل Frontend Agents الذين يتطلبون إدارة حالة فعالة و aktualizaciones من UI reaktif."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage mutable state with simple signals, computed signals, and batched updates, leveraging libraries like @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth for optimized performance and re-renders.","zh":"赋予代理管理可变状态的能力，使用简单的信号、计算信号和批量更新，利用@preact/signal、Turso、Next.js和Supabase Auth等库来优化性能和重新渲染。","ja":"エージェントがミュータブルな状態をシンプルなシグナル、計算されたシグナル、およびバッチ更新で管理できるようにし、@preact/signal、Turso、Next.js、Supabase Authなどのライブラリを使用してパフォーマンスと再描画を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 가변 상태를 단순한 신호, 계산된 신호 및 배치 업데이트로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js 및 Supabase Auth와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 성능과 재렌더링을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado mutable con señales simples, señales computadas y actualizaciones por lotes, aprovechando bibliotecas como @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js y Supabase Auth para un rendimiento y vuelta a renderizar optimizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état mutable avec des signaux simples, des signaux calculés et des mises à jour par lots, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js et Supabase Auth pour des performances et des re-rendus optimisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den mutablen Zustand mit einfachen Signalen, berechneten Signalen und Batch-Aktualisierungen zu verwalten, indem es Bibliotheken wie @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js und Supabase Auth für optimierte Leistung und Neuerstellung nutzt.","pt":"Empowers agents to manage mutable state with simple signals, computed signals, and batched updates, leveraging libraries like @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth for optimized performance and re-renders.","ru":"Empowers agents to manage mutable state with simple signals, computed signals, and batched updates, leveraging libraries like @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth for optimized performance and re-renders.","ar":"Empowers agents to manage mutable state with simple signals, computed signals, and batched updates, leveraging libraries like @preact/signal, Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth for optimized performance and re-renders."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing reactive UI updates with signal-state-management","Batching state updates for improved performance","Organizing state by domain for enhanced scalability"],"zh":["实现具有信号状态管理的响应式UI更新","批量状态更新以提高性能","按域组织状态以增强可扩展性"],"ja":["シグナル状態管理を使用したリアクティブなUI更新の実装","パフォーマンスの向上のための状態更新のバッチング","ドメインによる状態の整理によるスケーラビリティの向上"],"ko":["신호 상태 관리를 사용한 리액티브 UI 업데이트의 구현","성능 향상을 위한 상태 업데이트의 배치 처리","도메인에 의한 상태의 조직으로 확장성 향상"],"es":["Implementar actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario reactivas con gestión de estado de señal","Lotear actualizaciones de estado para una mejor rendimiento","Organizar el estado por dominio para una mayor escalabilidad"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des mises à jour d''interface utilisateur réactives avec une gestion d''état de signal","Lot de mises à jour d''état pour améliorer les performances","Organiser l''état par domaine pour une meilleure scalabilité"],"de":["Reaktive Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen mit Signalzustandsverwaltung implementieren","Zustandsaktualisierungen batchen, um die Leistung zu verbessern","Zustand nach Domäne organisieren, um eine bessere Skalierbarkeit zu erreichen"],"pt":["Implementing reactive UI updates with signal-state-management","Batching state updates for improved performance","Organizing state by domain for enhanced scalability"],"ru":["Implementing reactive UI updates with signal-state-management","Batching state updates for improved performance","Organizing state by domain for enhanced scalability"],"ar":["Implementing reactive UI updates with signal-state-management","Batching state updates for improved performance","Organizing state by domain for enhanced scalability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @preact/signal library","Designed for client-side application state management","Optimized for use with React components and Next.js"],"zh":["需要@preact/signal库","设计用于客户端应用程序状态管理","针对使用React组件和Next.js进行优化"],"ja":["@preact/signalライブラリが必要","クライアント側アプリケーションの状態管理用に設計","ReactコンポーネントおよびNext.jsの使用に最適化"],"ko":["@preact/signal 라이브러리가 필요","클라이언트 측 애플리케이션 상태 관리 용으로 설계됨","React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js와 함께 사용할 때 최적화"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca @preact/signal","Diseñado para la gestión de estado de aplicaciones del lado del cliente","Optimizado para su uso con componentes React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque @preact/signal","Conçu pour la gestion d''état des applications côté client","Optimisé pour une utilisation avec des composants React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt die @preact/signal-Bibliothek","Für die Verwaltung des Client-seitigen Anwendungsstatus konzipiert","Optimiert für die Verwendung mit React-Komponenten und Next.js"],"pt":["Requires @preact/signal library","Designed for client-side application state management","Optimized for use with React components and Next.js"],"ru":["Requires @preact/signal library","Designed for client-side application state management","Optimized for use with React components and Next.js"],"ar":["Requires @preact/signal library","Designed for client-side application state management","Optimized for use with React components and Next.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"983fb9eacda7d8731f760c7fed42bfec26c210acfaf34d33250010d739ef8830","qualityScore":46}');
