rnativas a use-modern-browser-apis","use-modern-browser-apis vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de use-modern-browser-apis","guía de configuración de use-modern-browser-apis","desarrollo web con use-modern-browser-apis","mejora de habilidades de desarrollo con use-modern-browser-apis"],"fr":["comment utiliser use-modern-browser-apis","qu''est-ce que use-modern-browser-apis","alternatives à use-modern-browser-apis","use-modern-browser-apis vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de use-modern-browser-apis","guide de configuration de use-modern-browser-apis","développement web avec use-modern-browser-apis","amélioration des compétences en développement avec use-modern-browser-apis"],"de":["wie man use-modern-browser-apis verwendet","was ist use-modern-browser-apis","alternativen zu use-modern-browser-apis","use-modern-browser-apis vs andere KI-Tools","installation von use-modern-browser-apis","einrichtungsanleitung für use-modern-browser-apis","webentwicklung mit use-modern-browser-apis","verbesserung der entwicklerfähigkeiten mit use-modern-browser-apis"],"pt":["como usar APIs modernas do navegador","o que são APIs modernas do navegador","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas ao React","guia de instalação do Node.js","configuração do CLI"],"ru":["как использовать современные браузерные API","что такое современные браузерные API","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы React","руководство по установке Node.js","настройка CLI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الحديثة للمتصفح","ما هي واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الحديثة للمتصفح","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل ل React","دليل تثبيت Node.js","إعداد CLI"]}},"owner":"academind","repo":"claude-code-course","repoPath":"academind/claude-code-course","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.942Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"use-modern-browser-apis","description":"Utilize built-in browser APIs (like Popover API, View Transitions etc) instead of building features manually via JavaScript","bodyPreview":"# Using Modern Browser APIs\n\nWe prefer native, modern browser APIs — _standardized, widely supported, and high-leverage_ — to heavy external libraries or custom fallbacks. Use them to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size where appropriate.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n- **PREFER** browser-native capabilities over third-party dependencies\n- **PROGRESSIVE ENHANCE**: Always provide sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren’t available in all clients\n- **ASYNC & SECURE**: Use promise-based and","body":"# Using Modern Browser APIs\n\nWe prefer native, modern browser APIs — _standardized, widely supported, and high-leverage_ — to heavy external libraries or custom fallbacks. Use them to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size where appropriate.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n- **PREFER** browser-native capabilities over third-party dependencies\n- **PROGRESSIVE ENHANCE**: Always provide sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren’t available in all clients\n- **ASYNC & SECURE**: Use promise-based and secure context APIs for non-blocking, safe access\n\n## Core & Widely Supported APIs\n\nThese APIs are stable, broadly implemented, and useful in everyday applications.\n\n### UI & Interaction\n\n- **Intersection Observer API** — Efficiently detect when elements enter/exit the viewport (lazy loading, infinite scroll).\n- **ResizeObserver API** — React to element size changes without layout thrashing.\n- **PerformanceObserver API** — Observe performance metrics (RUM/perf insights).\n- **BroadcastChannel API** — Cross-tab communication in the same origin.\n\n### Navigation & View Management\n\n- **View Transitions API** — Native, hardware-accelerated transitions between UI states.\n- **URLPattern API** — Declaratively match and parse URLs (helps in routing logic).\n\n### Clipboard & Sharing\n\n- **Clipboard Async API** — Non-blocking, modern clipboard read/write with user consent.\n- **Web Share API Level 2** — Share text, links, files through native device dialogs.\n\n### Files & Persistence\n\n- **File System Access API** — Read/write local files with user permissions.\n- **File Handle & Directory Picker** extensions for batch file/directory selection.\n\n### Concurrency & Scheduling\n\n- **Web Locks API** — Coordinate async access to shared resources (avoid races).\n- **Scheduling API** — Prioritize/background non-essential work to improve responsiveness.\n\n### Workers & Off-Main Thread\n\n- **Web Workers API** — Run scripts off the main thread for intensive tasks.\n- **OffscreenCanvas** — Use canvas rendering in workers for performant graphics/visuals.\n\n### Speech & Accessibility\n\n- **Web Speech API** — Integrate speech recognition and synthesis for accessibility and voice UI.\n\n### Advanced Graphics & Compute\n\n- **WebGPU API** — Low-level GPU access for high-perf rendering and compute workloads (in many browsers; includes Chromium + newer Safari + Firefox support).\n\n### Real-Time & Networking\n\n- **WebRTC** — Real-time peer-to-peer audio/video communication without plugins.\n\n## When to Use & How to Fallback\n\n- **FEATURE DETECTION** is required before use:\n  ```js\n  if (''clipboard'' in navigator) { … }\n  ```\n\nFor APIs not universally supported (e.g., WebGPU), provide a graceful fallback (WebGL or degraded UI).\n\nAlways combine user gesture requirements (e.g., for sharing or clipboard) with permission checks.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**ASYNC FIRST**: Prefer promise/async APIs to avoid blocking UI.\n\n**PERMISSIONS UI**: Convey clearly to users when the browser will ask for access (files, clipboard, sharing).\n\n**PERFORMANCE MINDFUL**: Observe and prioritize main thread work using PerformanceObserver or Scheduling APIs.\n\n**SECURE CONTEXTS**: Use HTTPS; many APIs require secure contexts to function.\n\n## General Principles\n\nWrite code for browsers as platforms, not just JS engines.\n\nPrefer native semantics (e.g., lazy loading via IntersectionObserver vs manual scroll handlers).\n\nReduce external dependencies where modern browser APIs suffice.\n\nDocument API usage and fallback patterns for maintenance and cross-browser support.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:39:41.640Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing native browser API integration and high-leverage capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing native browser API integration and high-leverage capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing native browser API integration and high-leverage capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing native browser API integration and high-leverage capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Frontend que necesitan integración nativa con las API del navegador y capacidades de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une intégration native des API du navigateur et de capacités à haut rendement.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine native Browser-API-Integration und leistungsstarke Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração de API de navegador nativa e capacidades de alto ganho.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, требующих родной интеграции браузерной API и возможностей с высоким коэффициентом усиления.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية للمتصفح وقدرات ذات رافعة عالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size using standardized, widely-supported browser APIs like promise-based and async/secure capabilities.","zh":"Empowers agents to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size using standardized, widely-supported browser APIs like promise-based and async/secure capabilities.","ja":"Empowers agents to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size using standardized, widely-supported browser APIs like promise-based and async/secure capabilities.","ko":"Empowers agents to simplify logic, improve performance, and reduce bundle size using standardized, widely-supported browser APIs like promise-based and async/secure capabilities.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar la lógica, mejorar el rendimiento y reducir el tamaño del bundle utilizando API del navegador estandarizadas y ampliamente compatibles, como las capacidades basadas en promesas y async/secure.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier la logique, d''améliorer les performances et de réduire la taille du bundle en utilisant des API de navigateur standardisées et largement prises en charge, comme les capacités basées sur les promesses et async/secure.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Logik zu vereinfachen, die Leistung zu verbessern und die Bundle-Größe zu reduzieren, indem standardisierte, weitgehend unterstützte Browser-APIs wie promise-basierte und async/secure-Fähigkeiten genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes simplifiquem a lógica, melhorem o desempenho e reduzam o tamanho do pacote usando APIs de navegador padrão e amplamente suportadas, como capacidades baseadas em promessas e assíncronas/seguras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить логику, улучшить производительность и уменьшить размер пакета с помощью стандартизированных, широко поддерживаемых браузерных API, таких как возможностями на основе обещаний и асинхронными/безопасными возможностями.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تبسيط المنطق وتحسين الأداء وتقليل حجم الحزمة باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القياسية للمتصفح وواسعة الدعم مثل القدرات القائمة على الوعد والتزامن / الأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Progressively enhancing web applications with native browser APIs","Simplifying logic and improving performance using browser-native capabilities","Providing sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren''t available in all clients"],"zh":["Progressively enhancing web applications with native browser APIs","Simplifying logic and improving performance using browser-native capabilities","Providing sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren''t available in all clients"],"ja":["Progressively enhancing web applications with native browser APIs","Simplifying logic and improving performance using browser-native capabilities","Providing sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren''t available in all clients"],"ko":["Progressively enhancing web applications with native browser APIs","Simplifying logic and improving performance using browser-native capabilities","Providing sensible fallbacks for APIs that aren''t available in all clients"],"es":["Mejora progresiva de aplicaciones web con API nativas del navegador","Simplificación de la lógica y mejora del rendimiento mediante capacidades nativas del navegador","Proporcionar alternativas sensatas para API que no están disponibles en todos los clientes"],"fr":["Amélioration progressive des applications web avec des API natives du navigateur","Simplification de la logique et amélioration des performances en utilisant les capacités natives du navigateur","Fournir des solutions de repli sensées pour les API qui ne sont pas disponibles dans tous les clients"],"de":["Progressive Erweiterung von Webanwendungen mit nativen Browser-APIs","Vereinfachung der Logik und Verbesserung der Leistung mit nativen Browser-Fähigkeiten","Bereitstellung sinnvoller Fallbacks für APIs, die nicht in allen Clients verfügbar sind"],"pt":["Melhorar progressivamente as aplicações web com APIs de navegador nativas","Simplificar a lógica e melhorar o desempenho usando capacidades nativas do navegador","Fornecer fallbacks sensatos para APIs que não estão disponíveis em todos os clientes"],"ru":["Постепенно улучшать веб-приложения с помощью родных браузерных API","Упрощать логику и улучшать производительность с помощью возможностей браузера","Предоставлять разумные запасные варианты для API, которые не доступны во всех клиентах"],"ar":["تحسين التطبيقات الويب تدريجياً باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية للمتصفح","تبسيط المنطق وتحس