ement de monorepos avec Turborepo","Création de landing pages avec Astro","Mise en œuvre d''API d''inscription avec Hono","Intégration avec Postgres","Efficacité dans le développement et le déploiement"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Monorepos mit Turborepo","Erstellung von Landingpages mit Astro","Implementierung von Signup-APIs mit Hono","Integration mit Postgres","Effizienz bei Entwicklung und Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Criação de landing pages com Astro","API de signup com Hono","Utilização de Postgres como banco de dados","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvimento","Implantação de monorepo Turborepo"],"ru":["Создание лендингов с Astro","API регистрации с Hono","Использование Postgres в качестве базы данных","Повышение эффективности разработки","Развертывание монорепо Turborepo"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات هبوط مع Astro","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات التسجيل مع Hono","استخدام Postgres كقاعدة بيانات","تحسين كفاءة التطوير","نشر مونوربو Turborepo"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Turborepo monorepo","Astro landing pages","Hono signup API","Postgres数据库","如何使用Turborepo","Turborepo替代品","Turborepo vs Git"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Turborepo monorepo","Astro landing pages","Hono signup API","Postgresデータベース","Turborepoの使い方","Turborepoの代替","Turborepo vs Git"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Turborepo 모노레포","Astro 랜딩 페이지","Hono 가입 API","Postgres 데이터베이스","Turborepo 사용법","Turborepo 대체품","Turborepo vs Git"],"es":["herramientas de ia","despliegue de turborepo","astro landing pages","hono signup api","postgres integración","cómo usar turborepo","turborepo vs otros","guía de instalación de turborepo"],"fr":["outils d''ia","déploiement de turborepo","astro pages de destination","hono api d''inscription","intégration postgres","comment utiliser turborepo","turborepo vs autres","guide d''installation de turborepo"],"de":["ki-tools","turborepo-bereitstellung","astro-landingpages","hono-signup-api","postgres-integration","wie man turborepo verwendet","turborepo vs andere","anleitung zur installation von turborepo"],"pt":["como usar Turborepo","o que é monorepo","Astro vs React","Hono alternative","Postgres tutorial","deploy de monorepo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["как использовать Turborepo","что такое монорепо","Astro vs React","альтернативы Hono","урок Postgres","развертывание монорепо","разработка приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Turborepo","ما هو مونوربو","Astro vs React","بديل Hono","دورة Postgres","نشر مونوربو","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"sethdavis512","repo":"quick-landing-page","repoPath":"sethdavis512/quick-landing-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.950Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to push code to Railway, says railway up, deploy, deploy to railway, ship, or push. For initial setup or creating services, use new skill. For Docker images, use environment skill.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- De","body":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- Describe what changed: \"Fix memory leak in worker process\"\n- Reference tickets/issues: \"Implement feature #123\"\n- Be concise but meaningful: \"Update deps and fix build warnings\"\n\n## Modes\n\n### Detach Mode (default)\nStarts deploy and returns immediately. Use for most deploys.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n### CI Mode\nStreams build logs until complete. Use when user wants to watch the build or needs to debug issues.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --ci -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n**When to use CI mode:**\n- User says \"deploy and watch\", \"deploy and fix issues\"\n- User is debugging build failures\n- User wants to see build output\n\n## Deploy Specific Service\n\nDefault is linked service. To deploy to a different service:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach --service backend -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n## Deploy to Unlinked Project\n\nDeploy to a project without linking first:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --project <project-id> --environment production --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\nRequires both `--project` and `--environment` flags.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-m, --message <MSG>` | Commit message describing the deploy (always use this) |\n| `-d, --detach` | Don''t attach to logs (default) |\n| `-c, --ci` | Stream build logs, exit when done |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `-e, --environment <NAME>` | Target environment (defaults to linked) |\n| `-p, --project <ID>` | Target project (requires --environment) |\n| `[PATH]` | Path to deploy (defaults to current directory) |\n\n## Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks UP the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory of a linked project, you don''t need to relink.\n\nFor subdirectory deployments, prefer setting `rootDirectory` via the environment skill, then deploy normally with `railway up`.\n\n## After Deploy\n\n### Detach mode\n```\nDeploying to <service>...\n```\nUse `deployment` skill to check build status (with `--lines` flag).\n\n### CI mode\nBuild logs stream inline. If build fails, the error will be in the output.\n\n**Do NOT run `railway logs --build` after CI mode** - the logs already streamed. If you need\nmore context, use `deployment` skill with `--lines` flag (never stream).\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Check status after deploy**: Use `service` skill\n- **View logs**: Use `deployment` skill\n- **Fix config issues**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Redeploy after config fix**: Use `environment` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Project Linked\n```\nNo Railway project linked. Run `railway link` first.\n```\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Build Failure (CI mode)\nThe build logs already streamed - analyze them directly from the `railway up --ci` output.\nDo NOT run `railway logs` after CI mode (it streams forever without `--lines`).\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing dependencies → check package.json/requirements.txt\n- Build command wrong → use environment skill to fix\n- Dockerfile issues → check dockerfile path\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:43:53.004Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined monorepo deployment to Railway","zh":"适用于需要将完整堆栈代理部署到 Railway 的简化 monorepo 部署","ja":"Railway へのモノレポデプロイをストリームライン化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Railway에 대한 스트림 라인화 된 모노레포 배포가 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan una implementación de monorepo simplificada en Railway","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un déploiement de monorepo simplifié sur Railway","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Monorepo-Bereitstellung auf Railway benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de implantação de monorepo simplificada no Railway","ru":"Идеально для Full Stack агентов, требующих упрощенного развертывания monorepo на Railway","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر monorepo مبسط إلى Railway"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`, handling local code changes and commit messages with ease, leveraging Turborepo monorepo and Postgres integration","zh":"赋予代理从当前目录部署代码到 Railway 的能力，使用 `railway up` 命令，轻松处理本地代码更改和提交消息，利用 Turborepo monorepo 和 Postgres 集成","ja":"エージェントが `railway up` を使用して現在のディレクトリから Railway にコードをデプロイできるようにし、ローカルのコード変更とコミットメッセージを簡単に処理する、Turborepo モノレポと Postgres 統合を利用","ko":"에이전트가 `railway up`을 사용하여 현재 디렉토리에서 Railway로 코드를 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 로컬 코드 변경 및 커밋 메시지를 쉽게 처리하며, Turborepo 모노레포 및 Postgres 통합을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar código desde el directorio actual en Railway utilizando `railway up`, manejando cambios de código local y mensajes de confirmación con facilidad, aprovechando la integración de Turborepo monorepo y Postgres","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer du code à partir du répertoire actuel sur Railway en utilisant `railway up`, gérant les modifications de code local et les messages de validation avec facilité, en exploitant l''intégration de Turborepo monorepo et Postgres","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Code aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis auf Railway mit `railway up` zu bereitstellen, dabei lokale Codeänderungen und Commit-Nachrichten mühelos handhabend und die Integration von Turborepo-Monorepo und Postgres nutzend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar código do diretório atual para o Railway usando `railway up`, lidando com alterações de código local e mensagens de commit com facilidade, aproveitando a integração do Turborepo monorepo e do Postgres","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать код из текущего каталога на Railway с помощью `railway up`, обрабатывая местные изменения кода и сообщения коммитов с легкостью, используя интеграцию Turborepo monorepo и Postgres","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر الكود من الدليل الحالي إلى Railway باست