and Postgres integration","Dependent on `railway up` command-line tool"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和配置","仅限 Turborepo monorepo 和 Postgres 集成","依赖于 `railway up` 命令行工具"],"ja":["Railway アカウントと設定が必要","Turborepo モノレポと Postgres 統合に限定"," `railway up` コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 구성이 필요","Turborepo 모노레포 및 Postgres 통합에 한정","`railway up` 명령줄 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de Railway","Limitado a la integración de Turborepo monorepo y Postgres","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `railway up`"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration Railway","Limité à l''intégration de Turborepo monorepo et Postgres","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `railway up`"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Integration von Turborepo-Monorepo und Postgres","Abhängig von der Befehlszeilen-Tool `railway up`"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração do Railway","Limitado à integração do Turborepo monorepo e do Postgres","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `railway up`"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и настройки Railway","Ограничен интеграцией Turborepo monorepo и Postgres","Зависит от инструмента командной строки `railway up`"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب وضبط Railway","محدود بدمج Turborepo monorepo و Postgres","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `railway up`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8f76d1c79c47ec542bf17ac0ce554b560930e25f673f2ed74c7ed02a8619671f","qualityScore":46}');
