 Fullstack 서비스를 구축하고 배포하도록 도와줍니다","es":"Plantilla de servicio fullstack para desarrolladores, con herramientas de AI para mejorar la eficiencia","fr":"Modèle de service fullstack pour les développeurs, avec des outils d''IA pour améliorer l''efficacité","de":"Vorlage für Fullstack-Dienste für Entwickler, mit KI-Tools für verbesserte Effizienz","pt":"O modelo de serviço fullstack para ferramentas de IA é uma solução personalizada para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Шаблон для сервиса fullstack ИИ Агентов является индивидуальным решением для разработчиков.","ar":"نموذج الخدمة الكاملة لعميل ذكاء اصطناعي هو حل مخصص للمطورين.","en":"Fullstack 서비스를 위한 템플릿"},"definition":{"en":"Fullstack 서비스를 위한 템플릿"},"features":{"zh":["支持React、Python、Node.js等多种开发框架","提供CLI工具用于快速构建和部署服务","集成AI算法用于优化服务性能和安全性"],"ja":["React、Python、Node.jsなどの多種の開発フレームワークをサポート","CLIツールを提供してサービスを迅速に構築および展開","AIアルゴリズムを統合してサービスパフォーマンスとセキュリティを最適化"],"ko":["React, Python, Node.js 등의多种 개발 프레임워크 지원","CLI 도구 제공하여 서비스를 빠르게 구축하고 배포","AI 알고리즘 통합하여 서비스 성능과 보안을 최적화"],"es":["Plantilla predefinida para servicios fullstack","Integración con herramientas de AI para mejorar la productividad","Compatibilidad con React, Python y Node.js","CLI para una implementación fácil","Soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Modèle prédefini pour les services fullstack","Intégration avec des outils d''IA pour améliorer la productivité","Compatibilité avec React, Python et Node.js","CLI pour une mise en œuvre facile","Support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Vorgefertigte Vorlage für Fullstack-Dienste","Integration mit KI-Tools für verbesserte Produktivität","Kompatibilität mit React, Python und Node.js","CLI für eine einfache Implementierung","Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Criação de soluções personalizadas","Integração com ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento fullstack","Modelo de template flexível","Suporte a múltiplos frameworks"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных решений","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ","Разработка fullstack","Гибкий шаблон","Поддержка нескольких фреймворков"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","التطوير الكامل","قالب مرن","دعم إطار عمل متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具","什么是Fullstack服务","AI智能工具安装","Fullstack服务模板设置指南","React开发框架","Python开发框架","Node.js开发框架"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使用方法","フルスタックサービスの概要","AIエージェントのインストール","フルスタックサービス用テンプレートの設定ガイド","React開発フレームワーク","Python開発フレームワーク","Node.js開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","Fullstack 서비스란","AI 에이전트 설치","Fullstack 서비스를 위한 템플릿 설정 가이드","React 개발 프레임워크","Python 개발 프레임워크","Node.js 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["herramientas de AI","plantilla de servicio fullstack","desarrollo web","productividad","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA","modèle de service fullstack","développement web","productivité","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","support pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools","Vorlage für Fullstack-Dienste","Webentwicklung","Produktivität","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","modelo de serviço fullstack","desenvolvimento fullstack","criar soluções personalizadas","integração com ia","guias de instalação","configuração de ferramentas de ia"],"ru":["инструменты ии","шаблон для сервиса fullstack","разработка fullstack","создание индивидуальных решений","интеграция с ии","руководства по установке","настройка инструментов ии"],"ar":["أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","نموذج الخدمة الكاملة","التطوير الكامل","إنشاء حلول مخصصة","التكامل مع ذكاء اصطناعي","دلائل التثبيت","إعداد أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"bloominggrace","repo":"create-fullstack-service","repoPath":"bloominggrace/create-fullstack-service","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.047Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-title","description":"Use when writing Pull Request titles or commit messages to follow the Korean action word convention.","bodyPreview":"# Pull Request Title Guide\n\nUse this skill when creating PR titles or commit messages.\n\n## Basic Format\n\n```\n{Subject} {Action}\n```\n\n- **Subject**: The target being modified (file, module, feature, library, etc.)\n- **Action**: The type of change being made\n\n## Subject Naming Rules\n\nChoose the subject based on what is being modified:\n\n| Target Type | Subject Example | Description |\n|-------------|-----------------|-------------|\n| Config file | TSConfig, ESLint, MikroORM | Use the official/common","body":"# Pull Request Title Guide\n\nUse this skill when creating PR titles or commit messages.\n\n## Basic Format\n\n```\n{Subject} {Action}\n```\n\n- **Subject**: The target being modified (file, module, feature, library, etc.)\n- **Action**: The type of change being made\n\n## Subject Naming Rules\n\nChoose the subject based on what is being modified:\n\n| Target Type | Subject Example | Description |\n|-------------|-----------------|-------------|\n| Config file | TSConfig, ESLint, MikroORM | Use the official/common name of the tool |\n| Module | JwtModule, CacheModule, UsersController | Use the class/module name |\n| Feature | CI, E2E 테스트, Git Hooks | Use the feature name |\n| Library | Lodash, Vitest, Turborepo | Use the library name |\n| Domain | 사용자, 인증, OTP | Use Korean domain terms |\n\n### Examples\n- `tsconfig.ts` → **TSConfig**\n- `eslint.config.mjs` → **ESLint**\n- `mikro-orm.config.ts` → **MikroORM**\n- `users.service.ts` → **사용자** or **UsersService**\n\n## Action Types\n\n| Action | Usage | Example |\n|--------|-------|---------|\n| 설정 | Initial setup or configuration | `JwtModule 설정` |\n| 변경 | Modify existing configuration | `TSConfig 변경` |\n| 수정 | Fix issues or errors | `ESLint 에러 수정` |\n| 추가 | Add new features | `UsersController 테스트 추가` |\n| 적용 | Apply new tools or patterns | `Turborepo 적용` |\n| 구축 | Build infrastructure | `CI 구축` |\n| 교체 | Replace with alternatives | `Lodash를 es-toolkit으로 교체` |\n| 마이그레이션 | Migrate to new tools | `Jest에서 Vitest로 마이그레이션` |\n| 표준화 | Standardize patterns | `응답 변환 방식 표준화` |\n| 보강 | Strengthen/enhance | `사용자 수정 테스트 보강` |\n| 향상 | Improve quality | `pre-push 로그 가독성 향상` |\n| 제외 | Exclude from rules | `fixup 커밋 제목 길이 제한 제외` |\n| 정의 | Define rules/specs | `Cursor 규칙 정의` |\n\n## Good Examples\n\n```\n✅ TSConfig 경로 별칭 설정\n✅ mise 환경 변수 설정\n✅ ESLint 설정 수정\n✅ JWT 환경 변수 이름 오타 수정\n✅ Jest에서 Vitest로 마이그레이션\n✅ Lodash를 es-toolkit으로 교체\n✅ 사용자 수정 테스트 보강\n✅ pre-push 로그 가독성 향상\n```\n\n## Bad Examples\n\n```\n❌ 설정 파일 수정 (too vague - what config?)\n❌ 버그 수정 (too vague - what bug?)\n❌ 테스트 추가 (too vague - what test?)\n❌ Web 앱 TSConfig 설정 (unnecessary context - Vite implies Web)\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Be specific**: The subject should clearly identify what was changed\n2. **Use official names**: TSConfig (not tsconfig), ESLint (not eslint)\n3. **Avoid redundancy**: Don''t repeat context that can be inferred\n4. **Keep it concise**: Title should be scannable at a glance\n5. **Use Korean for actions**: 설정, 수정, 추가, etc.\n\n## Related: Commit Message vs PR Title\n\n- **Commit messages**: Can be more granular, multiple per PR\n- **PR title**: Should summarize the overall change in one line\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:18.294Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message and pull request title generation.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息和拉取请求标题生成的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージとプルリクエストタイトル生成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지와 풀 리퀘스트 제목 생성이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan mensajes de confirmación y títulos de solicitud de extracción estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant des messages de commit et des titres de demande de tirage standardisés.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die standardisierte Commit-Mitteilungen und Pull-Request-Titel benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message and pull request title generation.","ru":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message and pull request title generation.","ar":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message and pull request title generation."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create consistent and descriptive pull request titles using a basic format of {Subject} {Action}, with subject naming rules for config files, modules, features, and libraries, supporting tools like ESLint and MikroORM.","zh":"赋予代理创建一致且描述性的拉取请求标题的能力，使用{主题} {操作}的基本格式，具有针对配置文件、模块、功能和库的主题命名规则，支持像ESLint和MikroORM这样的工具。","ja":"エージェントが一貫性のあるプルリクエストタイトルを{サブジェクト} {アクション}の基本形式で作成できるようにし、ESLintやMikroORMなどのツールをサポートするための設定ファイル、モジュール、機能、ライブラリのサブジェクト命名規則を備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 {주제} {작업}의 기본 형식을 사용하여 일관성 있고 설명적인 풀 리퀘스트 제목을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, ESLint 및 MikroORM과 같은 도구를 지원하기 위한 구성 파일, 모듈, 기능 및 라이브러리의 주제 이름 규칙을 가집니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear títulos de solicitud de extracción coherentes y descriptivos utilizando un formato básico de {Sujeto} {Acción}, con reglas de nomenclatura de sujetos para archivos de configuración, módulos, características y bibliotecas, y que admite herramientas como ESLint y MikroORM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des titres de demande de tirage cohérents et descriptifs en utilisant un format de base de {Sujet} {Action}, avec des règles de nommage de sujets pour les fichiers de configuration, les modules, les fonctionnalités et les bibliothèques, et qui prend en charge des outils comme ESLint et MikroORM.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente und beschreibende Pull-Request-Titel zu erstellen, indem sie ein grundlegendes Format von {Subjekt} {Aktion} verwenden, mit Subjektbenennungsregeln für Konfigurationsdateien, Module, Funktionen und Bibliotheken, und unterstützt Tools wie ESLint und MikroORM.","pt":"Empowers agents to create consistent and descriptive pull request titles using a basic format of {Subject} {Action}, with subject naming rules for config files, modules, features, and libraries, supporting tools like ESLint and MikroORM.","ru":"Empowers agents to create consistent and descriptive pull request titles using a basic format of {Subject} {Action}, with subject naming rules for config files, modules, features, and libraries, supporting tools like ESLint and MikroORM.","ar":"Empowers agents to create consistent and descriptive pull request titles using a basic format of {Subject} {Action}, with subject naming rules for config files, modules, features, and libraries, supporting tools like ESLint and MikroORM."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request title generation","Standardizing commit messages for team collaboration","Creating descriptive titles for config file changes"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求标题生成","标准化提交消息以便团队协作","为配置文件更改创建描述性标题"],"ja":["プルリクエストタイトル生成の自動化","チームコラボレーションのためのコミットメッセージの標準化","設定ファイルの変更のための説明的なタイトルの作成"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트 제목 생성 자동화","팀 협력을 위한 커밋 메시지 표준화","구성 파일 변경에 대한 설명 제목 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de títulos de solicitud de extracción","Estandarizar los mensajes de confirmación para la colaboración en equipo","Crear títulos descriptivos para cambios en archivos de configuración"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de titres de demande de tirage","Standardiser les messages de commit pour la collaboration d''équipe","Créer des titres descriptifs pour les modifications de fichiers de configuration"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von Pull-Request-Titeln","Standardisieren von Commit-Mitteilungen für Teamzusammenarbeit","Erstellen beschreibender Titel für Änderungen an Konfigurationsdateien"],"pt":["Automating pull request title generation","Standardizing commit messages for team collaboration","Creating descriptive titles for config file changes"],"ru":["Automating pull request title generation","Standardizing commit messages for team collaboration","Creating descriptive titles for config file changes"],"ar":["Automating pull request title generation","Standardizing commit messages for team collaboration","Creating descriptive titles for config file changes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of target file or module being modified","Limited to pull request titles and commit messages"],"zh":["需要了解被修改的目标文件或模块","仅限于拉取请求标题和提交消息"],"ja":["変更されるターゲットファイルまたはモジュールの知識が必要","プルリクエストタイトルとコミットメッセージのみ"],"ko":["변경되는 대상 파일 또는 모듈에 대한 지식이 필요","풀 리퀘스트 제목 및 커밋 메시지만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del archivo o módulo objetivo que se está modificando","Limitado a títulos de solicitud de extracción y mensajes de confirmación"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du fichier ou du module cible qui est modifié","Limité aux titres de demande de tirage et aux messages de commit"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Ziel-Datei oder des Ziel-Moduls, das geändert wird","Begrenzt auf Pull-Request-Titel und Commit-Mitteilungen"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of target file or module being modified","Limited to pull request titles and commit messages"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of target file or module being modified","Limited to pull request titles and commit messages"],"ar":["Requires knowledge of target file or module being modified","Limited to pull request titles and commit messages"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bd7cc31cc0fc8e509eba148f593f5094e95b093b8511b238ff08d703b1c6e4b4","qualityScore":46}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tylersahagun/elmer/prototype-builder', 'community', 'tylersahagun', 'elmer', 'tylersahagun/elmer', 'prototype-builder', 0, 0, 46, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.050Z', '2026-03-02T03:24:55.356Z', 'a6b7e0faa72d50480134bdbd4446fe366f334686a19b08c1496359a9d89db102', '{"id":"tylersahagun/elmer/prototype-builder","name":"prototype-builder","description":{"zh":"Elmer 是一个 AI 产品管理编排工具，帮助开发者快速构建原型和开发应用","ja":"Elmer は AI エージェントを使用したプロトタイプビルダーと開発ツールです","ko":"Elmer는 개발자가 빠르게 프로토タイプ을 구축하고 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 AI 제품 관리 오케스트레이터입니다","es":"Elmer es una herramienta de IA que permite a los desarrolladores construir prototipos de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"Elmer est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs de construire des prototypes de manière rapide et efficace","de":"Elmer ist ein KI-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Prototypen schnell und effizient zu erstellen","pt":"Elmer é uma ferramenta de prototipagem AI que ajuda desenvolvedores a criar soluções inovadoras com tecnologias como Node.js e React. É uma plataforma de orquestração de produtos que facilita a criação de protótipos","ru":"Elmer - это инструмент прототипирования ИИ, помогающий разработчикам создавать инновационные решения с использованием технологий như Node.js и React. Это платформа оркестровки продуктов, упрощающая создание прототипов","ar":"إلمر هي أداة بناء النماذج الأولية للموارد البشرية بالذكاء الاصطناعي التي تساعد المطورين على بناء حلول مبتكرة باستخدام تقنيات مثل Node.js و React. وهي منصة لorchestration من المنتجات التي تسهل إنشاء النماذج الأولية","en":"Elmer - AI Product Management Orchestrator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 - Elmer 原型构建器","ja":"AIエージェント - Elmer プロトタイプビルダー","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Elmer 프로토タイプ 빌더","es":"Herramientas de AI: Elmer Constructor de Prototipos","fr":"Outils d''IA: Elmer Constructeur de Prototypes","de":"KI-Tools: Elmer Prototypen-Builder","pt":"Ferramenta de Prototipagem AI: Elmer","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Прототипирования - Elmer","ar":"أداة بناء النماذج الأولية للموارد البشرية بالذكاء الاصطنا...","en":"prototype-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Elmer 是一个 AI 产品管理编排工具，帮助开发者快速构建原型和开发应用","ja":"Elmer は AI エージェントを使用したプロトタイプビルダーと開発ツールです","ko":"Elmer는 개발자가 빠르게 프로토タイプ을 구축하고 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 AI 제품 관리 오케스트레이터입니다","es":"Elmer es una herramienta de IA que permite a los desarrolladores construir prototipos de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"Elmer est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs de construire des prototypes de manière rapide et efficace","de":"Elmer ist ein KI-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Prototypen schnell und effizient zu erstellen","pt":"Elmer é uma ferramenta de prototipagem AI que ajuda desenvolvedores a criar soluções inovadoras com tecnologias como Node.js e React. É uma plataforma de orq...","ru":"Elmer - это инструмент прототипирования ИИ, помогающий разработчикам создавать инновационные решения с использованием технологий như Node.js и React. Это пла...","ar":"إلمر هي أداة بناء النماذج الأولية للموارد البشرية بالذكاء الاصطناعي التي تساعد المطورين على بناء حلول مبتكرة باستخدام تقنيات مثل Node.js و React. وهي منصة لo...","en":"Elmer - AI Product Management Orchestrator"},"definition":{"en":"Elmer - AI Product Management Orchestrator"},"features":{"zh":["快速构建原型","AI 产品管理编排","支持 React 和 Node.js","CLI 命令行工具","自动代码生成"],"ja":["プロトタイプの迅速な構築","AI エージェントを使用したプロトタイプビルダー","React と Node.js のサポート","CLI コマンドラインツール","自動コード生成"],"ko":["프로토タイプ의 빠른 구축","AI 에이전트를 사용한 프로토タイプ 빌더","React 및 Node.js 지원","CLI 명령줄 도구","자동 코드 생성"],"es":["Construcción de prototipos rápidos","Orquestación de gestión de productos de IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas","Análisis de datos y retroalimentación"],"fr":["Conception de prototypes rapides","Orchestration de la gestion de produits d''IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Automatisation de tâches","Analyse de données et rétroaction"],"de":["Schneller Prototypenbau","Orchestrierung von KI-Produktmanagement","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Datenanalyse und Feedback"],"pt":["Criação de protótipos com Node.js e React","Orquestração de produtos para desenvolvedores","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a tecnologias de ponta","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Создание прототипов с использованием Node.js и React","Оркестровка продуктов для разработчиков","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка передовых технологий","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج أولية باستخدام Node.js و React","orchestration من المنتجات للمطورين","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم التقنيات المتقدمة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Elmer","什么是 AI 产品管理","Elmer 替代品","Elmer 与竞争对手的比较","Elmer 安装","Elmer 设置指南","AI 产品管理工具","原型构建器"],"ja":["Elmer の使い方","AI エージェントとは","Elmer の代替品","Elmer と競合するツールの比較","Elmer のインストール","Elmer の設定ガイド","AI エージェントのツール","プロトタイプビルダー"],"ko":["Elmer 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Elmer 대체품","Elmer 와競爭對手의 비교","Elmer 설치","Elmer 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","프로토タイプ 빌더"],"es":["herramientas de AI","constructor de prototipos","Elmer","gestión de productos de IA","desarrollo de software","cómo usar Elmer","alternativas a Elmer","Elmer vs otras herramientas de IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","constructeur de prototypes","Elmer","gestion de produits d''IA","développement de logiciels","comment utiliser Elmer","alternatives à Elmer","Elmer vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","Prototypen-Builder","Elmer","KI-Produktmanagement","Software-Entwicklung","wie man Elmer verwendet","Alternativen zu Elmer","Elmer vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramenta de prototipagem AI","como usar Elmer","o que é Elmer","Elmer vs outras ferramentas","instalar Elmer","guia de configuração do Elmer","desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","tecnologias de ponta para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["инструмент прототипирования ИИ","как использовать Elmer","что такое Elmer","Elmer vs другие инструменты","установить Elmer","руководство по настройке Elmer","разработка инновационных решений","передовые технологии для разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة بناء النماذج الأولية للموارد البشرية بالذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام إلمر","ما هو إلمر","إلمر مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت إلمر","دليل إعداد إلمر","تطوير حلول مبتكرة","التقنيات المتقدمة للمطورين"]}},"owner":"tylersahagun","repo":"elmer","repoPath":"tylersahagun/elmer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.050Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prototype-builder","description":"Build human-centric AI prototypes with multiple creative directions, required states, and interactive flow stories. Use when creating Storybook components or UI mockups.","bodyPreview":"# Prototype Builder Skill\n\nSpecialized knowledge for building Storybook prototypes that meet human-centric AI design standards.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new UI prototypes\n- Building Storybook stories\n- Implementing AI feature states\n- Designing interactive user flows\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Trust Before Automation\n\n- New features start as suggestions, not automations\n- Show receipts (evidence) for every AI decision\n- Make confidence levels explicit\n- Graceful failure > silent failure\n\n###","body":"# Prototype Builder Skill\n\nSpecialized knowledge for building Storybook prototypes that meet human-centric AI design standards.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new UI prototypes\n- Building Storybook stories\n- Implementing AI feature states\n- Designing interactive user flows\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Trust Before Automation\n\n- New features start as suggestions, not automations\n- Show receipts (evidence) for every AI decision\n- Make confidence levels explicit\n- Graceful failure > silent failure\n\n### Emotional Design\n\n- **Visceral**: Does it look trustworthy at first glance?\n- **Behavioral**: Does it work predictably?\n- **Reflective**: Does user feel augmented, not replaced?\n\n### Persona Awareness\n\n- **Reps fear**: Surveillance, replacement, embarrassment\n- **Managers fear**: Losing touch, surveillance culture\n- **RevOps fear**: Ungovernable AI, lack of auditability\n\n## Creative Exploration (Required)\n\nFor each major component, create 2-3 directions:\n\n| Direction | User Control | Trust Required | Best Persona        |\n| --------- | ------------ | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| Option A  | Maximum      | Low            | New users, skeptics |\n| Option B  | Balanced     | Medium         | Most users          |\n| Option C  | Minimal      | High           | Power users         |\n\n## Required AI States\n\nEvery AI feature needs ALL states:\n\n| State           | Visual        | Copy              | Animation        |\n| --------------- | ------------- | ----------------- | ---------------- |\n| Loading (short) | Spinner       | None              | Pulse            |\n| Loading (long)  | Progress      | \"Analyzing...\"    | Transitions      |\n| Success         | Check, muted  | Affirming         | Scale+fade 150ms |\n| Error           | Warning       | Honest + solution | Gentle shake     |\n| Low Confidence  | Muted, dotted | \"I think...\"      | None             |\n| Empty           | Illustration  | Encouraging       | Fade in          |\n\n## Required: Flow Stories\n\nEvery prototype MUST include interactive journey stories:\n\n```typescript\nexport const Flow_HappyPath: Story = {\n  render: () => <ComponentJourney />,\n};\n\nexport const Flow_ErrorRecovery: Story = {\n  render: () => <ComponentErrorJourney />,\n};\n```\n\n| Prototype Type   | Required Flows    |\n| ---------------- | ----------------- |\n| Simple feature   | 1 (happy path)    |\n| AI feature       | 2 (happy + error) |\n| Complex workflow | 3+                |\n\n## Component Structure\n\nAlways use versioned folders in `prototypes/src/components/`:\n\n```\nprototypes/src/components/[Initiative]/\n├── index.ts            # Re-exports latest\n├── v1/\n│   ├── Component.tsx\n│   ├── Component.stories.tsx\n│   ├── ComponentJourney.tsx\n│   └── types.ts\n```\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- React 18 + TypeScript (strict)\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui from `@/components/ui/`\n\n## Storybook Title Pattern\n\n```typescript\nconst meta = {\n  title: \"Prototypes/[Initiative]/v1/[ComponentName]\",\n  component: ComponentName,\n};\n```\n\n## Chromatic Deployment\n\nAfter building, deploy to Chromatic:\n\n```bash\ncd prototypes\nnpm run build-storybook\nCHROMATIC_PROJECT_TOKEN=\"chpt_46b823319a0135f\" npm run chromatic\n```\n\n**Production URL:** `https://main--696c2c54e35ea5bca2a772d8.chromatic.com`\n\n## Image Generation for Mockups (Cursor 2.4)\n\nWhen a quick visual is needed before building full components, use image generation:\n\n### When to Generate Images\n\n- **Early concept exploration** - Before committing to code\n- **Stakeholder communication** - Quick visuals for feedback\n- **Design exploration** - Testing multiple directions rapidly\n- **Architecture diagrams** - Visualizing data flows or system design\n\n### How to Use\n\nDescribe the mockup in natural language:\n\n```\n\"Generate an image of a dashboard showing user engagement metrics with a sidebar navigation, using a clean modern design with blue accent colors\"\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Reference existing design system colors/patterns in descriptions\n- Generated images save to `assets/` by default\n- Use for exploration, not final implementation\n- Follow up with coded Storybook components for production\n\n### Example Prompts\n\n| Use Case         | Prompt Example                                                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Dashboard mockup | \"A meeting insights dashboard with cards showing action items, sentiment trends, and speaker breakdown\" |\n| Mobile view      | \"Mobile-first meeting summary view with collapsible sections and swipe actions\"                         |\n| Error state      | \"Error message UI showing a failed CRM sync with retry option and helpful guidance\"                     |\n| Flow diagram     | \"User flow diagram from meeting recording to CRM update showing each step\"                              |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Single option - Always explore 2-3 directions\n- Missing states - All AI states required\n- States without flows - Always include Flow\\_\\* stories\n- Confident wrongness - Show uncertainty\n- Surveillance vibes - \"Helps YOU\" not \"reports ON you\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:55.356Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused AI Agents needing to create human-centric Storybook prototypes with explicit confidence levels and graceful failure handling.","zh":"适用于需要创建以人类为中心的Storybook原型的UI焦点AI代理，具有明确的置信水平和优雅的故障处理。","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが人間中心のStorybookプロトタイプを作成する必要がある場合に適しています。明示的な信頼レベルと優雅な障害処理を備えています。","ko":"인간 중심의 Storybook 프로토타입을 생성해야 하는 UI 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 명시적인 신뢰 수준과 우아한 실패 처리를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan crear prototipos de Storybook centrados en humanos con niveles de confianza explícitos y manejo de fallos elegante.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création de prototypes Storybook centrés sur l''humain avec des niveaux de confiance explicites et une gestion d''erreur élégante.","de":"Ideal für benutzeroberflächenorientierte KI-Agents, die humanozentrierte Storybook-Prototypen mit expliziten Vertrauensniveaus und eleganter Fehlerbehandlung erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em UI que precisam criar protótipos de Storybook centrados no ser humano com níveis de confiança explícitos e tratamento de falhas elegante.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимо создавать прототипы Storybook, ориентированные на человека, с явными уровнями доверия и элегантным обработкой ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الحاسوب الموجهة إلى واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء نماذج Storybook مركز على الإنسان مع مستويات الثقة الصريحة ومعالجة الفشل الراقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design interactive user flows and implement AI feature states with transparency, showing receipts for every AI decision and making confidence levels explicit, leveraging Storybook stories and human-centric AI design standards.","zh":"赋予代理设计交互式用户流程和实现AI功能状态的能力，具有透明度，显示每个AI决策的收据，并使信頼水平显式，利用Storybook故事和人类中心的AI设计标准。","ja":"エージェントにインタラクティブなユーザーフローを設計し、AIの機能状態を実装する能力を与え、透明性を持ち、各AIの決定に対するレシートを表示し、信頼レベルを明示的にし、Storybookのストーリーや人間中心のAI設計標準を利用します。","ko":"대리人が 상호 작용 사용자 흐름을 설계하고 AI 기능 상태를 구현할 수 있도록 하는 동시에 투명성을 제공하고 각 AI 결정에 대한 영수증을 표시하며 신뢰 수준을 명시적으로 하고 Storybook 이야기를 사용하여 인간 중심의 AI 설계 표준을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar flujos de usuario interactivos e implementar estados de características de inteligencia artificial con transparencia, mostrando recibos para cada decisión de inteligencia artificial y haciendo que los niveles de confianza sean explícitos, aprovechando las historias de Storybook y los estándares de diseño de inteligencia artificial centrado en humanos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des flux d''utilisateurs interactifs et de mettre en œuvre des états de fonctionnalités d''intelligence artificielle avec transparence, en affichant des reçus pour chaque décision d''intelligence artificielle et en rendant les niveaux de confiance explicites, en exploitant les histoires Storybook et les normes de conception d''intelligence artificielle centrée sur l''humain.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, interaktive Benutzerflüsse zu entwerfen und KI-Funktionen mit Transparenz umzusetzen, indem sie Quittungen für jede KI-Entscheidung anzeigen und die Vertrauensniveaus explizit machen, indem sie Storybook-Geschichten und humanozentrierte KI-Designstandards nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar fluxos de usuário interativos e implementar estados de recursos de IA com transparência, mostrando recibos para cada decisão de IA e tornando os níveis de confiança explícitos, aproveitando histórias do Storybook e padrões de design de IA centrados no ser humano.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать интерактивные потоки пользователей и реализовывать состояния функций ИИ с прозрачностью, демонстрируя квитанции для каждого решения ИИ и делая уровни доверия явными, используя истории Storybook и стандарты проектирования ИИ, ориентированные на человека.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تصميم تدفقات المستخدم التفاعلية وتنفيذ حالات ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي مع الشفافية، مع عرض استلامات لكل quyếtية الذكاء الاصطناعي وجعل مستويات الثقة صريحة، واستخدام قصص Storybook ومعايير تصميم الذكاء الاصطناعي الموجهة إلى الإنسان."},"useCases":{"en":["Building Storybook stories with trust-based AI features","Creating new UI prototypes with explicit confidence levels","Implementing AI feature states with graceful failure handling","Designing interactive user flows with transparent AI decision-making"],"zh":["使用信任为基础的AI功能构建Storybook故事","创建具有明确信頼水平的新UI原型","使用优雅的故障处理实现AI功能状态","设计具有透明AI决策的交互式用户流程"],"ja":["信頼に基づいたAI機能を使用してStorybookのストーリーを構築する","明示的な信頼レベルを持つ新しいUIプロトタイプを作成する","優雅な障害処理を使用してAIの機能状態を実装する","透明なAIの決定を持つインタラクティブなユーザーフローを設計する"],"ko":["신뢰를 기반으로 하는 AI 기능을 사용하여 Storybook 이야기를 구축하는 것","명시적인 신뢰 수준을 갖춘 새로운 UI 프로토타입을 생성하는 것","우아한 실패 처리를 사용하여 AI 기능 상태를 구현하는 것","투명한 AI 결정과 함께 상호 작용 사용자 흐름을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Crear historias de Storybook con características de inteligencia artificial basadas en la confianza","Crear nuevos prototipos de interfaz de usuario con niveles de confianza explícitos","Implementar estados de características de inteligencia artificial con manejo de fallos elegante","Diseñar flujos de usuario interactivos con toma de decisiones de inteligencia artificial transparente"],"fr":["Créer des histoires Storybook avec des fonctionnalités d''intelligence artificielle basées sur la confiance","Créer de nouveaux prototypes d''interface utilisateur avec des niveaux de confiance explicites","Mettre en œuvre des états de fonctionnalités d''intelligence artificielle avec une gestion d''erreur élégante","Concevoir des flux d''utilisateurs interactifs avec une prise de décision d''intelligence artificielle transparente"],"de":["Erstellen von Storybook-Geschichten mit vertrauensbasierten KI-Funktionen","Erstellen neuer Benutzeroberflächen-Prototypen mit expliziten Vertrauensniveaus","Umsetzen von KI-Funktionen mit eleganter Fehlerbehandlung","Entwerfen interaktiver Benutzerflüsse mit transparenter KI-Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Construir histórias do Storybook com recursos de IA baseados na confiança","Criar novos protótipos de UI com níveis de confiança explícitos","Implementar estados de recursos de IA com tratamento de falhas elegante","Projetar fluxos de usuário interativos com tomada de decisões de IA transparente"],"ru":["Построение историй Storybook с функциями ИИ, основанными на доверии","Создание новых прототипов UI с явными уровнями доверия","Реализация состояний функций ИИ с элегантным обработкой ошибок","Проектирование интерактивных потоков пользователей с прозрачным принятием решений ИИ"],"ar":["بناء قصص Storybook مع ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي القائمة على الثقة","إنشاء نماذج واجهة المستخدم الجديدة مع مستويات الثقة الصريحة","تنفيذ حالات ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معالجة الفشل الراقية","تصميم تدفقات المستخدم التفاعلية مع اتخاذ القرارات الذكاء الاصطناعي الشفافة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Storybook integration","Human-centric AI design standards must be followed","Explicit confidence levels and receipts for AI decisions are mandatory"],"zh":["需要Storybook集成","必须遵循人类中心的AI设计标准","AI决策的明确信頼水平和收据是必需的"],"ja":["Storybookの統合が必要","人間中心のAI設計標準に従う必要がある","AIの決定の明示的な信頼レベルとレシートは必須"],"ko":["Storybook 통합이 필요합니다.","인간 중심의 AI 설계 표준을 따라야 합니다.","AI 결정의 명시적인 신뢰 수준과 영수증은 필수입니다."],"es":["Requiere integración con Storybook","Los estándares de diseño de inteligencia artificial centrado en humanos deben seguirse","Los niveles de confianza explícitos y los recibos para las decisiones de inteligencia artificial son obligatorios"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Storybook","Les normes de conception d''intelligence artificielle centrée sur l''humain doivent être suivies","Les niveaux de confiance explicites et les reçus pour les décisions d''intelligence artificielle sont obligatoires"],"de":["Benötigt Storybook-Integration","Die humanozentrierten KI-Designstandards müssen befolgt werden","Explizite Vertrauensniveaus und Quittungen für KI-Entscheidungen sind obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer integração com o Storybook","Os padrões de design de IA centrados no ser humano devem ser seguidos","Níveis de confiança explícitos e recibos para decisões de IA são obrigatórios"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с Storybook","Стандарты проектирования ИИ, ориентированные на человека, должны быть соблюдены","Явные уровни доверия и квитанции для решений ИИ являются обязательными"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع Storybook","يجب اتباع معايير تصميم الذكاء الاصطناعي الموجهة إلى الإنسان","مستويات الثقة الصريحة واستلامات القرارات الذكاء الاصطناعي هي إلزامية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a6b7e0faa72d50480134bdbd4446fe366f334686a19b08c1496359a9d89db102","qualityScore":46}');
