Icons","Verwendung von KI-Tools für die Erstellung von Icons","Benutzerdefiniertes Icon-Verzeichnis","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Icon-Formaten","Integration mit Entwicklungsframeworks wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Coleção de ícones prontos para uso","Fácil integração com projetos de design","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Atualizações regulares com novos ícones","Documentação detalhada para uso fácil"],"ru":["Коллекция готовых иконок для использования","Легкая интеграция с проектами дизайна","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Регулярные обновления с новыми иконками","Детальная документация для легкого использования"],"ar":["مجموعة من الأيقونات الجاهزة للاستخدام","التكامل السهل مع مشاريع التصميم","دعم صيغ الملفات المتعددة","التحديثات المنتظمة بالأيقونات الجديدة","توثيق مفصل للاستخدام السهل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用图标库","什么是图标库","图标库替代品","图标库与其他工具的比较","图标库安装","图标库设置指南","React图标库","Python图标库","Node.js图标库"],"ja":["アイコンライブラリを使用する方法","アイコンライブラリとは","アイコンライブラリの代替","アイコンライブラリと他のツールの比較","アイコンライブラリのインストール","アイコンライブラリの設定ガイド","Reactアイコンライブラリ","Pythonアイコンライブラリ","Node.jsアイコンライブラリ"],"ko":["아이콘 라이브러리를 사용하는 방법","아이콘 라이브러리란","아이콘 라이브러리 대체","아이콘 라이브러리와 다른 도구의 비교","아이콘 라이브러리 설치","아이콘 라이브러리 설정 가이드","React 아이콘 라이브러리","Python 아이콘 라이브러리","Node.js 아이콘 라이브러리"],"es":["herramientas de ia para iconos","biblioteca de iconos personalizada","creación de iconos con ia","iconos personalizados para react","guía de instalación de iconos","alternativas a font awesome","icomoon vs font awesome"],"fr":["outils d''ia pour icônes","catalogue d''icônes personnalisé","création d''icônes avec ia","icônes personnalisés pour react","guide d''installation d''icônes","alternatives à font awesome","icomoon vs font awesome"],"de":["ki-tools für icons","benutzerdefinierte icon-bibliothek","erstellung von icons mit ki","benutzerdefinierte icons für react","anleitung zur installation von icons","alternativen zu font awesome","icomoon vs font awesome"],"pt":["como usar biblioteca de ícones","o que é biblioteca de ícones","biblioteca de ícones alternativa","biblioteca de ícones vs font awesome","instalar biblioteca de ícones","guia de configuração da biblioteca de ícones"],"ru":["как использовать библиотеку иконок","что такое библиотека иконок","альтернативная библиотека иконок","библиотека иконок vs font awesome","установка библиотеки иконок","руководство по настройке библиотеки иконок"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مكتبة الأيقونات","ما هي مكتبة الأيقونات","بديل مكتبة الأيقونات","مكتبة الأيقونات مقابل فونت أوسم","تثبيت مكتبة الأيقونات","دليل إعداد مكتبة الأيقونات"]}},"owner":"cesaroeduardo","repo":"icon-library-visualization","repoPath":"cesaroeduardo/icon-library-visualization","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.145Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"icon-library","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Icon Library Skill\n\nProvides icons from the Azion Icon Library with context-aware output formats.\n\n## CRITICAL: Icon Font Availability\n\n### `ai-*` Azion Icons - ALWAYS USE SVG\n\nThe Azion icon font (`azionicons.woff2`) is **NOT loaded by default** in most contexts.\n\n**`<i class=\"ai ai-application\"></i>` will NOT render** unless the target project explicitly loads:\n- The `azionicons.woff2` font file\n- The CSS with `@font-face` and class definitions\n\n**For `ai-*` icons: ALWAYS provide inline SVG*","body":"# Icon Library Skill\n\nProvides icons from the Azion Icon Library with context-aware output formats.\n\n## CRITICAL: Icon Font Availability\n\n### `ai-*` Azion Icons - ALWAYS USE SVG\n\nThe Azion icon font (`azionicons.woff2`) is **NOT loaded by default** in most contexts.\n\n**`<i class=\"ai ai-application\"></i>` will NOT render** unless the target project explicitly loads:\n- The `azionicons.woff2` font file\n- The CSS with `@font-face` and class definitions\n\n**For `ai-*` icons: ALWAYS provide inline SVG** from `assets/svg/`.\n\n### `pi-*` PrimeIcons - Font classes usually work\n\nPrimeIcons are loaded automatically in projects using PrimeVue/PrimeReact.\n\n**`<i class=\"pi pi-home\"></i>` works** in most Vue/React projects with PrimeVue.\n\n## Icon Prefixes\n\n- **`ai-*`** - Azion-specific icons → **USE SVG** (font rarely available)\n- **`pi-*`** - PrimeIcons → Font class OK if PrimeVue is loaded, otherwise use SVG\n\n## Integration Approaches\n\n### 1. SVG Approach (Recommended - Always Works)\n\n**Use for:** ALL `ai-*` icons, and `pi-*` when unsure about font availability.\n\n- Read SVG from `assets/svg/{icon-name}.svg`\n- Copy/paste inline or reference as image\n- Works anywhere, no setup required\n- Supports multi-color icons\n\n### 2. Icon Font Approach (Limited Use)\n\n**Use ONLY for `pi-*` icons** in projects with PrimeVue/PrimeReact.\n\n**NEVER use `<i class=\"ai ai-*\">` unless you''ve verified the Azion font is loaded.**\n\n## Setting Up Azion Icon Font (Optional)\n\nIf you want `<i class=\"ai ai-*\">` to work in your project, you need:\n\n### Step 1: Copy font file\nCopy `azionicons.woff2` to your project''s assets folder.\n\n### Step 2: Create CSS file (`azionicons.css`)\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''azionicons'';\n  src: url(''./azionicons.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n.ai {\n  font-family: ''azionicons'';\n  speak: none;\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  font-variant: normal;\n  text-transform: none;\n  line-height: 1;\n  display: inline-block;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n}\n\n/* Icon class definitions */\n.ai.ai-application::before { content: ''\\ea08''; }\n.ai.ai-firewall::before { content: ''\\ea11''; }\n.ai.ai-functions::before { content: ''\\ea22''; }\n.ai.ai-storage::before { content: ''\\ea28''; }\n.ai.ai-sql::before { content: ''\\ea29''; }\n.ai.ai-kv::before { content: ''\\ea30''; }\n.ai.ai-orchestrator::before { content: ''\\ea31''; }\n.ai.ai-certificate-manager::before { content: ''\\ea24''; }\n.ai.ai-network-shield::before { content: ''\\ea25''; }\n/* See icons.scss for complete list */\n```\n\n### Step 3: Import CSS globally\n```js\n// In main.js, App.vue, or _app.tsx\nimport ''./assets/azionicons.css'';\n```\n\n### Step 4: Use icon classes\n```html\n<i class=\"ai ai-application\"></i>\n```\n\n**Note:** The complete `icons.scss` with all icon mappings is available in the icon-library-visualization repository.\n\n## Finding Icons\n\nSearch `references/icons-catalog.json` by keyword:\n```\ngrep -i \"security\\|firewall\" references/icons-catalog.json\n```\n\nEach icon has: `name`, `icon` (class), and `keywords`.\n\n## Output Formats by Context\n\n### 1. Website/App (HTML/Vue/React)\n\n**If project has icon font setup:**\n```html\n<i class=\"ai ai-application\"></i>\n```\n\n**If no icon font (use SVG - recommended):**\n```html\n<svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n  <path d=\"...\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg>\n```\n\nRead the SVG content from `assets/svg/{icon-name}.svg`.\n\n### 2. Content Marketing (Blog/Social/Email)\n\nAlways use inline SVG (no dependencies):\n```html\n<svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n  <path d=\"...\" fill=\"#F3652B\"/>\n</svg>\n```\n\nTo customize color, replace `fill` attribute value.\n\n### 3. Documentation (Markdown/MDX)\n\n**Markdown (image reference):**\n```markdown\n![Application Icon](./path/to/ai-application.svg)\n```\n\n**MDX (inline SVG):**\n```mdx\n<svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\">...</svg>\n```\n\n### 4. CMS/Struct Fields\n\nProvide just the icon name:\n```\nai-application\n```\n\n## Decision Logic\n\n| Icon Type | Context | Output |\n|-----------|---------|--------|\n| `ai-*` | ANY context | **Inline SVG** from `assets/svg/` |\n| `pi-*` | PrimeVue project | `<i class=\"pi pi-{name}\"></i>` |\n| `pi-*` | Other contexts | Inline SVG from `assets/svg/` |\n| Any | CMS/Struct field | Icon name only (e.g., `ai-firewall`) |\n| Any | Markdown docs | SVG image reference or inline |\n\n## Common Icons Quick Reference\n\n### Azion Products\n\n**Note:** Product names have been updated. Use the new names in content:\n\n| Icon Class | Product Name |\n|------------|-------------|\n| `ai-application` | Applications |\n| `ai-firewall` | Firewall |\n| `ai-functions` | Functions |\n| `ai-storage` | Object Storage |\n| `ai-sql` | SQL Database |\n| `ai-kv` | KV Store |\n| `ai-certificate-manager` | Certificate Manager |\n| `ai-orchestrator` | Orchestrator |\n| `ai-network-shield` | Network Shield |\n| `ai-waf-rules` | WAF Rules |\n\n### Frameworks\n- `ai-react` - React\n- `ai-vue` - Vue\n- `ai-nextjs` - Next.js\n- `ai-astro` - Astro\n- `ai-terraform` - Terraform\n\n### UI Elements (pi-*)\n- `pi-home` - Home\n- `pi-search` - Search\n- `pi-user` - User\n- `pi-cog` - Settings\n- `pi-check` - Check/Success\n- `pi-times` - Close/Error\n- `pi-plus` - Add\n- `pi-trash` - Delete\n\n## Retrieving SVG Content\n\nTo get the full SVG markup, read from `assets/svg/{icon-name}.svg`.\n\nExample workflow:\n1. User asks for \"firewall icon for blog post\"\n2. Search catalog: find `ai-firewall`\n3. Read `assets/svg/ai-firewall.svg`\n4. Return inline SVG with appropriate color\n\n## Naming Guidelines\n\n**Important:** Follow these naming conventions in all content:\n\n- Use **AI** (not IA) as the abbreviation for Artificial Intelligence\n- Use **distributed architecture** instead of \"at the edge\" or \"on the edge\"\n- Use the updated product names shown in the Azion Products table above\n\n### Product Name Mapping (Legacy → Current)\n\n| Legacy Name | Current Name |\n|-------------|-------------|\n| Edge Functions | Functions |\n| Edge Cache / Tiered Cache | Cache |\n| Network Layer Protection | Network Shield |\n| Edge SQL | SQL Database |\n| Edge KV | KV Store |\n| Edge Storage | Object Storage |\n| Edge Application | Applications |\n| Edge Orchestrator | Orchestrator |\n| Digital Certificates | Certificate Manager |\n| Edge Firewall | Firewall |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:44:43.678Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing context-aware icon output formats in SVG","zh":"非常适合需要上下文感知图标输出格式的SVG的UI专注代理","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントがコンテキスト感覚のアイコン出力形式をSVGで必要とする場合に最適","ko":"UI에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 SVG에서 컨텍스트 인식 아이コン 출력 형식을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan formatos de salida de iconos con conciencia de contexto en SVG","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant des formats de sortie d''icônes sensibles au contexte en SVG","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die kontextbewusste Icon-Ausgabformate in SVG benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que precisam de formatos de saída de ícones sensíveis ao contexto em SVG","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимы форматы вывода иконок, осведомленные о контексте, в SVG","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم وهم بحاجة إلى تنسيقات مخرجات الأيقونات التي تدرك السياق في SVG"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide icons from the Azion Icon Library with inline SVG output, ensuring compatibility across various contexts by bypassing the need for explicit font loading, utilizing @font-face and class definitions for seamless integration with protocols like HTML and CSS","zh":"赋予代理从Azion图标库提供图标的能力，具有内联SVG输出，确保在绕过显式字体加载的同时，通过@font-face和类定义与HTML和CSS等协议实现无缝集成","ja":"Azionアイコンライブラリからアイコンを提供するエージェントをエンパワーメントし、インラインSVG出力を使用して、明示的なフォントロードの必要性を回避し、@font-faceとクラス定義を使用してHTMLおよびCSSなどのプロトコルとシームレスに統合","ko":"에이전트가 Azion 아이콘 라이브러리에서 아이콘을 제공할 수 있도록 하고, 인라인 SVG 출력을 사용하여 명시적인 글꼴 로딩의 필요성을 피함으로써 HTML 및 CSS 등과 같은 프로토콜과 무.platform 통합을 위한 @font-face 및 클래스 정의를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar iconos de la Biblioteca de Iconos de Azion con salida SVG en línea, garantizando la compatibilidad en varios contextos al omitir la necesidad de carga de fuente explícita, utilizando @font-face y definiciones de clase para una integración sin problemas con protocolos como HTML y CSS","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des icônes de la Bibliothèque d''icônes Azion avec une sortie SVG en ligne, garantissant la compatibilité dans différents contextes en contournant la nécessité d''un chargement de police explicite, en utilisant @font-face et des définitions de classe pour une intégration transparente avec des protocoles tels que HTML et CSS","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Icons aus der Azion-Icon-Bibliothek mit Inline-SVG-Ausgabe bereitzustellen, wodurch die Kompatibilität in verschiedenen Kontexten durch Umgehung der Notwendigkeit einer expliziten Schriftladung sichergestellt wird, unter Verwendung von @font-face und Klassendefinitionen für eine nahtlose Integration mit Protokollen wie HTML und CSS","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer ícones da Biblioteca de Ícones Azion com saída SVG inline, garantindo compatibilidade em vários contextos, contornando a necessidade de carregamento explícito de fontes, utilizando @font-face e definições de classe para integração transparente com protocolos como HTML e CSS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять иконки из Библиотеки иконок Azion с выводом SVG встроенным, обеспечивая совместимость в различных контекстах, обходя необходимость явной загрузки шрифтов, используя @font-face и определения классов для бесшовной интеграции с протоколами, такими как HTML и CSS","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير الأيقونات من مكتبة أيقونات Azion مع مخرجات SVG متضمنة، مما يضمن التوافق عبر سياقات متعددة عن طريق تجاوز الحاجة إلى تحميل الخطوط явًا، واستخدام @font-face والتعريفات الدراسية لالتقاط متوافق مع بروتوكولات مثل HTML وCSS"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating icons for web applications using SVG","Providing context-aware icon outputs for UI design","Ensuring cross-context compatibility of Azion icons"],"zh":["使用SVG为Web应用程序生成图标","为UI设计提供上下文感知图标输出","确保Azion图标在不同上下文中的兼容性"],"ja":["SVGを使用してWebアプリケーションのアイコンを生成する","UIデザインのためのコンテキスト感覚アイコン出力を提供する","Azionアイコンのコンテキスト間の互換性を確保する"],"ko":["SVG를 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션의 아이콘을 생성","UI 디자인을 위한 컨텍스트 