ssues 대체품","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs 다른 도구"],"es":["cómo usar iikit-08-taskstoissues","qué es el kit de integridad de intención","iikit-08-taskstoissues alternativa","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs otros kits de AI","instalación de iikit-08-taskstoissues","guía de configuración de iikit-08-taskstoissues","desarrollo de software con iikit-08-taskstoissues"],"fr":["comment utiliser iikit-08-taskstoissues","quoi est le kit d''intégrité d''intention","iikit-08-taskstoissues alternative","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs autres kits d''IA","installation de iikit-08-taskstoissues","guide de configuration de iikit-08-taskstoissues","développement de logiciels avec iikit-08-taskstoissues"],"de":["wie man iikit-08-taskstoissues verwendet","was ist das Intent Integrity Kit","iikit-08-taskstoissues Alternative","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs andere AI-Kit","Installation von iikit-08-taskstoissues","Einrichtungsanleitung für iikit-08-taskstoissues","Softwareentwicklung mit iikit-08-taskstoissues"],"pt":["como usar iikit-08-taskstoissues","o que é iikit-08-taskstoissues","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento de software","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs outras ferramentas de IA","guia de instalação do iikit-08-taskstoissues","configuração do iikit-08-taskstoissues","exemplos de uso do iikit-08-taskstoissues"],"ru":["как использовать iikit-08-taskstoissues","что такое iikit-08-taskstoissues","инструменты ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","iikit-08-taskstoissues vs другие инструменты ИИ","руководство по установке iikit-08-taskstoissues","настройка iikit-08-taskstoissues","примеры использования iikit-08-taskstoissues"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام iikit-08-taskstoissues","ما هو iikit-08-taskstoissues","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","iikit-08-taskstoissues مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دليل تثبيت iikit-08-taskstoissues","إعدادات iikit-08-taskstoissues","أمثلة على استخدام iikit-08-taskstoissues"]}},"owner":"intent-integrity-chain","repo":"kit","repoPath":"intent-integrity-chain/kit","stars":14,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T00:08:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iikit-08-taskstoissues","description":">-","version":"1.6.4","bodyPreview":"# Intent Integrity Kit Tasks to Issues\n\nConvert existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues for project tracking.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\n1. Run prerequisites check:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/check-prerequisites.sh --phase 08 --json\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/","body":"# Intent Integrity Kit Tasks to Issues\n\nConvert existing tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues for project tracking.\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nYou **MUST** consider the user input before proceeding (if not empty).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\n1. Run prerequisites check:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/check-prerequisites.sh --phase 08 --json\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/check-prerequisites.ps1 -Phase 08 -Json`\n\n2. Parse JSON for `FEATURE_DIR` and `AVAILABLE_DOCS`. Extract path to **tasks.md**.\n3. If JSON contains `needs_selection: true`: present the `features` array as a numbered table (name and stage columns). Follow the options presentation pattern in [conversation-guide.md](../iikit-core/references/conversation-guide.md). After user selects, run:\n   ```bash\n   bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/set-active-feature.sh --json <selection>\n   ```\n   Windows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/set-active-feature.ps1 -Json <selection>`\n\n   Then re-run the prerequisites check from step 1.\n\n## GitHub Remote Validation\n\n```bash\ngit config --get remote.origin.url\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Only proceed if remote is a GitHub URL (`git@github.com:` or `https://github.com/`). Otherwise ERROR.\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### 1. Parse tasks.md\n\nExtract: Task IDs, descriptions, phase groupings, parallel markers [P], user story labels [USn], dependencies.\n\n### 2. Create GitHub Issues\n\n**Title format**: `[FeatureID/TaskID] [Story] Description` — feature-id extracted from `FEATURE_DIR` (e.g. `001-user-auth`).\n\n**Body**: use template from [issue-body-template.md](references/issue-body-template.md). **Labels** (create if needed): `iikit`, `phase-N`, `us-N`, `parallel`.\n\n### 3. Create Issues (parallel)\n\nUse the `Task` tool to dispatch issue creation in parallel — one subagent per chunk of tasks (split by phase or user story). Each subagent receives:\n- The chunk of tasks to create issues for\n- The feature-id, repo owner/name, and label set\n- Instructions to use `gh issue create` if available, otherwise `curl` the GitHub API\n\n```bash\n# Preferred:\ngh issue create --title \"[001-user-auth/T012] [US1] Create User model\" --body \"...\" --label \"iikit,phase-3,us-1\"\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Never create issues in repositories that don''t match the remote URL. Verify before dispatching.\n\nCollect all created issue numbers from subagents. Verify all returned successfully before proceeding. If some failed: report failures, continue with successful issues only.\n\n### 4. Link Dependencies\n\nAfter all issues exist, edit bodies to add cross-references using `#NNN` syntax. Skip dependency links for any issues that failed to create.\n\n## Report\n\nOutput: issues created (count + numbers), failures (count + details), link to repo issues list.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Condition | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Not a GitHub remote | STOP with error |\n| Issue creation fails | Report, continue with remaining issues |\n| Partial failure | Link dependencies for successful issues only |\n\n## Next Steps\n\nRun: `bash .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/bash/next-step.sh --phase 08 --json`\nWindows: `pwsh .tessl/tiles/tessl-labs/intent-integrity-kit/skills/iikit-core/scripts/powershell/next-step.ps1 -Phase 08 -Json`\n\nParse the JSON and present:\n1. `next_step` will be null (workflow complete)\n2. If `alt_steps` non-empty: list as alternatives\n3. Append dashboard link\n\nIf on a feature branch, offer to merge:\n- **A) Merge locally**: `git checkout main && git merge <branch>`\n- **B) Create PR**: `gh pr create`\n- **C) Skip**: user will handle it\n\nFormat:\n```\nIssues exported! Review in GitHub, assign team members, add to project boards.\n- Dashboard: file://$(pwd)/.specify/dashboard.html (resolve the path)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:34:00.335Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing to convert tasks into dependency-ordered GitHub issues for streamlined project tracking.","zh":"非常适合需要将任务转换为依赖排序的 GitHub 问题以实现流畅项目跟踪的项目管理代理。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントがタスクを依存関係順の GitHub の問題に変換してプロジェクトの追跡を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 관리 에이전트가 작업을 종속성 순서로 된 GitHub 문제로 변환하여 프로젝트 추적을 간소화하는 데 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan convertir tareas en problemas de GitHub ordenados por dependencia para un seguimiento de proyecto optimizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin de convertir des tâches en problèmes GitHub ordonnés par dépendance pour un suivi de projet rationalisé.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die Aufgaben in GitHub-Probleme mit Abhängigkeitsreihenfolge umwandeln müssen, um eine optimierte Projektverfolgung zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que precisam converter tarefas em problemas ordenados por dependência no GitHub para uma rastreabilidade de projetos otimizada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходимо преобразовывать задачи в проблемы, упорядоченные по зависимостям, в GitHub для оптимизированного отслеживания проектов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل المهام إلى مشاكل مرتبة بالاعتماد على GitHub لتعقب المشاريع المتدفق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate task-to-issue conversion using dependency ordering, facilitating efficient project management through GitHub issues and leveraging bash scripting for prerequisites checks.","zh":"赋予代理人使用依赖关系排序自动执行任务到问题的转换，促进通过 GitHub 问题和利用 bash 脚本进行先决条件检查来实现高效的项目管理。","ja":"エージェントが依存関係の順序付けを使用してタスクから問題への自動変換を実行できるようにし、GitHub の問題と bash スクリプトを使用した前提条件のチェックを活用して、効率的なプロジェクト管理を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 종속성 순서를 사용하여 작업에서 문제로의 자동 변환을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub 문제와 bash 스크립트를 사용한 사전 조건 확인을 활용하여 효율적인 프로젝트 관리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la conversión de tareas a problemas utilizando el orden de dependencia, lo que facilita una gestión de proyectos eficiente a través de los problemas de GitHub y aprovecha la scripting de bash para comprobaciones de requisitos previos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la conversion de tâches en problèmes en utilisant l''ordre de dépendance, ce qui facilite une gestion de projet efficace via les problèmes GitHub et utilise la scripting bash pour les vérifications de prérequis.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Umwandlung von Aufgaben in Probleme mithilfe der Abhängigkeitsreihenfolge zu automatisieren, wodurch eine effiziente Projektverwaltung durch GitHub-Probleme ermöglicht wird und die bash-Scripting für Vorabprüfungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a conversão de tarefas em problemas usando a ordenação de dependência, facilitando a gestão eficiente de projetos por meio de problemas do GitHub e aproveitando a scriptação bash para verificações de pré-requisitos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать преобразование задач в проблемы с помощью упорядочения по зависимостям, что облегчает эффективное управление проектами посредством проблем GitHub и использует скриптинг bash для проверки предварительных требований.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير تلقائي لتحويل المهام إلى مشاكل باستخدام الترتيب بالاعتماد، مما يسهل إدارة المشاريع بفعالية من خلال مشاكل GitHub واستخدام سكريبتات bash للتحقق من المتطلبات المسبقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting existing tasks into GitHub issues","Automating project tracking with dependency-ordered issues","Streamlining project management workflows using GitHub"],"zh":["将现有的任务转换为 GitHub 问题","使用依存关系排序的问题自动化项目跟踪","使用 GitHub 简化项目管理工作流"],"ja":["既存のタスクを GitHub の問題に変換する","依存関係順の問題を使用したプロジェクト追跡の自動化","GitHub を使用したプロジェクト管理ワークフローの簡素化"],"ko":["기존 작업을 GitHub 문제로 변환하는 것","종속성 순서로 된 문제를 사용한 프로젝트 추적 자동화","GitHub를 사용한 프로젝트 관리 워크플로우의 간소화"],"es":["Convertir tareas existentes en problemas de GitHub","Automatizar el seguimiento de proyectos con problemas ordenados por dependencia","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos con GitHub"],"fr":["Convertir des tâches existantes en problèmes GitHub","Automatiser le suivi de projet avec des problèmes ordonnés par dépendance","Rationaliser les flux de travail de gestion de projet avec GitHub"],"de":["Vorhandene Aufgaben in GitHub-Probleme umwandeln","Projektverfolgung mit abhängigkeitsgeordneten Problemen automatisieren","Projektmanagement-Workflows mit GitHub optimieren"],"pt":["Converter tarefas existentes em problemas do GitHub","Automatizar o rastreio de projetos com problemas ordenados por dependência","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos usando o GitHub"],"ru":["Преобразование существующих задач в проблемы GitHub","Автоматизация отслеживания проектов с проблемами, упорядоченными по зависимостям","Оптимизация рабочих процессов управления проектами с помощью GitHub"],"ar":["تحويل المهام الحالية إلى مشاكل على GitHub","توفير تلقائي لتعقب المشاريع بمشاكل مرتبة بالاعتماد","تحسين سير عمل إدارة المشاريع باستخدام GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub integration","Bash scripting environment needed","Windows requires pwsh"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 集成","需要 bash 脚本环境","Windows 需要 pwsh"],"ja":["GitHub 統合が必要","bash スクリプト環境が必要","Windows では pwsh が必要"],"ko":["GitHub 통합이 필요","bash 스크립트 환경이 필요","Windows에서는 pwsh가 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con GitHub","Se necesita un entorno de scripting de bash","Windows requiere pwsh"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec GitHub","Un environnement de scripting bash est nécessaire","Windows nécessite pwsh"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Integration","Bash-Scripting-Umgebung erforderlich","Windows benötigt pwsh"],"pt":["Requer integração com o GitHub","Ambiente de script bash necessário","Windows requer pwsh"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с GitHub","Необходима среда скриптинга bash","Windows требует pwsh"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع GitHub","بيئة سكريبت bash ضرورية","نظام التشغيل Windows يتطلب pwsh"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d4f01673ecb8012818d8c70ff6d9e92791a9004853d4e582d2fe7a88b5f696a","qualityScore":45}');
