utils personnalisés avec des agents IA, alimentés par la technologie Agentic AI","de":"Erstellen, verwalten und orchestrieren Sie benutzerdefinierte Tools mit KI-Agents, angetrieben von der Agentic-AI-Technologie","pt":"Crie ferramentas personalizadas e painéis com agentes de IA e o framework Agentic","ru":"Создайте настраиваемые инструменты и панели с ИИ Агентами и фреймворком Agentic","ar":"ابني أدوات مخصصة ولوحات تحكم مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي وإطار العمل Agentic","en":"Chat with AI agents to build, manage, and orchestrate custom tools, dashboards, and it''s all powered by cats."},"definition":{"en":"Chat with AI agents to build, manage, and orchestrate custom tools, dashboards, and it''s all powered by cats."},"features":{"zh":["AI代理技术支持","定制工具构建","仪表盘管理","Agentic Framework集成","OpenRouter支持"],"ja":["AIエージェント技術対応","カスタムツール構築","ダッシュボード管理","Agentic Framework統合","OpenRouter対応"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술 지원","맞춤형 도구 구축","대시보드 관리","Agentic Framework 통합","OpenRouter 지원"],"es":["Construcción de herramientas personalizadas","Gestión de dashboards","Orquestación de tareas","Integración con Agentic Framework","Compatibilidad con OpenRouter"],"fr":["Construire des outils personnalisés","Gestion de tableaux de bord","Orchestration de tâches","Intégration avec Agentic Framework","Compatibilité avec OpenRouter"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Tools","Verwaltung von Dashboards","Orchestrierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit Agentic Framework","Kompatibilität mit OpenRouter"],"pt":["Criação de ferramentas personalizadas","Gerenciamento de painéis","Orquestração de tarefas","Integração com o framework Agentic","Suporte a React e Node.js","CLI para execução de comandos"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых инструментов","Управление панелями","Оркестровка задач","Интеграция с фреймворком Agentic","Поддержка React и Node.js","CLI для выполнения команд"],"ar":["إنشاء أدوات مخصصة","إدارة لوحات التحكم","أوركستراسیون المهام","التكامل مع إطار العمل Agentic","دعم React و Node.js","CLI لتنفيذ الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理技术","定制工具构建","仪表盘管理","Agentic Framework","OpenRouter","如何使用AI代理","AI代理工具比较","AI代理安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント技術","カスタムツール構築","ダッシュボード管理","Agentic Framework","OpenRouter","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントツール比較","AIエージェントインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술","맞춤형 도구 구축","대시보드 관리","Agentic Framework","OpenRouter","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 도구 비교","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","Agentic AI alternativa","Agentic AI vs competidores","instalación de Agentic AI","guía de configuración de Agentic AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","quoi est un agent IA","Agentic AI alternative","Agentic AI vs concurrents","installation d''Agentic AI","guide de configuration d''Agentic AI"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Agentic AI Alternative","Agentic AI vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Agentic AI","Konfigurationsanleitung für Agentic AI"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","ferramentas de agente de ia","agentic framework alternative","agentic vs openrouter","instalar agentic","guia de configuração do agentic"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","инструменты ИИ Агента","альтернатива фреймворка Agentic","Agentic vs OpenRouter","установить Agentic","руководство по настройке Agentic"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل إطار العمل Agentic","Agentic vs OpenRouter","تثبيت Agentic","دليل إعداد Agentic"]}},"owner":"WynterJones","repo":"OpenPaw","repoPath":"WynterJones/OpenPaw","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T09:41:26Z","topics":["agentic-ai","agentic-framework","openrouter"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"production","description":"Production readiness check from UX perspective - update BROWNFIELD.md with implemented features, check GREENFIELD alignment, note documentation impacts. Use when user says go to production, production check, ready to ship, pre-release check, or wants to verify implementation status before deployment.","bodyPreview":"# Production Skill\n\nProduction readiness check focusing on implementation status and strategy alignment.\n\n## When to Use\n- Before production deployment\n- Feature completion verification\n- Strategy alignment check\n- Documentation impact assessment\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Update BROWNFIELD.md\nScan codebase and update `_OFFICE/BROWNFIELD.md`:\n\n1. Identify implemented features:\n   - Check routes and pages\n   - Find feature directories\n   - Look for user-facing components\n\n2. Compare against last p","body":"# Production Skill\n\nProduction readiness check focusing on implementation status and strategy alignment.\n\n## When to Use\n- Before production deployment\n- Feature completion verification\n- Strategy alignment check\n- Documentation impact assessment\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Update BROWNFIELD.md\nScan codebase and update `_OFFICE/BROWNFIELD.md`:\n\n1. Identify implemented features:\n   - Check routes and pages\n   - Find feature directories\n   - Look for user-facing components\n\n2. Compare against last production snapshot\n\n3. Document changes:\n   - **Added:** New features since last production\n   - **Removed:** Features that were removed\n   - **Modified:** Significant changes\n\n4. Update Production History table\n\n### Step 2: Check Documentation Impacts\nScan changes against documentation:\n\n**USER_GUIDE.md:**\n- List features needing documentation updates\n- Identify new features without docs\n\n**ONBOARDING.md:**\n- Check if onboarding elements need updates\n- Identify new flows without guidance\n\n### Step 3: Check GREENFIELD Alignment\nCompare vision against implementation:\n\n1. Read `_OFFICE/GREENFIELD.md` (vision)\n2. Read `_OFFICE/BROWNFIELD.md` (reality)\n3. Assess alignment: High / Medium / Low\n4. Ask user about any perceived misalignment\n5. Document strategy changes if needed\n\n### Step 4: Generate Readiness Report\n\n```\n## Production Readiness: Implementation Check\n\n### BROWNFIELD Status\n- Last Updated: YYYY-MM-DD\n- New Features: X added\n- Removed Features: X removed\n- Modified Features: X changed\n\n### Documentation Impact\n- USER_GUIDE.md needs updates: [list or \"None\"]\n- ONBOARDING.md needs updates: [list or \"None\"]\n\n### Strategy Alignment\n- GREENFIELD vision: [summary]\n- BROWNFIELD reality: [summary]\n- Alignment: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Recommendation\n[Ready for production / Needs attention: ...]\n```\n\n### Step 5: Confirm with User\nAsk: \"Production check complete. Ready to proceed with deployment?\"\nWait for explicit confirmation.\n\n## Important\nThis skill checks implementation status. Use `/push` for code quality gates and pushing to remote.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:41:07.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Deployment Agents requiring thorough production readiness checks and strategy alignment","zh":"适用于需要彻底生产就绪检查和策略对齐的部署代理","ja":"デプロイエージェントが徹底的なプロダクション_READYチェックと戦略の整合を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"생산 준비 완료 확인 및 전략 정렬이 필요한 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de implementación que requieren controles exhaustivos de preparación para producción y alineación de estrategia","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de déploiement nécessitant des vérifications approfondies de préparation pour la production et une alignement de stratégie","de":"Ideal für Deployment-Agents, die gründliche Produktionsbereitschaftschecks und Strategieausrichtung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Implantação que exigem verificações de prontidão para produção aprofundadas e alinhamento de estratégia","ru":"Идеально для агентов развертывания, требующих тщательных проверок готовности к производству и согласования стратегии","ar":"مثالي لعميل التوزيع الذين يتطلبون اختبارات جاهزية الإنتاج الشاملة وتنسق الاستراتيجية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify feature completion, assess documentation impact, and ensure implementation status using BROWNFIELD.md updates, route checks, and feature directory scans","zh":"赋予代理验证功能完成情况、评估文档影响并确保实现状态，使用BROWNFIELD.md更新、路由检查和功能目录扫描","ja":"機能の完了状況を検証し、ドキュメントの影響を評価し、実装状況を確認するために、BROWNFIELD.mdの更新、ルートチェック、機能ディレクトリのスキャンを使用してエージェントに権限を付与する","ko":"BROWNFIELD.md 업데이트를 사용하여 기능 구현 완료를 검증하고 문서 영향 평가 및 구현 상태 확인을 위해 에이전트를 사용할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para verificar la finalización de características, evaluar el impacto de la documentación y garantizar el estado de implementación utilizando actualizaciones de BROWNFIELD.md, controles de ruta y análisis de directorios de características","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier l''achèvement des fonctionnalités, d''évaluer l''impact de la documentation et de garantir le statut d''implémentation à l''aide de mises à jour BROWNFIELD.md, de contrôles de route et d''analyses de répertoires de fonctionnalités","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Vollständigkeit von Funktionen zu überprüfen, die Auswirkungen der Dokumentation zu bewerten und den Implementierungsstatus unter Verwendung von BROWNFIELD.md-Updates, Routenprüfungen und Funktionsverzeichnisscans sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar a conclusão de recursos, avaliar o impacto da documentação e garantir o status de implementação usando atualizações do BROWNFIELD.md, verificações de rota e varreduras de diretório de recursos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить завершение функций, оценить влияние документации и обеспечить статус реализации с помощью обновлений BROWNFIELD.md, проверок маршрутов и сканирования каталога функций","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من اكمال الميزة وتقييم تأثير الوثائق وضمان حالة التنفيذ باستخدام تحديثات BROWNFIELD.md وفحص المسار ومسح دليل الميزة"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating feature implementation before production deployment","Performing strategy alignment checks for custom tools and dashboards","Assessing documentation impact for production-ready codebases"],"zh":["生产环境部署前验证功能实现","对于自定义工具和仪表盘执行策略对齐检查","评估生产就绪代码库的文档影响"],"ja":["生产環境へのデプロイ前に機能の実装を検証する","カスタムツールとダッシュボードの戦略的整合性をチェックする","生産可能なコードベースのドキュメントの影響を評価する"],"ko":["생산 환경 배포 전 기능 구현을 검증합니다","사용자 지정 도구 및 대시보드에 대한 전략 정렬 확인을 수행합니다","생산 준비 완료 코드베이스에 대한 문서 影響을 평가합니다"],"es":["Validar la implementación de características antes de la implementación de producción","Realizar controles de alineación de estrategia para herramientas y paneles personalizados","Evaluar el impacto de la documentación para código bases listos para producción"],"fr":["Valider l''implémentation des fonctionnalités avant le déploiement en production","Effectuer des contrôles d''alignement de stratégie pour les outils et les tableaux de bord personnalisés","Évaluer l''impact de la documentation pour les bases de code prêtes pour la production"],"de":["Die Implementierung von Funktionen vor der Produktionsbereitstellung überprüfen","Strategieausrichtungschecks für benutzerdefinierte Tools und Dashboards durchführen","Die Auswirkungen der Dokumentation für produktionsbereite Codebases bewerten"],"pt":["Validar a implementação de recursos antes da implantação em produção","Realizar verificações de alinhamento de estratégia para ferramentas e painéis personalizados","Avaliar o impacto da documentação para código-fonte pronto para produção"],"ru":["Проверить реализацию функций перед развертыванием в производстве","Выполнить проверки согласования стратегии для пользовательских инструментов и панелей","Оценить влияние документации на код, готовый к производству"],"ar":["التحقق من تنفيذ الميزة قبل التوزيع في الإنتاج","إجراء فحص تنسق استراتيجي للأدوات واللوحات المخصصة","تقييم تأثير الوثائق على код جاهز للإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase and BROWNFIELD.md file","Limited to pre-production deployment phase"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和BROWNFIELD.md文件","仅限于预生产部署阶段"],"ja":["コードベースとBROWNFIELD.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","事前生産デプロイ段階のみに限定されます"],"ko":["코드베이스 및 BROWNFIELD.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","사전 생산 배포 단계에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base y al archivo BROWNFIELD.md","Limitado a la fase de implementación previa a la producción"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au code base et au fichier BROWNFIELD.md","Limité à la phase de déploiement préalable à la production"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Codebase und die BROWNFIELD.md-Datei","Begrenzt auf die Vorproduktions-Implementierungsphase"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao código-fonte e ao arquivo BROWNFIELD.md","Limitado à fase de implantação pré-produção"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду и файлу BROWNFIELD.md","Ограничен фазой развертывания до производства"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الشفرة المصدرية وملف BROWNFIELD.md","محدود بالمرحلة السابقة للتوزيع في الإنتاج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8ab7d742dc765faca4b395f046ebf0b6c52167a0bc26aeaa7bdec571225d3775","qualityScore":45}');
