nu bar utility."},"features":{"zh":["自动降低背景音量","轻量级macOS菜单栏工具","使用Swift和SwiftUI编写","开源且免费","支持麦克风自动ducking"],"ja":["マイクが有効になっている場合、自動でバックグラウンドオーディオをダック","軽量のmacOSメニューバー ユーティリティ","SwiftおよびSwiftUIで書かれており","オープンソースおよび無料","マイク自動ダック対応"],"ko":["마이크 활성화 시 자동 백그라운드 오디오 덕킹","경량 macOS 메뉴 바 유틸리티","스위프트와 스위프트UI로 작성","오픈소스이며 무료","마이크 자동 덕킹 지원"],"es":["Control de volumen automático","Compatibilidad con macOS","Código abierto en Swift y SwiftUI","Interfaz de menú minimalista","Funciona con micrófonos activos"],"fr":["Gestion de volume automatique","Compatibilité avec macOS","Code open source en Swift et SwiftUI","Interface de menu minimaliste","Fonctionne avec les microphones actifs"],"de":["Automatische Lautstärkeregelung","Kompatibilität mit macOS","Open-Source-Code in Swift und SwiftUI","Minimalistische Menüoberfläche","Funktioniert mit aktivierten Mikrofonen"],"pt":["Controle automático de volume de áudio em segundo plano","Desenvolvida em Swift e open-source","Compatível com macOS","Interface de usuário simples e intuitiva","Redução de volume quando o microfone está ativo"],"ru":["Автоматическое регулирование громкости фонового аудио","Написана на Swift и имеет открытый исходный код","Компатибельна с macOS","Простой и интуитивный интерфейс пользователя","Снижение громкости при активации микрофона"],"ar":["التحكم التلقائي في مستوى الصوت في الخلفية","تم تصميمها باستخدام Swift ومفتوحة المصدر","متوافقة مع macOS","واجهة مستخدم بسيطة وسهلة الاستخدام","تقليل مستوى الصوت عند تفعيل الميكروفون"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用release","什么是自动降低背景音量","release替代工具","release vs 其他工具","release安装教程","release设置指南","macOS菜单栏工具","Swift开发","SwiftUI开发"],"ja":["releaseの使い方","バックグラウンドオーディオの自動ダックとは","releaseの代替ツール","release vs 他のツール","releaseのインストール方法","releaseの設定ガイド","macOSメニューバー ユーティリティ","Swift開発","SwiftUI開発"],"ko":["릴리즈 사용법","자동 백그라운드 오디오 덕킹이란","릴리즈 대체 툴","릴리즈 vs 다른 툴","릴리즈 설치 가이드","릴리즈 설정 설명서","macOS 메뉴 바 유틸리티","스위프트 개발","스위프트UI 개발"],"es":["herramientas de AI","control de volumen automático","cómo usar Release","alternativas a Release","Release vs otros herramientas de menú","instalación de Release","guía de configuración de Release"],"fr":["outils IA","gestion de volume automatique","comment utiliser Release","alternatives à Release","Release vs autres outils de menu","installation de Release","guide de configuration de Release"],"de":["KI-Tools","automatische Lautstärkeregelung","wie man Release verwendet","Alternativen zu Release","Release im Vergleich zu anderen Menü-Tools","Installation von Release","Konfigurationsanleitung für Release"],"pt":["como usar release","o que é release","ferramentas de IA para macOS","release vs outros controles de volume","guia de instalação do release","release open-source","controle de volume automático","desenvolvimento em Swift"],"ru":["как использовать release","что такое release","ИИ Агенты для macOS","release vs другие утилиты контроля громкости","руководство по установке release","release с открытым исходным кодом","автоматическое регулирование громкости","разработка на Swift"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الإصدار","ما هي أداة الإصدار","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لشريط القوائم في macOS","أداة الإصدار مقابل أدوات تحكم في الصوت الأخرى","دليل تثبيت أداة الإصدار","أداة الإصدار مفتوحة المصدر","التحكم التلقائي في مستوى الصوت","التطوير باستخدام Swift"]}},"owner":"kalepail","repo":"wispr-duck","repoPath":"kalepail/wispr-duck","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-03T07:51:18Z","topics":["audio","core-audio","ducking","macos","macos-app","menu-bar","microphone","open-source","swift","swiftui","volume-control","wispr-flow"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release","description":"Build a signed, notarized macOS .app and publish a GitHub release. Use when cutting a new version of WisprDuck.","bodyPreview":"# Release WisprDuck\n\nBuild a signed, notarized, and stapled `.app`, then publish it as a GitHub release.\n\n**Target version:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Pre-flight\n\n1. Confirm the working tree is clean (`git status`). Abort if there are uncommitted changes.\n2. Check whether `$ARGUMENTS` already has a git tag or GitHub release.\n   - If it **does not exist**, proceed normally.\n   - If it **already exists** and the user explicitly asked to overwrite/re-release, run the re-release cleanup before continuing:","body":"# Release WisprDuck\n\nBuild a signed, notarized, and stapled `.app`, then publish it as a GitHub release.\n\n**Target version:** $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Pre-flight\n\n1. Confirm the working tree is clean (`git status`). Abort if there are uncommitted changes.\n2. Check whether `$ARGUMENTS` already has a git tag or GitHub release.\n   - If it **does not exist**, proceed normally.\n   - If it **already exists** and the user explicitly asked to overwrite/re-release, run the re-release cleanup before continuing:\n     ```bash\n     gh release delete v$ARGUMENTS --repo kalepail/wispr-duck --yes --cleanup-tag\n     git tag -d v$ARGUMENTS 2>/dev/null || true\n     ```\n   - If it already exists and the user did **not** ask to overwrite, abort and ask for confirmation.\n3. If not on `main`, merge the current branch into `main` and switch to it:\n   ```\n   git checkout main\n   git merge <branch> --no-edit\n   ```\n\n## Step 1 — Bump version numbers\n\nUpdate **all** of the following to `$ARGUMENTS`:\n\n| File | Field | Format |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| `WisprDuck.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj` | `MARKETING_VERSION` (both Debug and Release) | Short: `1.4` (no patch) |\n| `site/index.html` | `\"softwareVersion\"` in the Schema.org JSON-LD | Semver: `1.4.0` |\n| `site/package.json` | `\"version\"` | Semver: `1.4.0` |\n\n`MARKETING_VERSION` uses Xcode''s short version format (e.g., `1.4` not `1.4.0`). The other files use full semver.\n\nDo **not** touch `CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION` (build number) — leave it as-is.\n\nAfter updating, verify with `grep` that no stale version strings remain in those files.\n\n## Step 2 — Commit and push\n\n```\ngit add WisprDuck.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj site/index.html site/package.json\ngit commit -m \"Bump version to $ARGUMENTS\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Step 3 — Archive\n\nRun as a **single line** (multiline backslash escaping can break in some shell environments):\n\n```bash\nxcodebuild archive -project WisprDuck.xcodeproj -scheme WisprDuck -configuration Release -archivePath /tmp/WisprDuck.xcarchive \"CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY=Developer ID Application: Tiny Anvil, LLC (T4GBHCYB7P)\" DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=T4GBHCYB7P CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual\n```\n\nNote: `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY` must be quoted because the value contains spaces and a comma.\n\nConfirm output ends with `** ARCHIVE SUCCEEDED **`.\n\n## Step 4 — Export\n\nWrite this ExportOptions.plist to /tmp:\n\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n  <key>method</key>\n  <string>developer-id</string>\n  <key>teamID</key>\n  <string>T4GBHCYB7P</string>\n  <key>signingStyle</key>\n  <string>manual</string>\n  <key>signingCertificate</key>\n  <string>Developer ID Application</string>\n</dict>\n</plist>\n```\n\nThen export:\n\n```bash\nxcodebuild -exportArchive -archivePath /tmp/WisprDuck.xcarchive -exportPath /tmp/WisprDuckExport -exportOptionsPlist /tmp/ExportOptions.plist\n```\n\nConfirm `** EXPORT SUCCEEDED **`.\n\n## Step 5 — Verify signing\n\n```bash\ncodesign -dv --verbose=2 /tmp/WisprDuckExport/WisprDuck.app\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- `Authority=Developer ID Application: Tiny Anvil, LLC (T4GBHCYB7P)`\n- `flags=0x10000(runtime)` (hardened runtime)\n\nIf signing is wrong, stop and diagnose.\n\n## Step 6 — Notarize\n\n```bash\nditto -c -k --keepParent /tmp/WisprDuckExport/WisprDuck.app /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip\n\nxcrun notarytool submit /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip --keychain-profile \"WisprDuck-Notarize\" --wait\n```\n\nIf the keychain profile is missing, ask the user to run:\n\n```\nxcrun notarytool store-credentials \"WisprDuck-Notarize\" --key ~/Desktop/wispr-duck-certs/AuthKey_4MM3YQXN45.p8 --key-id 4MM3YQXN45 --issuer 69a6de83-bf58-47e3-e053-5b8c7c11a4d1\n```\n\nThen retry. Confirm status is `Accepted`.\n\n## Step 7 — Staple\n\n```bash\nxcrun stapler staple /tmp/WisprDuckExport/WisprDuck.app\nxcrun stapler validate /tmp/WisprDuckExport/WisprDuck.app\n```\n\nConfirm `The staple and validate action worked!`.\n\nRe-create the zip with the stapled app:\n\n```bash\nrm /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip\nditto -c -k --keepParent /tmp/WisprDuckExport/WisprDuck.app /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip\n```\n\n## Step 8 — Draft release notes and create GitHub release\n\n**Do not use `--generate-notes`** — it only produces a bare changelog link with no useful content.\n\nInstead, draft proper release notes:\n\n1. Run `git log <previous-tag>..HEAD --oneline` to review all commits since the last release.\n2. Read the previous release''s notes (`gh release view <previous-tag> --repo kalepail/wispr-duck`) to match the established tone and format.\n3. Write a release body. **Scale the detail to the release size:**\n\n**Patch releases (x.y.Z)** — just categorized bullets, no intro paragraph:\n\n```markdown\n### <Category>\n\n- **Bold summary** — detail of each meaningful change.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kalepail/wispr-duck/compare/<previous-tag>...v$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n**Minor/major releases (x.Y.0 / X.0.0)** — intro paragraph + categorized bullets:\n\n```markdown\n## What''s New in v$ARGUMENTS\n\n<1-2 sentence summary of the theme of this release.>\n\n### <Category> (e.g. Bug Fixes, UI, Audio, Internal)\n\n- **Bold summary** — detail of each meaningful change.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kalepail/wispr-duck/compare/<previous-tag>...v$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n**Do not repeat boilerplate every release.** Installation instructions, system requirements, and signing info belong in the README and on wisprduck.com — not in release notes. Only mention these if something about them *changes* (e.g., certificate rotation, new OS requirement, changed install steps).\n\n4. Create the release, passing the body via a HEREDOC:\n\n```bash\ngh release create v$ARGUMENTS /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip --repo kalepail/wispr-duck --title \"WisprDuck v$ARGUMENTS\" --notes \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n<drafted release notes here>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nPrint the release URL when done.\n\n## Step 9 — Clean up\n\n```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/WisprDuck.xcarchive /tmp/WisprDuckExport /tmp/ExportOptions.plist /tmp/WisprDuck-$ARGUMENTS.zip\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Problem | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| `No Keychain password item found for profile: notarytool` | Re-run the `store-credentials` command from Step 6 |\n| `Developer ID Application` identity not found | Open Keychain Access and verify the cert is in the login keychain. Import from `~/Desktop/wispr-duck-certs/` if needed. |\n| Notarization status `Invalid` | Run `xcrun notarytool log <submission-id> --keychain-profile \"WisprDuck-Notarize\"` and fix the reported issues |\n| `ARCHIVE FAILED` with signing errors | Ensure `CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual` and the full identity string matches `security find-identity -v -p codesigning` output |\n| `Unknown build action ''''` from xcodebuild | Multiline backslash escaping broke — use single-line commands instead |\n| `No App Category is set` warning during archive | Non-blocking. Can be fixed by adding `LSApplicationCategoryType` to Info.plist if desired. |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:26:39.935Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Deployment Agents needing automated GitHub release management with signed, notarized, and stapled .app files.","zh":"适合需要自动化 GitHub 发布管理的 Deployment Agents，支持签名、公证和打包的 .app 文件。","ja":"自動化されたGitHubリリース管理が必要なDeployment Agentに適しています。署名、公証、スタッピングされた.appファイルをサポートしています。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 릴리스 관리가 필요한 Deployment Agent 에 적합합니다. 서명, 공증 및 스테이플링된 .app 파일을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación que necesitan una gestión de versiones de GitHub automatizada con archivos .app firmados, notarios y etiquetados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement ayant besoin d''une gestion de version GitHub automatisée avec des fichiers .app signés, notariés et étiquetés.","de":"Perfekt für Deployment-Agents, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Release-Verwaltung mit signierten, notarierten und gestapelten .app-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação que necessitam de gerenciamento de lançamento automatizado do GitHub com arquivos .app assinados, notarizados e grampeados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания, которым требуется автоматизированное управление выпусками GitHub с подписанными, нотариальными и прикрепленными файлами .app.","ar":"متوافق تمامًا مع وكلاء النشر الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة إصدار GitHub آلي مع ملفات .app موقعة وموثقة ومرفقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish macOS menu bar utilities as GitHub releases, leveraging git tags and handling re-releases with cleanup, all while ensuring a clean working tree and confirming target version existence.","zh":"赋予代理程序将macOS菜单栏实用程序发布为GitHub发布的能力，利用git标签处理重新发布并清理，同时确保工作树清洁并确认目标版本存在。","ja":"エージェントに、macOSメニューバーアプリケーションをGitHubリリースとして公開する機能を提供します。gitタグを利用して再公開を処理し、クリーンアップを行いながら、クリーンな作業ツリーを確保し、ターゲットバージョンの存在を確認します。","ko":"에이전트에게 macOS 메뉴바 유틸리티를 GitHub 릴리스로 발행하는 기능을 부여합니다. git 태그를 활용하여 재 릴리스를 처리하고 클린업을 수행하면서 깨끗한 작업 트리를 보장하고 대상 버전의 존재를 확인합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes publicar utilidades de la barra de menú de macOS como versiones de GitHub, aprovechando las etiquetas git y manejo de nuevas versiones con limpieza, todo mientras se garantiza un árbol de trabajo limpio y se confirma la existencia de la versión de destino.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier des utilitaires de barre de menu macOS en tant que versions GitHub, en exploitant les étiquettes git et en gérant les rééditions avec nettoyage, le tout en garantissant un arbre de travail propre et en confirmant l''existence de la version cible.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, macOS-Menü-Leisten-Utilities als GitHub-Veröffentlichungen zu veröffentlichen, indem sie git-Tags nutzen und Wiederholungsveröffentlichungen mit Bereinigung durchführen, während sie gleichzeitig einen sauberen Arbeitsbaum sicherstellen und das Vorhandensein der Zielversion bestätigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar utilitários da barra de menu do macOS como lançamentos do GitHub, aproveitando as tags git e lidando com relançamentos com limpeza, garantindo uma árvore de trabalho limpa e confirmar a existência da versão alvo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать утилиты панели меню macOS в качестве выпусков GitHub, используя теги git и обрабатывая повторные выпуски с очисткой, обеспечивая чистое рабочее дерево и подтверждая существование целевой версии.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من نشر أدوات شريط قوائم macOS كإصدارات GitHub، مستفيدة من علامات git ومعالجة إعادة الإصدارات مع التنظيف، مع ضمان شجرة عمل نظيفة وتأكيد وجود الإصدار المستهدف."},"useCases":{"en":["Publishing WisprDuck releases","Automating .app packaging and notarization","Managing GitHub releases with versioning"],"zh":["发布WisprDuck版本","自动化.app包装和公证","使用版本控制管理GitHub发布"],"ja":["WisprDuckのリリースを公開する",".appのパッケージ化と公証を自動化する","バージョニングを使用したGitHubリリースの管理"],"ko":["WisprDuck 버전 릴리스",".app 패키징 및 공증 자동화","버전 관리를 통한 GitHub 릴리스 관리"],"es":["Publicación de versiones de WisprDuck","Automatización del empaquetado y notarización de .app","Gestión de versiones de GitHub con control de versiones"],"fr":["Publication de versions WisprDuck","Automatisation de l''emballage et de la notarisation de .app","Gestion des versions GitHub avec gestion de version"],"de":["Veröffentlichung von WisprDuck-Versionen","Automatisierung der Verpackung und Notarisierung von .app","Verwaltung von GitHub-Veröffentlichungen mit Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Publicação de lançamentos do WisprDuck","Automatização do empacotamento e notarização do .app","Gerenciamento de lançamentos do GitHub com controle de versão"],"ru":["Публикация выпусков WisprDuck","Автоматизация упаковки и нотариального заверения .app","Управление выпусками GitHub с контролем версий"],"ar":["نشر إصدارات WisprDuck","تأتميم حزمة وتوثيق .app","إدارة إصدارات GitHub مع التحكم في الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS environment","GitHub access needed","Clean working tree required"],"zh":["需要macOS环境","需要GitHub访问权限","需要清洁的工作树"],"ja":["macOS環境が必要","GitHubへのアクセスが必要","クリーンな作業ツリーが必要"],"ko":["macOS 환경이 필요함","GitHub 접근 권한이 필요함","깨끗한 작업 트리가 필요함"],"es":["Se requiere entorno de macOS","Se necesita acceso a GitHub","Se requiere un árbol de trabajo limpio"],"fr":["Environnement macOS requis","Accès à GitHub nécessaire","Arbre de travail propre requis"],"de":["macOS-Umgebung erforderlich","GitHub-Zugang erforderlich","Saubere Arbeitsumgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente macOS","Acesso ao GitHub necessário","Árvore de trabalho limpa necessária"],"ru":["Требуется среда macOS","Необходим доступ к GitHub","Требуется чистое рабочее дерево"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة macOS","مطلوب الوصول إلى GitHub","مطلوب شجرة عمل نظيفة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2fc0ff0fd50993641e8aaa5e388872c34d7dec34fa8685be09dc0642ed252709","qualityScore":45}');
