d Experimente","Ideal für Entwickler und Data-Scientist","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Experimente com agentes de IA","Chamadas de ferramentas personalizadas","Avaliações e testes de desempenho","Integração com CLI","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA"],"ru":["Экспериментирование с ИИ агентами","Пользовательские вызовы инструментов","Оценки и тесты производительности","Интеграция с CLI","Разработка приложений ИИ"],"ar":["التجربة مع الوكلاء الذكية","استدعاء أدوات مخصصة","التقييمات واختبارات الأداء","التكامل مع CLI","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用docs-sync","什么是LLM代理","docs-sync替代品","docs-sync vs 其他工具","docs-sync安装","docs-sync设置指南","AI智能代理工具","LLM代理实验"],"ja":["docs-syncの使い方","LLMエージェントとは","docs-syncの代替","docs-sync vs 他のツール","docs-syncのインストール","docs-syncの設定ガイド","AIエージェントのツール","LLMエージェントの実験"],"ko":["docs-sync 사용법","LLM 에이전트란","docs-sync 대체","docs-sync vs 다른 도구","docs-sync 설치","docs-sync 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","LLM 에이전트 실험"],"es":["cómo usar docs-sync","qué es un agente LLM","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","docs-sync vs otros sandbox de CLI","instalación de docs-sync","guía de configuración de docs-sync","experimentos con agentes de aprendizaje automático","desarrollo de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser docs-sync","qu''est-ce qu''un agent LLM","outils IA pour les développeurs","docs-sync vs autres bac à sable CLI","installation de docs-sync","guide de configuration de docs-sync","expériences avec des agents d''apprentissage automatique","développement d''outils IA"],"de":["wie man docs-sync verwendet","was ist ein LLM-Agent","AI-Tools für Entwickler","docs-sync vs andere CLI-Sandbox","installation von docs-sync","konfigurationsanleitung für docs-sync","experimente mit maschinellen Lernagenten","entwicklung von AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar docs-sync","o que é agente de IA","alternativas para docs-sync","docs-sync vs outros agentes","instalar docs-sync","guia de configuração docs-sync","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["как использовать docs-sync","что такое ИИ агент","альтернативы для docs-sync","docs-sync vs другие агенты","установить docs-sync","руководство по настройке docs-sync","разработка приложений ИИ","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام docs-sync","ما هو الوكيل الذكي","بديل لdocs-sync","docs-sync مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت docs-sync","دليل إعداد docs-sync","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"valuecodes","repo":"cli-agent-sandbox","repoPath":"valuecodes/cli-agent-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T11:51:54Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-sync","description":"Keep documentation consistent in this repo. Use when you need to update or propagate changes across README/AGENTS/CLAUDE/.codex docs.","bodyPreview":"# Docs Sync\n\nKeep documentation consistent and up-to-date for this single-package repo. When updating commands, paths, or tool behavior, propagate changes to all relevant doc files to avoid stale references.\n\n## Scope\n\nDocumentation files to consider:\n\n- `README.md`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n- `CLAUDE.md` (symlink to `AGENTS.md`, do not edit directly)\n- `.codex/**` (Codex agent configs and skills)\n- Any new doc-like Markdown files added later\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Find doc files**: Scan for all documentation f","body":"# Docs Sync\n\nKeep documentation consistent and up-to-date for this single-package repo. When updating commands, paths, or tool behavior, propagate changes to all relevant doc files to avoid stale references.\n\n## Scope\n\nDocumentation files to consider:\n\n- `README.md`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n- `CLAUDE.md` (symlink to `AGENTS.md`, do not edit directly)\n- `.codex/**` (Codex agent configs and skills)\n- Any new doc-like Markdown files added later\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Find doc files**: Scan for all documentation files listed in Scope.\n2. **Update references consistently**: When changing a command, path, or pattern, update ALL occurrences across all doc files. Never partially update.\n3. **Add/update explanations**: When changing a command or config, add or update a short explanation of what it does and why.\n4. **Run formatter**: Execute `pnpm format` if you touched Markdown or config files that are formatted.\n5. **Run validation (if needed)**: If documentation changes include code or tooling changes, run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test`. Skip these when edits are doc-only.\n6. **Summarize changes**: Report files changed and flag anything that needs human review.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Keep docs concise and scannable\n- Use consistent terminology across all files\n- Prefer examples over lengthy explanations\n- Update version numbers/dates if present\n- Remove obsolete sections rather than leaving stale content\n- When adding new commands, include both the command and a brief explanation\n- Do not introduce instructions that conflict with `AGENTS.md`\n- Do not edit `CLAUDE.md` directly; update `AGENTS.md` instead\n- Mermaid: wrap node text in quotes like `A[\"Label\"]` and `B{\"Question?\"}` to avoid parse issues with punctuation\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nAlways finish with a summary:\n\n- **Files changed**: List of documentation files modified\n- **What to review**: Any changes that need human verification (e.g., explanations that may need refinement, removed sections)\n- **Validation status**: Commands run, or explicitly note what was skipped\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T04:05:26.368Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing streamlined documentation management and version control.","zh":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing streamlined documentation management and version control.","ja":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing streamlined documentation management and version control.","ko":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing streamlined documentation management and version control.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan una gestión de documentación simplificada y control de versiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur CLI nécessitant une gestion de documentation simplifiée et un contrôle de version.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Dokumentenverwaltung und Versionskontrolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que necessitam de gerenciamento de documentação otimizado e controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент документации и контроль версий.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي القائمة على CLI التي تحتاج إلى إدارة وثائق مصححة ومراقبة الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent and up-to-date documentation across multiple files, including Markdown files like README.md, AGENTS.md, and Codex agent configs, using tool-calling and evals for automated syncs.","zh":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent and up-to-date documentation across multiple files, including Markdown files like README.md, AGENTS.md, and Codex agent configs, using tool-calling and evals for automated syncs.","ja":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent and up-to-date documentation across multiple files, including Markdown files like README.md, AGENTS.md, and Codex agent configs, using tool-calling and evals for automated syncs.","ko":"Empowers agents to maintain consistent and up-to-date documentation across multiple files, including Markdown files like README.md, AGENTS.md, and Codex agent configs, using tool-calling and evals for automated syncs.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener una documentación coherente y actualizada en varios archivos, incluidos archivos Markdown como README.md, AGENTS.md y configuraciones de agentes de Codex, utilizando llamadas de herramientas y evals para sincronizaciones automatizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une documentation cohérente et à jour sur plusieurs fichiers, y compris des fichiers Markdown comme README.md, AGENTS.md et configurations d''agents Codex, en utilisant des appels d''outils et des évaluations pour des synchronisations automatisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine konsistente und aktuelle Dokumentation über mehrere Dateien hinweg zu pflegen, einschließlich Markdown-Dateien wie README.md, AGENTS.md und Codex-Agenten-Konfigurationen, unter Verwendung von Tool-Aufrufen und Evaluierungen für automatisierte Synchronisierungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes mantenham documentação consistente e atualizada em vários arquivos, incluindo arquivos Markdown como README.md, AGENTS.md e configurações de agentes Codex, usando chamadas de ferramentas e evals para sincronizações automatizadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать последовательную и актуальную документацию в нескольких файлах, включая файлы Markdown, такие как README.md, AGENTS.md и конфигурации агентов Codex, используя вызов инструментов и оценки для автоматической синхронизации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على توثيق متسق وحالي عبر عدة ملفات، بما في ذلك ملفات Markdown مثل README.md و AGENTS.md وتكوينات وكيل Codex، باستخدام استدعاء أدوات وتقييمات للتزامن الآلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates for CLI sandboxes","Synchronizing changes across multiple Markdown files","Maintaining consistent references in documentation files like .codex/**"],"zh":["Automating documentation updates for CLI sandboxes","Synchronizing changes across multiple Markdown files","Maintaining consistent references in documentation files like .codex/**"],"ja":["Automating documentation updates for CLI sandboxes","Synchronizing changes across multiple Markdown files","Maintaining consistent references in documentation files like .codex/**"],"ko":["Automating documentation updates for CLI sandboxes","Synchronizing changes across multiple Markdown files","Maintaining consistent references in documentation files like .codex/**"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación para entornos de sandbox de CLI","Sincronizar los cambios en varios archivos Markdown","Mantener referencias coherentes en archivos de documentación como .codex/**"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation pour les environnements de sandbox de CLI","Synchroniser les modifications sur plusieurs fichiers Markdown","Maintenir des références cohérentes dans les fichiers de documentation tels que .codex/**"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumentenaktualisierungen für CLI-Sandbox-Umgebungen","Synchronisieren von Änderungen über mehrere Markdown-Dateien hinweg","Beibehalten konsistenter Verweise in Dokumentendateien wie .codex/**"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação para ambientes de areia CLI","Sincronizar alterações em vários arquivos Markdown","Manter referências consistentes em arquivos de documentação como .codex/**"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации для песочниц CLI","Синхронизировать изменения в нескольких файлах Markdown","Поддерживать последовательные ссылки в файлах документации, таких как .codex/**"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات الوثائق للبيئات الرملية CLI","مزامنة التغييرات عبر عدة ملفات Markdown","الحفاظ على المراجع المتسقة في ملفات الوثائق مثل .codex/**"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to single-package repositories","Requires manual propagation of changes to new doc-like Markdown files","Symlinks like CLAUDE.md must be handled carefully to avoid direct edits"],"zh":["Limited to single-package repositories","Requires manual propagation of changes to new doc-like Markdown files","Symlinks like CLAUDE.md must be handled carefully to avoid direct edits"],"ja":["Limited to single-package repositories","Requires manual propagation of changes to new doc-like Markdown files","Symlinks like CLAUDE.md must be handled carefully to avoid direct edits"],"ko":["Limited to single-package repositories","Requires manual propagation of changes to new doc-like Markdown files","Symlinks like CLAUDE.md must be handled carefully to avoid direct edits"],"es":["Limitado a repositorios de un solo paquete","Requiere propagación manual de cambios a nuevos archivos de documentación similares a Markdown","Enlaces simbólicos como CLAUDE.md deben manejarse con cuidado para evitar ediciones directas"],"fr":["Limité aux référentiels à paquet unique","Nécessite une propagation manuelle des modifications à de nouveaux fichiers de documentation similaires à Markdown","Les liens symboliques comme CLAUDE.md doivent être gérés avec soin pour éviter les éditions directes"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Einzel-Paket-Repositorys","Benötigt manuelle Weiterverbreitung von Änderungen an neuen dok-like Markdown-Dateien","Symbolische Links wie CLAUDE.md müssen sorgfältig gehandhabt werden, um direkte Bearbeitungen zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Limitado a repositórios de pacote único","Exige propagação manual de alterações para novos arquivos Markdown semelhantes a documentos","Links simbólicos como CLAUDE.md devem ser tratados com cuidado para evitar edições diretas"],"ru":["Ограничен репозиториями с одним пакетом","Требует ручной пропагации изменений в новые файлы Markdown, подобные документам","Символические ссылки, такие как CLAUDE.md, должны быть обработаны осторожно, чтобы избежать прямого редактирования"],"ar":["محدود بمخازن حزمة واحدة","يتطلب انتشار يدويا للتغييرات إلى ملفات Markdown الجديدة الشبيهة بالوثائق","الروابط الرمزية مثل CLAUDE.md يجب معاملتها بحذر لتجنب التعديلات المباشرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d416984991727151b8aad46f9fcd66521249362156d7f4bd1eed2fac4fcbc158","qualityScore":45}');
